#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 0: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/252, table:species/253, table:species/254, table:species/255, table:species/256, table:species/257, table:species/258, table:species/259, table:species/260, table:species/261, table:species/262, table:species/263, table:species/264, table:species/265, table:species/266, table:species/267, table:species/268, table:species/269, table:species/270, table:species/271, table:species/272, table:species/273, table:species/274, table:species/275, table:species/276, table:species/412, table:species/706
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 227, 229, 203
#: 0x0444c35
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/0"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/0"
msgstr ""
"Это недавно открытый покемон.\\nСейчас его изучают.\\nПодробных сведений "
"о нём пока нет."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 1: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 221, 216, 72
#: 0x0444cb2
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/1"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/1"
msgstr ""
"С самого рождения он носит\\nна спине семя. С возрастом семя тоже\\n"
"становится больше."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 2: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/2
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 211, 199, 127
#: 0x0444d12
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/2"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/2"
msgstr ""
"Если бутон на его спине начинает\\nсладко пахнуть, это признак того,\\n"
"что скоро распустится большой цветок."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 3: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/3, table:species/869, table:species/1260
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 201, 207, 141
#: 0x0444d77
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/3"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/3"
msgstr ""
"Раскрывая широкие лепестки\\nсвоего цветка и ловя солнечные лучи,\\nон "
"наполняет тело силой."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 4: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/4
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 221, 200, 134
#: 0x0444ddf
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/4"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/4"
msgstr ""
"Пламя на хвосте показывает,\\nсколько в нём жизненных сил.\\nЕсли он "
"слаб, то и пламя горит слабо."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 5: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/5
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 214, 199, 126
#: 0x0444e48
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/5"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/5"
msgstr ""
"По натуре он очень вспыльчив,\\nпоэтому постоянно ищет противников.\\n"
"Успокаивается, только когда побеждает."

#. category: code; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 6: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/6, table:species/870, table:species/871, table:species/1261
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 201, 222, 135
#: 0x0444ead
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/6"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/6"
msgstr ""
"Выдыхая мощное жаркое пламя, он может\\nрасплавить почти всё. Его "
"дыхание\\nпричиняет врагам ужасную боль."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 7: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/7
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 196, 218, 133
#: 0x0444f18
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/7"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/7"
msgstr ""
"Его панцирь, твердеющий вскоре после\\nрождения, упругий. Если в него\\n"
"ткнуть, он пружинит."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 8: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/8
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 192, 216, 143
#: 0x0444f80
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/8"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/8"
msgstr ""
"Этот покемон очень популярен у пожилых\\nлюдей, ведь его покрытый мехом "
"хвост -\\nсимвол долголетия."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 9: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/9, table:species/872, table:species/1262
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 197, 221, 110
#: 0x0444fe7
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/9"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/9"
msgstr ""
"Ракетные пушки на его панцире\\nстреляют струями воды,\\nспособными "
"пробить даже толстую сталь."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 10: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/10
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 196, 215, 127
#: 0x044504a
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/10"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/10"
msgstr ""
"На его лапках присоски, прилипающие\\nк любой поверхности. Он упорно "
"лазает\\nпо деревьям в поисках пищи."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 11: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/11
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 212, 222, 76
#: 0x04450af
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/11"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/11"
msgstr ""
"Готовясь к эволюции, он делает\\nсвой панцирь как можно твёрже,\\nчтобы "
"защитить мягкое тело."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 12: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/12, table:species/1263
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 193, 200, 120
#: 0x044510f
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/12"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/12"
msgstr ""
"Водоотталкивающая пыльца на крыльях\\nпозволяет ему собирать мёд даже\\n"
"под самым сильным дождём."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 13: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/13
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 196, 194, 130
#: 0x0445170
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/13"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/13"
msgstr ""
"Его ядовитое жало очень мощное.\\nЯркая окраска тела призвана "
"отпугивать\\nврагов."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 14: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/14
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 202, 214, 95
#: 0x04451d3
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/14"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/14"
msgstr ""
"Хотя это кокон, он может немного\\nдвигаться. При нападении выставляет\\n"
"ядовитый шип."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 15: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/15, table:species/873
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 192, 155, 169
#: 0x0445234
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/15"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/15"
msgstr ""
"Мощными ядовитыми жалами он\\nможет одолеть любого противника.\\nИногда "
"нападает роем."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 16: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/16
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 194, 198, 156
#: 0x0445296
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/16"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/16"
msgstr ""
"Он часто встречается на лугах\\nи в лесах, очень кроток и прогоняет\\n"
"врагов, поднимая крыльями песок."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 17: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/17
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 187, 191, 131
#: 0x04452fd
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/17"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/17"
msgstr ""
"Он облетает свою обширную территорию\\nв поисках добычи и сражает её\\n"
"хорошо развитыми когтями."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 18: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/18, table:species/874
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 220, 175, 167
#: 0x044535e
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/18"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/18"
msgstr ""
"Взмахивая крыльями изо всех сил,\\nПиджеот может поднять порыв ветра,\\n"
"способный согнуть высокие деревья."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 19: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/19, table:species/1020
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 222, 199, 83
#: 0x04453c8
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/19"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/19"
msgstr ""
"Он живёт везде, где есть еда,\\nи целыми днями без устали ищет,\\nчем бы "
"поживиться."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 20: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/20, table:species/1021
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 199, 202, 75
#: 0x0445427
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/20"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/20"
msgstr ""
"На задних лапах у него по три пальца.\\nПальцы соединены перепонками, "
"поэтому\\nон может переплывать реки."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 21: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/21
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 202, 213, 144
#: 0x0445480
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/21"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/21"
msgstr ""
"Хлопая короткими крыльями, он выгоняет\\nнасекомых из высокой травы, а "
"затем\\nсклёвывает их толстым коротким клювом."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 22: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/22
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 214, 194, 136
#: 0x04454ea
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/22"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/22"
msgstr ""
"Он внезапно взмывает высоко в небо,\\nа затем камнем падает вниз\\nи "
"одним махом поражает добычу."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 23: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/23
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 220, 202, 134
#: 0x0445551
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/23"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/23"
msgstr ""
"Он свободно размыкает челюсть и глотает\\nкрупную добычу целиком. Но "
"потом может\\nстать слишком тяжёлым, чтобы двигаться."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 24: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/24
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 216, 224, 103
#: 0x04455b6
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/24"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/24"
msgstr ""
"Чтобы запугать врагов, он широко\\nраздувает грудь и издаёт жуткие "
"звуки,\\nвыпуская воздух из пасти."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 25: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/25, table:species/1085, table:species/1086, table:species/1087, table:species/1088, table:species/1089, table:species/1090, table:species/1091, table:species/1092, table:species/1093, table:species/1094, table:species/1095, table:species/1096, table:species/1097, table:species/1098, table:species/1099, table:species/1264
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 210, 226, 124
#: 0x044561d
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/25"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/25"
msgstr ""
"На обеих щеках у него есть маленькие\\nэлектрические мешочки. При "
"опасности он\\nвыпускает из них электрические разряды."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 26: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/26, table:species/1022
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 215, 196, 122
#: 0x0445686
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/26"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/26"
msgstr ""
"Когда в нём накапливается\\nэлектричество, его мышцы напрягаются\\nи он "
"становится агрессивнее обычного."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 27: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/27, table:species/1023
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 184, 218, 109
#: 0x04456eb
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/27"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/27"
msgstr ""
"Он роет норы и живёт под землёй.\\nПри опасности сворачивается в "
"клубок,\\nчтобы защититься."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 28: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/28, table:species/1024
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 219, 204, 132
#: 0x044574c
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/28"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/28"
msgstr ""
"Быстро снуя туда-сюда, он ловко атакует\\nиглами на спине и острыми "
"когтями."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 29: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/29
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 206, 207, 128
#: 0x04457b5
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/29"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/29"
msgstr ""
"Яд, скрытый в её маленьком роге,\\nчрезвычайно силён. Даже крошечная\\n"
"царапина может оказаться смертельной."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 30: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/30
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 180, 182, 114
#: 0x044581b
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/30"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/30"
msgstr ""
"У неё спокойный и заботливый нрав.\\nЕё рог растёт медленно,\\nпоэтому "
"она предпочитает не сражаться."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 31: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/31
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 209, 199, 138
#: 0x0445875
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/31"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/31"
msgstr ""
"Своим крепким чешуйчатым телом она\\nзакрывает вход в гнездо и защищает\\n"
"детёнышей от хищников."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 32: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/32
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 193, 222, 160
#: 0x04458db
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/32"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/32"
msgstr ""
"Он следит за всем вокруг, подняв уши\\nнад травой. Почуяв малейшую "
"опасность,\\nон нападает первым."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 33: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/33
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 202, 198, 140
#: 0x044594a
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/33"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/33"
msgstr ""
"Он легко приходит в ярость\\nи, разозлившись, вонзает во врагов рог,\\n"
"впрыскивая сильный яд."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 34: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/34
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 194, 192, 156
#: 0x04459b0
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/34"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/34"
msgstr ""
"В бою он размахивает большим хвостом.\\nЕсли враг вздрагивает,\\nон "
"таранит его своим крепким телом."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 35: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/35
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 209, 191, 133
#: 0x0445a18
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/35"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/35"
msgstr ""
"Очаровательные повадки и голос\\nделают его очень популярным. Но этого\\n"
"милого покемона редко можно встретить."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 36: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/36
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 208, 213, 87
#: 0x0445a7b
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/36"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/36"
msgstr ""
"Благодаря острому слуху\\nон слышит звуки издалека.\\nОбычно прячется в "
"тихих местах."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 37: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/37, table:species/1025
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 214, 199, 50
#: 0x0445adb
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/37"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/37"
msgstr ""
"Пока он молод, у него шесть роскошных\\nхвостов. Подрастая, он "
"отращивает\\nещё несколько."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 38: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/38, table:species/1026
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 197, 202, 116
#: 0x0445b33
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/38"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/38"
msgstr ""
"По некоторым легендам, каждый\\nиз его девяти хвостов наделён\\nсвоей "
"особой мистической силой."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 39: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/39
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 216, 227, 101
#: 0x0445b94
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/39"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/39"
msgstr ""
"Он очаровывает врагов огромными\\nкруглыми глазами, а затем усыпляет "
"их,\\nнапевая успокаивающую мелодию."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 40: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/40
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 203, 200, 153
#: 0x0445bfa
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/40"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/40"
msgstr ""
"Его мех очень тонкий, густой и мягкий.\\nИзумительно приятный на ощупь,\\n"
"он создаёт ощущение роскоши."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 41: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/41
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 204, 223, 123
#: 0x0445c62
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/41"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/41"
msgstr ""
"У него нет глаз. Чтобы порхать\\nв темноте, он ориентируется по эху\\n"
"своих ультразвуковых криков."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 42: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/42
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 197, 208, 166
#: 0x0445ccb
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/42"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/42"
msgstr ""
"За один раз он может выпить более\\n300 мл крови. Если выпьет слишком\\n"
"много, тяжелеет и летает неуклюже."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 43: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/43
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 224, 224, 120
#: 0x0445d35
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/43"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/43"
msgstr ""
"Научное название - “Oddium Wanderus”.\\nГоворят, что ночью он проходит\\n"
"на двух корнях почти 300 м."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 44: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/44
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 204, 226, 122
#: 0x0445da1
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/44"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/44"
msgstr ""
"То, что кажется слюной, - на самом деле\\nсладкий мёд. Он очень липкий и "
"намертво\\nпристаёт, если его коснуться."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 45: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/45
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 187, 208, 164
#: 0x0445e08
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/45"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/45"
msgstr ""
"У него самые большие лепестки в мире.\\nС каждым его шагом с лепестков "
"слетают\\nгустые облака ядовитой пыльцы."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 46: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/46
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 214, 220, 115
#: 0x0445e70
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/46"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/46"
msgstr ""
"Он рождается осыпанным грибными\\nспорами. По мере того как он растёт,\\n"
"на спине у него прорастают грибы."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 47: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/47
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 206, 211, 167
#: 0x0445ed7
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/47"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/47"
msgstr ""
"Он держится в основном в тёмных сырых\\nместах. Это выбор не самого "
"жука,\\nа больших грибов у него на спине."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 48: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/48
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 208, 198, 91
#: 0x0445f43
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/48"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/48"
msgstr ""
"Его глаза также служат радарами.\\nОн ловит и ест мелких насекомых,\\n"
"которые прячутся в темноте."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 49: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/49
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 195, 205, 153
#: 0x0445fa1
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/49"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/49"
msgstr ""
"Его крылья покрыты похожими на пыль\\nчешуйками. С каждым взмахом крыльев "
"он\\nрассыпает очень ядовитую пыль."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 50: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/50, table:species/1027
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 194, 223, 180
#: 0x044600a
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/50"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/50"
msgstr ""
"Он роет ходы неглубоко под землёй.\\nЗа ним остаётся полоса вспученной\\n"
"земли, так что его легко заметить."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 51: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/51, table:species/1028
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 212, 211, 146
#: 0x0446079
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/51"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/51"
msgstr ""
"Три его головы независимо друг от друга\\nдвигаются вверх и вниз, "
"разрыхляя почву\\nвокруг, чтобы ему было легче рыть."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 52: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/52, table:species/1029, table:species/1212, table:species/1265
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 164, 219, 130
#: 0x04460e3
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/52"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/52"
msgstr ""
"Он обожает всё блестящее.\\nОсобенно любит монеты:\\nподбирает их и "
"тайком копит."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 53: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/53, table:species/1030
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 217, 206, 96
#: 0x0446144
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/53"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/53"
msgstr ""
"Многие обожают его за утончённый вид.\\nОднако он может наброситься с "
"когтями\\nпо малейшему поводу."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 54: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/54
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 221, 194, 169
#: 0x04461a7
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/54"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/54"
msgstr ""
"Его постоянно мучает головная боль.\\nКогда она усиливается, он "
"начинает\\nпускать в ход таинственные силы."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 55: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/55
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 201, 225, 83
#: 0x0446214
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/55"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/55"
msgstr ""
"Когда он плывёт на полной скорости,\\nзагребая длинными перепончатыми "
"лапами,\\nего лоб почему-то начинает светиться."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 56: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/56
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 176, 217, 210
#: 0x0446274
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/56"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/56"
msgstr ""
"Лёгкий и проворный, со свирепым нравом.\\nРазозлившись, он впадает в "
"неудержимое\\nбешенство."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 57: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/57
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 213, 221, 112
#: 0x04462e6
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/57"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/57"
msgstr ""
"Он злится, если посмотреть ему в глаза,\\nи ещё сильнее - если убегать. А "
"если\\nего победить, он свирепеет ещё больше."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 58: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/58, table:species/1234
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 223, 195, 122
#: 0x044634c
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/58"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/58"
msgstr ""
"Он невероятно предан и бесстрашно лает\\nна любого противника, чтобы "
"защитить\\nсвоего тренера от опасности."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 59: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/59, table:species/1235
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 199, 221, 117
#: 0x04463b2
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/59"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/59"
msgstr ""
"Его великолепный лай полон величия.\\nЛюбой, кто его слышит,\\nневольно "
"падает ниц."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 60: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/60
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 210, 209, 115
#: 0x0446417
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/60"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/60"
msgstr ""
"Его кожа такая тонкая, что видны\\nвнутренние органы. Он с трудом ходит\\n"
"на недавно выросших лапках."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 61: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/61
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 209, 187, 98
#: 0x044647e
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/61"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/61"
msgstr ""
"Спиральный узор на его животе слегка\\nколышется. Если долго на него "
"смотреть,\\nначинает клонить в сон."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 62: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/62
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 215, 220, 104
#: 0x04464dc
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/62"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/62"
msgstr ""
"Благодаря хорошо развитым рукам и ногам\\nон может на долю секунды "
"пробежать\\nпо поверхности воды."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 63: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/63
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 165, 184, 141
#: 0x0446540
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/63"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/63"
msgstr ""
"Он спит по 18 часов в сутки.\\nДаже во сне он использует\\nразные "
"экстрасенсорные способности."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 64: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/64
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 174, 193, 117
#: 0x044659b
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/64"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/64"
msgstr ""
"Он смотрит на свою серебряную ложку,\\nчтобы сосредоточиться.\\nПри этом "
"он излучает больше альфа-волн."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 65: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/65, table:species/875
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 211, 201, 168
#: 0x04465f7
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/65"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/65"
msgstr ""
"Физические атаки он не очень любит,\\nа врагов побеждает, вволю пуская в "
"ход\\nэкстрасенсорные способности."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 66: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/66
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 214, 187, 150
#: 0x0446664
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/66"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/66"
msgstr ""
"Он невелик ростом, но так силён,\\nчто может легко поднять и бросить "
"сразу\\nнесколько Геодудов."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 67: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/67
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 206, 211, 149
#: 0x04466ca
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/67"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/67"
msgstr ""
"Его могучее тело никогда не устаёт.\\nОн помогает людям в работе,\\n"
"например переносит тяжёлые грузы."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 68: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/68, table:species/1266
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 213, 199, 146
#: 0x0446732
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/68"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/68"
msgstr ""
"Быстро размахивая четырьмя руками,\\nон без конца бьёт противников "
"кулаками\\nи ребром ладони со всех сторон."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 69: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/69
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 212, 196, 139
#: 0x044679b
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/69"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/69"
msgstr ""
"Чтобы пополнить запас воды, он глубоко\\nзарывает ноги в землю. Пока он "
"так\\nукоренён, ему не сбежать от врагов."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 70: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/70
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 191, 195, 114
#: 0x0446803
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/70"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/70"
msgstr ""
"Листья служат ему лезвиями, которыми\\nон режет врагов. Он плюётся "
"жидкостью,\\nрастворяющей всё на свете."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 71: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/71
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 186, 173, 188
#: 0x0446862
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/71"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/71"
msgstr ""
"Кислота, в которой растворилось\\nмного добычи, становится слаще\\nи "
"привлекает жертв ещё лучше."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 72: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/72
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 179, 201, 204
#: 0x04468c8
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/72"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/72"
msgstr ""
"Он бесцельно дрейфует в океане. В воде\\nего очень трудно разглядеть, и "
"его\\nмогут не заметить, пока он не ужалит."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 73: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/73
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 200, 224, 137
#: 0x0446938
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/73"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/73"
msgstr ""
"У него 80 свободно двигающихся щупалец.\\nОни жалят, вызывая отравление и "
"острую,\\nпронзительную боль."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 74: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/74, table:species/1031
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 190, 206, 124
#: 0x04469a1
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/74"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/74"
msgstr ""
"В покое он ничем не отличается\\nот камня. Если случайно на него\\n"
"наступить, он в гневе машет кулаками."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 75: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/75, table:species/1032
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 192, 211, 138
#: 0x0446a06
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/75"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/75"
msgstr ""
"В походе по горным тропам нужно быть\\nначеку: по ним может скатиться\\n"
"Гравелер, не сбавляя скорости."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 76: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/76, table:species/1033
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 226, 211, 154
#: 0x0446a6c
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/76"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/76"
msgstr ""
"Он заключён в твёрдый панцирь,\\nпрочный, как каменные плиты. Раз в год\\n"
"он сбрасывает кожу, чтобы вырасти."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 77: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/77, table:species/1213
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 204, 208, 140
#: 0x0446ada
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/77"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/77"
msgstr ""
"Сразу после рождения он плохо бегает.\\nПостепенно он набирает "
"скорость,\\nгоняясь за родителями."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 78: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/78, table:species/1214
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 212, 189, 102
#: 0x0446b42
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/78"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/78"
msgstr ""
"Он движется так невероятно быстро,\\nчто на полном скаку его четыре "
"копыта\\nедва касаются земли."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 79: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/79, table:species/1215
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 163, 195, 159
#: 0x0446ba0
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/79"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/79"
msgstr ""
"Он лениво и бездумно сидит у воды.\\nЕсли что-то укусит его за хвост,\\n"
"он не заметит этого и за целый день."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 80: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/80, table:species/876, table:species/1216
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 212, 209, 86
#: 0x0446c02
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/80"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/80"
msgstr ""
"Обычно он туго соображает, но, похоже,\\nна него находит вдохновение, "
"если\\nШеллдер на хвосте крепко его кусает."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 81: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/81
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 194, 205, 150
#: 0x0446c62
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/81"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/81"
msgstr ""
"Он передвигается, постоянно паря\\nв воздухе. Из блоков по бокам он\\n"
"испускает Электроволны и не только."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 82: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/82
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 189, 184, 175
#: 0x0446cc9
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/82"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/82"
msgstr ""
"Связка из нескольких Магнемайтов.\\nЭтот покемон испускает мощные\\n"
"магнитные волны высокого напряжения."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 83: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/83, table:species/1217
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 223, 210, 116
#: 0x0446d2f
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/83"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/83"
msgstr ""
"Он всегда расхаживает, зажав в клюве\\nстебель растения. Стебель нужен "
"ему\\nдля постройки гнезда."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 84: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/84
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 211, 223, 113
#: 0x0446d97
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/84"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/84"
msgstr ""
"Поочерёдно поднимая и опуская\\nдве головы, он удерживает равновесие\\nи "
"бежит устойчивее."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 85: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/85
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 205, 214, 114
#: 0x0446dff
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/85"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/85"
msgstr ""
"Стоит одной из голов поесть,\\nкак остальные тоже насыщаются\\nи "
"перестают ссориться."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 86: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/86
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 221, 220, 213
#: 0x0446e63
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/86"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/86"
msgstr ""
"Чем холоднее, тем ему лучше.\\nОн радостно плавает в таких холодных\\n"
"океанах, что в них полно льдин."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 87: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/87
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 214, 193, 110
#: 0x0446edd
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/87"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/87"
msgstr ""
"Его обтекаемое тело почти\\nне встречает сопротивления воды.\\nЧем ниже "
"температура, тем он резвее."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 88: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/88, table:species/1034
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 207, 190, 160
#: 0x0446f3f
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/88"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/88"
msgstr ""
"При движении он теряет кусочки тела,\\nиз которых появляются новые "
"Граймеры.\\nОт этого зловоние вокруг усиливается."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 89: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/89, table:species/1035
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 214, 205, 161
#: 0x0446fa8
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/89"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/89"
msgstr ""
"Его тело состоит из сильного яда.\\nТот, кто случайно его коснётся,\\n"
"сляжет с лихорадкой."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 90: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/90
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 215, 197, 106
#: 0x0447014
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/90"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/90"
msgstr ""
"Он заключён в раковину,\\nкоторая твёрже алмаза.\\nОднако внутри он на "
"удивление нежный."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 91: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/91
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 211, 200, 207
#: 0x0447077
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/91"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/91"
msgstr ""
"Его раковина невероятно твёрдая:\\nеё не разбить даже бомбой. Раковина\\n"
"открывается, только когда он атакует."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 92: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/92
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 222, 205, 126
#: 0x04470ea
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/92"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/92"
msgstr ""
"Благодаря газообразному телу он\\nпроникает куда угодно.\\nОднако его "
"может сдуть ветром."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 93: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/93
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 191, 217, 84
#: 0x0447152
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/93"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/93"
msgstr ""
"В кромешной тьме,\\nгде ничего не видно, таится Хонтер,\\nбесшумно "
"выслеживая очередную жертву."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 94: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/94, table:species/877, table:species/1267
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 201, 225, 155
#: 0x04471b2
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/94"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/94"
msgstr ""
"Он крадёт тепло у всего вокруг.\\nЕсли вдруг повеяло холодом, значит,\\n"
"точно появился Генгар."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 95: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/95
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 227, 198, 104
#: 0x044721f
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/95"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/95"
msgstr ""
"Он прокладывает путь под землёй,\\nизвиваясь всем телом. Когда он роет,\\n"
"громовой гул разносится далеко вокруг."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 96: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/96
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 186, 197, 198
#: 0x0447282
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/96"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/96"
msgstr ""
"Он помнит каждый съеденный сон.\\nСны взрослых он ест редко,\\nпотому что "
"детские гораздо вкуснее."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 97: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/97
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 222, 222, 94
#: 0x04472ee
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/97"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/97"
msgstr ""
"Он всегда держит маятник\\nи раскачивает его в ровном ритме,\\nнагоняя "
"сонливость на всех вокруг."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 98: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/98
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 223, 229, 75
#: 0x0447353
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/98"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/98"
msgstr ""
"Он встречается у моря.\\nЕсли его большие клешни вырвать\\nиз суставов, "
"они отрастают снова."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 99: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/99, table:species/1268
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 225, 232, 89
#: 0x04473b5
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/99"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/99"
msgstr ""
"Он с трудом поднимает свою массивную,\\nразросшуюся клешню. Из-за её "
"размера\\nему сложно как следует прицелиться."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 100: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/100, table:species/1236
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 206, 185, 71
#: 0x044741e
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/100"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/100"
msgstr ""
"Форма жизни неизвестной природы.\\nГоворят, что этот покемон издаёт "
"Визг\\nили внезапно применяет Самоподрыв."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 101: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/101, table:species/1237
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 206, 216, 110
#: 0x0447476
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/101"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/101"
msgstr ""
"Он взрывается даже\\nот слабого раздражителя.\\nЕго боятся и прозвали "
"“Шаром-бомбой”."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 102: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/102, table:species/1036
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 206, 202, 175
#: 0x04474da
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/102"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/102"
msgstr ""
"С виду он похож на какие-то яйца,\\nно выяснилось, что эта форма жизни\\n"
"ближе к семенам растений."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 103: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/103, table:species/1037
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 198, 203, 109
#: 0x0447547
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/103"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/103"
msgstr ""
"Три его головы думают независимо\\nдруг от друга. Однако они дружны\\nи, "
"похоже, никогда не ссорятся."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 104: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/104, table:species/1038
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 195, 207, 106
#: 0x04475a6
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/104"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/104"
msgstr ""
"Когда ему грустно или одиноко,\\nчереп у него на голове дрожит, а сам\\n"
"он издаёт жалобный, скорбный звук."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 105: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/105, table:species/1039
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 224, 212, 166
#: 0x0447607
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/105"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/105"
msgstr ""
"Он собирает кости в неизвестном месте.\\nПоговаривают, что где-то в мире "
"есть\\nкладбище Мароваков."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 106: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/106
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 201, 177, 113
#: 0x0447676
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/106"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/106"
msgstr ""
"Когда он раз за разом бьёт ногами,\\nобе ноги вытягиваются ещё сильнее,\\n"
"чтобы достать убегающего врага."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 107: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/107
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 192, 191, 122
#: 0x04476d4
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/107"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/107"
msgstr ""
"Чтобы усилить все кулачные приёмы,\\nон вращает руками за миг до удара."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 108: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/108
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 203, 211, 155
#: 0x0447734
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/108"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/108"
msgstr ""
"Его язык вдвое длиннее тела.\\nОн двигает им, как рукой,\\nчтобы хватать "
"еду и атаковать."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 109: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/109, table:species/1218
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 193, 219, 96
#: 0x044779e
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/109"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/109"
msgstr ""
"Ядовитые газы внутри него чуть легче\\nвоздуха, поэтому он немного "
"парит\\nнад землёй."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 110: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/110, table:species/1219
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 218, 216, 108
#: 0x0447800
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/110"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/110"
msgstr ""
"Когда один из Коффингов-близнецов\\nраздувается, другой сдувается. "
"Визинг\\nпостоянно смешивает ядовитые газы."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 111: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/111
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 201, 197, 135
#: 0x0447867
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/111"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/111"
msgstr ""
"Из-за четырёх коротких ног он плохо\\nповорачивает. Мчаться и таранить "
"он\\nможет только в одном направлении."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 112: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/112
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 186, 196, 144
#: 0x04478cc
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/112"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/112"
msgstr ""
"Его мозг развился, когда он начал\\nходить на задних ногах. Толстая "
"шкура\\nзащищает его даже в магме."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 113: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/113
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 184, 198, 147
#: 0x044792f
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/113"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/113"
msgstr ""
"Добрый покемон, который несёт\\nочень питательные яйца и делится ими\\nс "
"ранеными покемонами или людьми."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 114: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/114
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 199, 206, 92
#: 0x0447992
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/114"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/114"
msgstr ""
"Лозы, окутывающие всё его тело,\\nпостоянно колышутся.\\nЭто сильно "
"нервирует врагов."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 115: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/115, table:species/878
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 223, 207, 165
#: 0x04479f0
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/115"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/115"
msgstr ""
"Если вокруг безопасно, детёныш\\nвылезает из сумки на животе поиграть.\\n"
"Взрослый не спускает с малыша глаз."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 116: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/116
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 226, 227, 82
#: 0x0447a5d
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/116"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/116"
msgstr ""
"Он держит равновесие с помощью хвоста,\\nзакрученного спиралью.\\nМожет "
"брызгать чернилами изо рта."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 117: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/117
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 221, 219, 126
#: 0x0447ac3
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/117"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/117"
msgstr ""
"Исследование его клеток выявило ген,\\nкоторого нет у Хорси.\\nЭто "
"открытие бурно обсуждали."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 118: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/118
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 181, 210, 105
#: 0x0447b2c
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/118"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/118"
msgstr "В период нереста они грациозно плавают\\nв поисках идеальной пары."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 119: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/119
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 200, 212, 75
#: 0x0447b8a
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/119"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/119"
msgstr ""
"Рог на его голове острый, как сверло.\\nОн высверливает в валуне дыру\\nи "
"устраивает там гнездо."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 120: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/120
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 177, 199, 120
#: 0x0447be6
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/120"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/120"
msgstr ""
"Ночью центр его тела медленно мерцает\\nв том же ритме, что и сердце "
"человека."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 121: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/121
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 193, 220, 157
#: 0x0447c43
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/121"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/121"
msgstr ""
"У этого покемона геометрическое тело.\\nПоэтому местные жители "
"подозревают,\\nчто это инопланетное существо."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 122: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/122, table:species/1220
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 211, 207, 59
#: 0x0447cad
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/122"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/122"
msgstr ""
"Он искусный мим от рождения,\\nа с возрастом обретает способность\\n"
"создавать невидимые предметы."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 123: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/123
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 206, 193, 159
#: 0x0447d09
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/123"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/123"
msgstr ""
"В движении он оставляет лишь размытый\\nслед. Если он прячется в траве,\\n"
"защитная окраска делает его невидимым."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 124: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/124
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 217, 180, 128
#: 0x0447d74
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/124"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/124"
msgstr ""
"Он говорит на языке, похожем\\nна человеческий. Однако общается он,\\n"
"по-видимому, с помощью танца."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 125: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/125
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 215, 203, 129
#: 0x0447dd6
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/125"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/125"
msgstr ""
"Он любит питаться сильным током. Иногда\\nпоявляется у крупных "
"электростанций\\nи в подобных местах."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 126: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/126
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 205, 224, 197
#: 0x0447e3c
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/126"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/126"
msgstr ""
"Обжигающий огонь, который выдыхает\\nМагмар, окружает его тело маревом,\\n"
"и покемона трудно разглядеть."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 127: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/127, table:species/879
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 205, 219, 87
#: 0x0447eaf
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/127"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/127"
msgstr ""
"Он атакует, яростно размахивая\\nдлинными рогами-клешнями.\\nВ холода "
"прячется в глубине лесов."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 128: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/128
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 205, 196, 139
#: 0x0447f11
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/128"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/128"
msgstr ""
"Хлеща себя тремя хвостами,\\nон распаляет боевой дух, а затем\\nбросается "
"вперёд на полной скорости."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 129: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/129
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 197, 207, 109
#: 0x0447f7a
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/129"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/129"
msgstr ""
"Этого слабого и жалкого покемона легко\\nсносит по реке сильным течением."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 130: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/130, table:species/880
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 209, 199, 66
#: 0x0447fda
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/130"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/130"
msgstr ""
"Начав буйствовать, Гиарадос\\nсжигает всё дотла, даже во время\\nсильного "
"шторма."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 131: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/131, table:species/1269
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 196, 192, 154
#: 0x0448033
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/131"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/131"
msgstr ""
"Он перевозит людей на спине\\nчерез море. В хорошем настроении\\nон может "
"петь чарующим голосом."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 132: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/132
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 203, 194, 114
#: 0x0448099
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/132"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/132"
msgstr ""
"Его способность к превращению\\nбезупречна. Но если его рассмешить,\\nон "
"не может сохранить маскировку."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 133: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/133, table:species/1270
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 194, 201, 113
#: 0x04480fc
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/133"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/133"
msgstr ""
"Очень редкий покемон, который\\nможет эволюционировать по-разному\\nв "
"зависимости от внешних воздействий."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 134: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/134
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 216, 220, 166
#: 0x044815b
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/134"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/134"
msgstr ""
"Его клетки по составу похожи\\nна молекулы воды. Поэтому, растворяясь\\nв "
"воде, он становится невидимым."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 135: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/135
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 210, 203, 90
#: 0x04481cd
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/135"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/135"
msgstr ""
"Когда он заряжается электричеством,\\nкаждый волосок на его теле\\nрезко "
"встаёт дыбом."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 136: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/136
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 198, 203, 115
#: 0x044822c
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/136"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/136"
msgstr ""
"Он распушает меховой воротник,\\nчтобы снизить температуру тела,\\n"
"которая может достигать 900 градусов."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 137: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/137
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 207, 204, 154
#: 0x04482a0
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/137"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/137"
msgstr ""
"Используя самые передовые технологии,\\nучёные наконец смогли создать\\n"
"первого искусственного покемона."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 138: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/138
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 196, 210, 111
#: 0x044830c
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/138"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/138"
msgstr ""
"В доисторические времена он плавал\\nу морского дна, питаясь "
"планктоном.\\nЕго окаменелости иногда находят."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 139: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/139
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 171, 225, 198
#: 0x044836f
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/139"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/139"
msgstr ""
"Несмотря на сильные клыки и щупальца,\\nон вымер, когда из-за тяжёлой "
"раковины\\nне смог больше ловить добычу."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 140: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/140
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 187, 191, 177
#: 0x04483de
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/140"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/140"
msgstr ""
"Изредка находят особей,\\nкоторые окаменели,\\nпока прятались на дне "
"океана."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 141: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/141
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 205, 204, 123
#: 0x0448445
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/141"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/141"
msgstr ""
"В воде он поджимает конечности,\\nстановясь компактнее,\\nа затем быстро "
"плывёт, виляя панцирем."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 142: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/142, table:species/881
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 221, 208, 116
#: 0x04484aa
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/142"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/142"
msgstr ""
"Свирепый покемон из далёкого прошлого.\\nПо-видимому, он летал,\\nпаря на "
"расправленных крыльях."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 143: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/143, table:species/1271
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 209, 221, 156
#: 0x0448511
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/143"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/143"
msgstr ""
"Наевшись, он становится таким вялым,\\nчто даже пальцем не шевельнёт, "
"поэтому\\nпрыгать на его животе безопасно."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 144: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/144, table:species/1221
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 202, 199, 153
#: 0x0448580
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/144"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/144"
msgstr ""
"Говорят, что великолепные, словно\\nпрозрачные крылья этого "
"легендарного\\nпокемона-птицы сделаны изо льда."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 145: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/145, table:species/1222
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 191, 199, 88
#: 0x04485e8
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/145"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/145"
msgstr ""
"Этот легендарный покемон-птица\\nвызывает свирепые грозы,\\nвзмахивая "
"сверкающими крыльями."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 146: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/146, table:species/1223
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 173, 198, 184
#: 0x0448643
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/146"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/146"
msgstr ""
"Этот легендарный покемон с каждым\\nвзмахом крыльев рассыпает тлеющие "
"угли.\\nЭто захватывающее зрелище."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 147: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/147
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 197, 212, 87
#: 0x04486ac
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/147"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/147"
msgstr ""
"Этот покемон полон жизненной энергии.\\nОн постоянно сбрасывает кожу\\nи "
"становится всё больше."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 148: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/148
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 211, 212, 109
#: 0x044870b
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/148"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/148"
msgstr ""
"Говорят, что, если он излучает ауру\\nвсем телом, погода тут же "
"начинает\\nменяться."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 149: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/149
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 204, 225, 116
#: 0x044876f
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/149"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/149"
msgstr ""
"У этого морского покемона внушительное\\nтелосложение, позволяющее ему "
"свободно\\nи без труда летать над бушующим морем."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 150: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/150, table:species/882, table:species/883
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 184, 197, 165
#: 0x04487d6
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/150"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/150"
msgstr ""
"Покемон, чей генетический код\\nмногократно рекомбинировали ради\\n"
"исследований. В итоге он стал свирепым."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 151: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/151
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 212, 206, 112
#: 0x044883b
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/151"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/151"
msgstr ""
"Он может использовать любые приёмы,\\nпоэтому многие учёные считают Мью\\n"
"прародителем покемонов."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 152: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/152
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 198, 222, 143
#: 0x044889e
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/152"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/152"
msgstr ""
"От листа на его голове исходит\\nнежный сладкий аромат. Он кроткий\\nи "
"любит греться в солнечных лучах."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 153: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/153
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 193, 216, 100
#: 0x0448907
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/153"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/153"
msgstr ""
"От его шеи исходит пряный аромат.\\nЭтот аромат бодрит\\nи "
"восстанавливает здоровье."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 154: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/154
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 191, 202, 136
#: 0x0448966
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/154"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/154"
msgstr ""
"Дыхание Меганиума способно оживлять\\nзасохшую траву и растения.\\nОно "
"возвращает им здоровье."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 155: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/155
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 212, 218, 110
#: 0x04489c8
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/155"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/155"
msgstr ""
"Он робок и всегда сворачивается\\nв клубок. При нападении защищается,\\n"
"разжигая пламя на спине."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 156: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/156
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 191, 173, 151
#: 0x0448a2f
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/156"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/156"
msgstr ""
"Перед боем он поворачивается\\nк противнику спиной, чтобы показать,\\nкак "
"яростно пылает его огонь."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 157: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/157, table:species/1238
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 201, 186, 141
#: 0x0448a91
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/157"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/157"
msgstr ""
"Когда его ярость достигает предела,\\nон раскаляется так, что всё,\\nчто "
"его касается, мгновенно вспыхивает."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 158: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/158
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 179, 194, 167
#: 0x0448af5
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/158"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/158"
msgstr ""
"Этот задира кусает любой движущийся\\nпредмет, который видит. "
"Поворачиваться\\nк нему спиной не рекомендуется."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 159: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/159
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 181, 207, 142
#: 0x0448b5a
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/159"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/159"
msgstr ""
"Атакуя, он широко раскрывает\\nогромную пасть. Если при укусе у него\\n"
"выпадают клыки, они отрастают снова."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 160: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/160
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 195, 202, 157
#: 0x0448bbe
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/160"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/160"
msgstr ""
"Хотя у него массивное тело,\\nмощные задние лапы позволяют ему\\nбыстро "
"передвигаться даже по суше."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 161: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/161
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 202, 220, 130
#: 0x0448c25
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/161"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/161"
msgstr ""
"Он встаёт на хвост, чтобы видеть далеко\\nвокруг. Заметив врага, он "
"громко кричит,\\nпредупреждая сородичей."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 162: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/162
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 210, 198, 178
#: 0x0448c8e
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/162"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/162"
msgstr ""
"Он живёт в узких норах, подходящих\\nего стройному телу. Чем глубже "
"гнёзда,\\nтем больше они похожи на лабиринт."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 163: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/163
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 186, 198, 179
#: 0x0448cfb
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/163"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/163"
msgstr ""
"У него идеальное чувство ритма.\\nЧто бы ни случилось, он держит\\nровный "
"темп, в такт наклоняя голову."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 164: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/164
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 204, 176, 104
#: 0x0448d65
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/164"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/164"
msgstr ""
"Когда ему нужно подумать,\\nон поворачивает голову на 180 градусов,\\n"
"чтобы обострить ум."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 165: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/165
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 213, 211, 107
#: 0x0448dc1
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/165"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/165"
msgstr ""
"Он так робок, что не может\\nдвигаться без роя сородичей.\\nСвои чувства "
"он передаёт запахом."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 166: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/166
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 200, 224, 112
#: 0x0448e28
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/166"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/166"
msgstr ""
"Днём, когда становится тепло,\\nон заворачивается в большой лист\\nи "
"погружается в глубокий сон."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 167: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/167
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 214, 213, 119
#: 0x0448e8d
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/167"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/167"
msgstr ""
"Он днями сидит в паутине, замерев\\nв одной позе, и ждёт, когда добыча,\\n"
"ничего не подозревая, подойдёт ближе."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 168: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/168
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 204, 211, 132
#: 0x0448ef5
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/168"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/168"
msgstr ""
"Он выпускает нить не только сзади,\\nно и изо рта. Трудно понять,\\nгде у "
"него перёд, а где зад."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 169: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/169
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 215, 211, 156
#: 0x0448f5d
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/169"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/169"
msgstr ""
"Благодаря четырём крыльям он летает\\nбыстрее и тише, поэтому может\\n"
"незаметно подкрадываться к добыче."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 170: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/170
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 171, 213, 165
#: 0x0448fcb
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/170"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/170"
msgstr ""
"Он пускает положительный\\nи отрицательный заряды между кончиками\\nдвух "
"усиков и бьёт врагов током."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 171: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/171
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 213, 226, 92
#: 0x0449033
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/171"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/171"
msgstr ""
"Он ослепляет добычу яркой вспышкой\\nсвета, а затем разом заглатывает\\n"
"обездвиженную жертву."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 172: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/172, table:species/1100
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 214, 221, 116
#: 0x0449098
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/172"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/172"
msgstr ""
"Несмотря на малый рост, он может\\nударить током даже взрослого "
"человека.\\nНо при этом и сам удивляется."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 173: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/173
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 200, 216, 48
#: 0x0449101
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/173"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/173"
msgstr ""
"Когда ночное небо освещают\\nмногочисленные метеоры, Клеффу,\\nкак ни "
"странно, видят чаще обычного."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 174: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/174
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 218, 210, 51
#: 0x044915a
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/174"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/174"
msgstr ""
"Благодаря очень гибкому и упругому телу\\nон без конца подпрыгивает -\\n"
"когда угодно и где угодно."

#. category: script; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 175: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/175
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 229, 228, 50
#: 0x04491b4
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/175"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/175"
msgstr ""
"Пословица гласит, что счастье придёт\\nк тому, кто сумеет поднять на "
"ноги\\nспящего Тогэпи."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 176: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/176
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 222, 209, 90
#: 0x0449212
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/176"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/176"
msgstr ""
"Если рядом нет добрых людей,\\nон падает духом. Может парить\\nв воздухе, "
"не взмахивая крыльями."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 177: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/177
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 224, 230, 113
#: 0x0449277
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/177"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/177"
msgstr ""
"Крылья у него ещё не отросли,\\nпоэтому он передвигается прыжками.\\n"
"Всегда во что-то всматривается."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 178: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/178
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 209, 189, 157
#: 0x04492e2
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/178"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/178"
msgstr ""
"Говорят, что он стоит неподвижно\\nи тихо, потому что видит прошлое\\nи "
"будущее одновременно."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 179: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/179
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 200, 222, 118
#: 0x044934a
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/179"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/179"
msgstr ""
"Его руно растёт без остановки.\\nЛетом он полностью линяет,\\nно за "
"неделю руно отрастает снова."

#. category: script; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 180: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/180
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 202, 186, 191
#: 0x04493af
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/180"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/180"
msgstr ""
"Даже пушок не растёт на резиновых\\nучастках его кожи: они не проводят\\n"
"ток и защищают от удара током."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 181: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/181, table:species/884
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 202, 214, 157
#: 0x044941b
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/181"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/181"
msgstr ""
"Когда темнеет, свет его яркого,\\nблестящего хвоста виден издалека\\nна "
"поверхности океана."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 182: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/182
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 191, 216, 188
#: 0x0449487
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/182"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/182"
msgstr ""
"Его много в тропических краях.\\nКогда он танцует, лепестки трутся\\nдруг "
"о друга и приятно звенят."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 183: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/183
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 201, 202, 105
#: 0x04494f8
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/183"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/183"
msgstr ""
"Мех на его теле от природы\\nотталкивает воду. Он остаётся сухим,\\nдаже "
"когда играет в воде."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 184: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/184
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 211, 214, 93
#: 0x0449557
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/184"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/184"
msgstr ""
"Играя в воде, он сворачивает\\nвытянутые уши, чтобы они\\nне намокли "
"изнутри."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 185: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/185
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 208, 186, 163
#: 0x04495ba
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/185"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/185"
msgstr ""
"Он маскируется под дерево, чтобы\\nизбежать нападения. Воду он "
"ненавидит,\\nпоэтому исчезает, едва пойдёт дождь."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 186: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/186
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 226, 197, 72
#: 0x0449625
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/186"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/186"
msgstr ""
"Если Поливаги и Поливирлы слышат его\\nраскатистый голос, они в ответ\\n"
"собираются отовсюду."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 187: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/187
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 208, 220, 96
#: 0x0449682
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/187"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/187"
msgstr ""
"Его тело такое лёгкое, что ему\\nприходится крепко цепляться ногами\\nза "
"землю, чтобы его не унесло ветром."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 188: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/188
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 188, 219, 113
#: 0x04496e5
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/188"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/188"
msgstr ""
"Он расцветает, когда теплеет.\\nПарит в небе, чтобы впитать\\nкак можно "
"больше солнечного света."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 189: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/189
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 214, 226, 127
#: 0x0449746
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/189"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/189"
msgstr ""
"Он летит по воле сезонных ветров\\nи рассеивает по миру похожие на "
"хлопок\\nспоры, чтобы оставить больше потомства."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 190: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/190
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 223, 201, 109
#: 0x04497b2
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/190"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/190"
msgstr ""
"Хвостом он срывает плоды,\\nдо которых не дотянуться.\\nХвост у него "
"ловчее настоящих рук."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 191: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/191
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 215, 210, 141
#: 0x0449817
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/191"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/191"
msgstr ""
"Он питается лишь каплями росы\\nс изнанки листьев. Говорят, что больше\\n"
"он ничего не ест."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 192: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/192
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 200, 231, 128
#: 0x0449882
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/192"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/192"
msgstr ""
"Днём он суетливо снуёт туда-сюда,\\nно, когда солнце садится,\\nполностью "
"замирает."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 193: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/193
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 198, 188, 187
#: 0x04498ea
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/193"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/193"
msgstr ""
"Очень быстро взмахивая крыльями,\\nон может свободно летать. Даже резко\\n"
"остановиться ему нетрудно."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 194: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/194
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 182, 208, 173
#: 0x0449955
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/194"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/194"
msgstr ""
"Этот покемон живёт в холодной воде.\\nКогда снаружи холодает, он "
"выходит\\nиз воды на поиски пищи."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 195: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/195
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 200, 194, 172
#: 0x04499be
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/195"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/195"
msgstr ""
"Плавая, он часто бьётся головой\\nо дно реки, но, похоже, ему всё "
"равно.\\nЕго тело всегда покрыто слизью."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 196: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/196
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 203, 211, 105
#: 0x0449a28
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/196"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/196"
msgstr ""
"Тонкой шерстью, покрывающей тело,\\nон улавливает потоки воздуха\\nи "
"предугадывает действия врага."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 197: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/197
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 217, 207, 98
#: 0x0449a8b
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/197"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/197"
msgstr ""
"В ночь полнолуния или когда он\\nвзволнован, кольцевые узоры на его\\n"
"теле светятся жёлтым."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 198: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/198
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 186, 192, 144
#: 0x0449aed
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/198"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/198"
msgstr ""
"Многие его боятся и ненавидят:\\nсчитается, что он приносит несчастье\\n"
"всем, кто увидит его ночью."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 199: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/199, table:species/1224
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 178, 189, 131
#: 0x0449b4f
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/199"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/199"
msgstr ""
"Укус Шеллдера наделил его умом,\\nсравнимым с умом учёных,\\nудостоенных "
"премий."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 200: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/200
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 216, 221, 131
#: 0x0449bae
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/200"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/200"
msgstr ""
"Он любит внезапно кусать и дёргать\\nлюдей сзади за волосы, просто "
"чтобы\\nпосмотреть, как они пугаются."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 201: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/201, table:species/413, table:species/414, table:species/415, table:species/416, table:species/417, table:species/418, table:species/419, table:species/420, table:species/421, table:species/422, table:species/423, table:species/424, table:species/425, table:species/426, table:species/427, table:species/428, table:species/429, table:species/430, table:species/431, table:species/432, table:species/433, table:species/434, table:species/435, table:species/436, table:species/437, table:species/438, table:species/439
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 209, 211, 43
#: 0x0449c19
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/201"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/201"
msgstr ""
"Его плоское тонкое тело всегда\\nприлеплено к стенам. Похоже,\\nего форма "
"что-то означает."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 202: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/202
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 213, 228, 85
#: 0x0449c70
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/202"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/202"
msgstr ""
"Чтобы скрыть угольно-чёрный хвост,\\nон тихо живёт во тьме.\\nНикогда не "
"нападает первым."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 203: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/203
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 202, 215, 97
#: 0x0449cd5
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/203"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/203"
msgstr ""
"Его хвост, в котором тоже есть\\nмаленький мозг, может сам укусить,\\n"
"если почует манящий запах."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 204: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/204
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 225, 207, 89
#: 0x0449d38
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/204"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/204"
msgstr ""
"Он висит и подстерегает\\nлетающих насекомых.\\nСам он почти не "
"передвигается."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 205: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/205
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 221, 215, 126
#: 0x0449d99
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/205"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/205"
msgstr ""
"Он намертво прирос к своему дереву.\\nЧтобы прогнать врагов, он "
"разбрасывает\\nкуски твёрдого панциря."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 206: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/206
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 222, 228, 51
#: 0x0449e03
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/206"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/206"
msgstr ""
"Если его заметят, он скрывается,\\nзарываясь в землю хвостом. На "
"крыльях\\nможет лишь чуть-чуть парить."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 207: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/207
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 228, 221, 84
#: 0x0449e63
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/207"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/207"
msgstr ""
"Обычно он цепляется за скалы.\\nЗаметив добычу, он расправляет крылья\\nи "
"планирует вниз, чтобы атаковать."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 208: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/208, table:species/885
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 191, 198, 153
#: 0x0449ec9
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/208"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/208"
msgstr ""
"Его тело спрессовалось глубоко\\nпод землёй. В итоге оно стало\\nтвёрже "
"даже алмаза."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 209: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/209
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 192, 170, 176
#: 0x0449f2d
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/209"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/209"
msgstr ""
"Хотя выглядит он устрашающе,\\nна самом деле он добрый и ласковый.\\n"
"Очень популярен у женщин."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 210: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/210
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 182, 207, 131
#: 0x0449f93
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/210"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/210"
msgstr ""
"Он может обратить в бегство почти\\nлюбого покемона, просто широко "
"раскрыв\\nпасть и показав большие клыки."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 211: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/211, table:species/1239
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 192, 212, 143
#: 0x0449ff4
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/211"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/211"
msgstr ""
"Встретив противника крупнее себя,\\nон заглатывает как можно больше "
"воды,\\nчтобы сравняться с ним в размерах."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 212: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/212, table:species/886
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 209, 202, 132
#: 0x044a05a
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/212"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/212"
msgstr ""
"Чтобы напугать врагов, он вскидывает\\nклешни с узором в виде глаз. "
"Поэтому\\nкажется, что у него три головы."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 213: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/213
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 186, 184, 134
#: 0x044a0c1
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/213"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/213"
msgstr ""
"Он хранит ягоды внутри панциря.\\nСо временем ягоды бродят\\nи "
"превращаются во вкусный сок."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 214: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/214, table:species/887
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 188, 195, 143
#: 0x044a121
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/214"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/214"
msgstr ""
"Он обожает сладкий мёд. Чтобы весь мёд\\nдостался ему одному, он "
"отшвыривает\\nсоперников рогом - своей гордостью."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 215: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/215, table:species/1240
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 164, 201, 159
#: 0x044a184
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/215"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/215"
msgstr ""
"В его лапах спрятаны острые когти.\\nПри нападении он внезапно "
"выпускает\\nих, пугая врага."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 216: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/216
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 193, 221, 122
#: 0x044a1e6
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/216"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/216"
msgstr ""
"Он пропитывает лапы мёдом, чтобы\\nпостоянно их облизывать. У каждой\\n"
"пары лап свой неповторимый вкус."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 217: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/217
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 223, 223, 67
#: 0x044a24b
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/217"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/217"
msgstr ""
"Он различает любые запахи, поэтому\\nбезошибочно находит всю пищу,\\n"
"закопанную глубоко под землёй."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 218: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/218
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 214, 208, 126
#: 0x044a2ae
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/218"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/218"
msgstr ""
"Он никогда не спит. Ему нужно всё время\\nдвигаться, ведь, если он "
"остановится,\\nтело из магмы остынет и затвердеет."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 219: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/219
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 213, 194, 148
#: 0x044a313
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/219"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/219"
msgstr ""
"Панцирь на его спине - просто\\nостывшая и затвердевшая кожа, которая\\n"
"легко ломается от малейшего касания."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 220: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/220
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 226, 214, 34
#: 0x044a37b
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/220"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/220"
msgstr ""
"Учуяв что-то соблазнительное,\\nон стремглав бросается искать\\nисточник "
"аромата."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 221: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/221
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 218, 208, 102
#: 0x044a3d5
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/221"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/221"
msgstr ""
"Когда он бросается на врага, шерсть\\nна его спине встаёт дыбом.\\nОн "
"очень чувствителен к звукам."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 222: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/222, table:species/1225
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 228, 216, 79
#: 0x044a439
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/222"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/222"
msgstr ""
"В одной стране южных морей люди\\nстроят свои поселения на скоплениях\\n"
"этих покемонов."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 223: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/223
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 206, 181, 145
#: 0x044a49b
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/223"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/223"
msgstr ""
"Спинным плавником, словно присоской,\\nон прицепляется к брюху "
"Мантайна,\\nчтобы подбирать объедки."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 224: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/224
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 220, 219, 104
#: 0x044a501
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/224"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/224"
msgstr ""
"Он инстинктивно забирается в щели\\nмежду камнями. Если его клонит в "
"сон,\\nон крадёт гнездо у другого Октиллери."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 225: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/225
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 190, 222, 139
#: 0x044a569
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/225"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/225"
msgstr ""
"Куда бы он ни шёл, он всегда носит\\nс собой еду. При нападении он "
"бросает\\nеё в противника."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 226: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/226
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 220, 231, 131
#: 0x044a5d1
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/226"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/226"
msgstr ""
"Он свободно плавает в открытом море\\nи, набрав достаточную скорость, "
"может\\nвылететь из воды и парить над волнами."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 227: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/227
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 208, 217, 152
#: 0x044a63d
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/227"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/227"
msgstr ""
"Его прочные крылья кажутся тяжёлыми,\\nно на самом деле они полые и "
"лёгкие,\\nпоэтому он свободно летает в небе."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 228: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/228
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 221, 216, 60
#: 0x044a6a9
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/228"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/228"
msgstr ""
"Чтобы загнать добычу, они перекликаются\\nлаем, понятным только им, и по "
"нему\\nузнают, где находится каждый."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 229: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/229, table:species/888
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 186, 205, 113
#: 0x044a706
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/229"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/229"
msgstr ""
"Пламя, которое он выдыхает в гневе,\\nсодержит ядовитые вещества. Если "
"оно\\nобожжёт, ожог будет болеть вечно."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 230: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/230
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 205, 203, 121
#: 0x044a765
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/230"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/230"
msgstr ""
"Он спит глубоко на дне океана,\\nкопя энергию. Говорят, что, "
"просыпаясь,\\nон вызывает смерчи."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 231: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/231
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 222, 213, 88
#: 0x044a7c8
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/231"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/231"
msgstr ""
"В знак привязанности он тычется\\nхоботом. Но силы у него столько,\\nчто "
"от толчка можно отлететь."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 232: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/232
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 211, 212, 120
#: 0x044a82c
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/232"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/232"
msgstr ""
"Его шкура затвердела, как камень.\\nОбычная атака не оставит на ней\\n"
"даже царапины."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 233: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/233
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 189, 194, 128
#: 0x044a891
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/233"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/233"
msgstr ""
"Благодаря новейшим технологиям этот\\nискусственный покемон "
"эволюционировал.\\nОн может реагировать не по программе."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 234: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/234
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 192, 210, 130
#: 0x044a8ef
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/234"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/234"
msgstr ""
"У тех, кто засмотрится на его рога,\\nпостепенно мутится сознание,\\nи "
"они не могут устоять на ногах."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 235: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/235
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 191, 189, 123
#: 0x044a953
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/235"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/235"
msgstr ""
"Повзрослев, он, как правило, позволяет\\nтоварищам оставлять у себя на "
"спине\\nотпечатки лап."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 236: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/236
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 196, 212, 125
#: 0x044a9b2
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/236"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/236"
msgstr ""
"Хотя он и мал, не обращать на него\\nвнимания нельзя: без "
"предупреждения\\nон бьёт всё, что подвернётся."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 237: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/237
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 209, 222, 88
#: 0x044aa17
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/237"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/237"
msgstr ""
"Он бьёт ногами, вращаясь. Если он\\nкрутится очень быстро, то может\\n"
"ввинтиться в землю."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 238: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/238
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 173, 186, 124
#: 0x044aa7a
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/238"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/238"
msgstr ""
"Он всегда медленно покачивает головой\\nвзад и вперёд, словно хочет\\n"
"кого-то поцеловать."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 239: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/239
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 196, 179, 104
#: 0x044aad6
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/239"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/239"
msgstr ""
"Даже в самую свирепую бурю этот\\nпокемон радостно играет, если в небе\\n"
"гремит гром."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 240: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/240
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 190, 192, 123
#: 0x044ab31
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/240"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/240"
msgstr ""
"Каждый раз, когда он вдыхает\\nи выдыхает, изо рта и ноздрей у него\\n"
"сыплются горячие тлеющие угли."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 241: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/241
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 212, 204, 61
#: 0x044ab90
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/241"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/241"
msgstr ""
"Если у него недавно появился детёныш,\\nего молоко гораздо питательнее\\n"
"обычного."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 242: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/242
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 197, 217, 157
#: 0x044abea
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/242"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/242"
msgstr ""
"У неё очень сострадательный нрав.\\nУвидев больного покемона, она\\n"
"выхаживает его, пока тот не поправится."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 243: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/243
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 163, 200, 119
#: 0x044ac55
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/243"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/243"
msgstr ""
"Этот покемон мчится по земле,\\nи его лающий голос похож\\nна раскаты "
"грома."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 244: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/244
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 209, 221, 114
#: 0x044acb0
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/244"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/244"
msgstr ""
"Покемон, который мчится по земле.\\nГоворят, что с появлением каждого\\n"
"нового вулкана рождается ещё один."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 245: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/245
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 196, 219, 141
#: 0x044ad15
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/245"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/245"
msgstr ""
"Этот покемон мчится по земле.\\nГоворят, что, когда он появляется,\\n"
"почему-то всегда дует северный ветер."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 246: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/246
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 205, 227, 80
#: 0x044ad7d
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/246"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/246"
msgstr ""
"Он рождается глубоко под землёй\\nи не может выбраться наружу, пока\\nне "
"съест всю почву вокруг себя."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 247: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/247
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 204, 225, 100
#: 0x044adde
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/247"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/247"
msgstr ""
"Даже запертый в панцире, он свободно\\nдвигается. Твёрдый и быстрый, он\\n"
"обладает огромной разрушительной силой."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 248: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/248, table:species/889
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 221, 195, 148
#: 0x044ae42
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/248"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/248"
msgstr ""
"Его тело неуязвимо для любых атак,\\nпоэтому он очень охотно бросает\\n"
"вызов врагам."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 249: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/249
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 234, 216, 93
#: 0x044aeab
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/249"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/249"
msgstr ""
"Говорят, что он хранитель морей.\\nХодят слухи, что его видели\\n"
"штормовой ночью."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 250: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/250
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 201, 215, 128
#: 0x044af10
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/250"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/250"
msgstr ""
"По легенде, его тело сияет\\nсемью цветами. Говорят, что, когда\\nон "
"летит, за ним появляется радуга."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 251: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/251
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 223, 198, 135
#: 0x044af77
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/251"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/251"
msgstr ""
"Говорят, что, когда Селеби исчезает\\nв глубине леса, он оставляет после "
"себя\\nяйцо, принесённое из будущего."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 252: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/277
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 204, 198, 147
#: 0x044afdf
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/252"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/252"
msgstr ""
"Подошвы его лап покрыты бесчисленными\\nкрошечными шипами, благодаря "
"которым\\nон может ходить по стенам и потолку."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 253: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/278
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 205, 190, 101
#: 0x044b047
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/253"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/253"
msgstr ""
"Подбираясь к добыче, он прыгает\\nс ветки на ветку. Его ловкость\\n"
"поразительна."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 254: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/279, table:species/890
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 203, 201, 124
#: 0x044b0a6
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/254"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/254"
msgstr ""
"Листья на его руках способны\\nсрубить толстое дерево. В бою\\nв джунглях "
"ему нет равных."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 255: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/280
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 193, 207, 86
#: 0x044b109
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/255"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/255"
msgstr ""
"В животе у него есть огненный мешок,\\nв котором не угасает пламя. Если "
"его\\nобнять, от него исходит тепло."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 256: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/281
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 203, 211, 100
#: 0x044b165
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/256"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/256"
msgstr ""
"Во время боя жаркое пламя в его теле\\nразгорается сильнее. Его удары "
"ногами\\nобладают огромной разрушительной силой."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 257: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/282, table:species/891
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 218, 220, 138
#: 0x044b1c6
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/257"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/257"
msgstr ""
"Из запястий у него вырывается пламя,\\nокутывая кулаки. Чем сильнее "
"враги,\\nтем жарче оно горит."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 258: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/283
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 202, 183, 180
#: 0x044b233
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/258"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/258"
msgstr ""
"Большой хвостовой плавник\\nпридаёт ему в воде мощное ускорение.\\nОн "
"силён не по росту."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 259: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/284
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 202, 211, 164
#: 0x044b29f
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/259"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/259"
msgstr ""
"Он живёт на вязкой грязной почве,\\nи от этого его ноги стали крепкими.\\n"
"Чтобы поспать, он зарывается в землю."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 260: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/285, table:species/892
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 216, 213, 165
#: 0x044b30b
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/260"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/260"
msgstr ""
"Его руки твёрдые, как камень.\\nОдним взмахом они могут повалить врага.\\n"
"Гнездо он строит на красивых пляжах."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 261: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/286
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 208, 206, 104
#: 0x044b37a
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/261"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/261"
msgstr ""
"Упорный по натуре покемон, который\\nпреследует выбранную добычу, пока\\n"
"жертва не выбьется из сил."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 262: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/287
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 211, 221, 194
#: 0x044b3db
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/262"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/262"
msgstr ""
"Он всегда слушается умелого тренера.\\nТакое поведение пошло с древних "
"времён,\\nкогда эти покемоны жили стаями."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 263: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/288, table:species/1226
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 188, 222, 118
#: 0x044b452
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/263"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/263"
msgstr ""
"Очень любопытный покемон.\\nОн интересуется всем подряд,\\nпоэтому всегда "
"бегает зигзагами."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 264: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/289, table:species/1227
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 207, 223, 212
#: 0x044b4b6
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/264"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/264"
msgstr ""
"Лайнун всегда бегает на полной скорости\\nи только по прямой. Даже "
"плавные изгибы\\nдороги даются этому покемону с трудом."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 265: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/290
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 227, 220, 151
#: 0x044b52e
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/265"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/265"
msgstr ""
"Он живёт в высокой траве и в лесах.\\nПри нападении отбивается,\\n"
"направляя на врага ядовитые шипы."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 266: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/291
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 201, 208, 135
#: 0x044b5a0
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/266"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/266"
msgstr ""
"Он обматывает шёлком ветви дерева.\\nВ ожидании эволюции пьёт дождевую\\n"
"воду, собравшуюся на шёлке."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 267: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/292
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 182, 223, 140
#: 0x044b608
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/267"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/267"
msgstr ""
"Несмотря на внешность, он агрессивен\\nпо натуре. Атакует, вонзая\\nво "
"врага длинный тонкий хоботок."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 268: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/293
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 212, 204, 94
#: 0x044b66f
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/268"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/268"
msgstr ""
"Он не забывает ни одной атаки,\\nкоторую перенёс в коконе.\\nПосле "
"эволюции он стремится отомстить."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 269: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/294
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 214, 230, 160
#: 0x044b6cf
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/269"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/269"
msgstr ""
"Почуяв опасность, он рассыпает крайне\\nядовитую пыль. Ночью эти "
"покемоны\\nобычно слетаются на свет фонарей."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 270: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/295
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 224, 211, 125
#: 0x044b740
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/270"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/270"
msgstr ""
"Он повсюду ищет чистую воду.\\nЕсли он долго не пьёт,\\nлист на его "
"голове вянет."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 271: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/296
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 205, 199, 144
#: 0x044b7a9
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/271"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/271"
msgstr ""
"Он живёт у кромки воды в солнечных\\nместах. Питается водяными мхами,\\n"
"растущими на дне рек."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 272: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/297
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 228, 217, 95
#: 0x044b810
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/272"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/272"
msgstr ""
"Когда он слышит праздничную музыку,\\nвсе его мышцы наполняются "
"энергией.\\nОн невольно пускается в пляс."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 273: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/298
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 225, 227, 160
#: 0x044b877
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/273"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/273"
msgstr ""
"Когда он неподвижен, его не отличить\\nот настоящих орехов. Он обожает\\n"
"пугать Пиджи, которые ищут корм."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 274: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/299
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 222, 219, 113
#: 0x044b8ed
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/274"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/274"
msgstr ""
"Они живут в дуплах больших деревьев.\\nЗвук травяной флейты Назлифа\\n"
"наводит на слушателей ужас."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 275: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/300
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 210, 222, 127
#: 0x044b956
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/275"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/275"
msgstr ""
"Покемон, которого боялись как хранителя\\nлеса. Он может читать мысли "
"врага\\nи действовать на опережение."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 276: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/304
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 198, 219, 197
#: 0x044b9be
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/276"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/276"
msgstr ""
"Хотя он мал, он так отважен,\\nчто бросает вызов сильным врагам.\\nЛетает "
"в поисках тёплых краёв."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 277: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/305
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 218, 208, 165
#: 0x044ba32
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/277"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/277"
msgstr ""
"Если два пера на его хвосте стоят\\nнавытяжку, это признак хорошего\\n"
"здоровья. Он изящно парит в небе."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 278: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/309
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 211, 224, 99
#: 0x044baa2
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/278"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/278"
msgstr ""
"Ловя длинными крыльями морской\\nветер, он парит, словно планер.\\nГнёзда "
"вьёт на скалах."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 279: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/310
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 211, 228, 130
#: 0x044bb0a
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/279"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/279"
msgstr ""
"Это летающий перевозчик, который носит\\nмаленьких покемонов в клюве. "
"Чтобы дать\\nотдых крыльям, он качается на волнах."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 280: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/392
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 212, 215, 140
#: 0x044bb76
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/280"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/280"
msgstr ""
"Рогами на голове он чувствует\\nчеловеческие эмоции. Говорят, что он\\n"
"показывается жизнерадостным людям."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 281: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/393
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 177, 166, 165
#: 0x044bbe0
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/281"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/281"
msgstr ""
"Когда его тренер радуется, этот\\nпокемон наполняется энергией\\nи весело "
"танцует, кружась."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 282: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/394, table:species/893
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 183, 174, 192
#: 0x044bc40
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/282"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/282"
msgstr ""
"Защищая тренера, с которым его\\nсвязывают крепкие узы, он в полную "
"силу\\nвысвобождает психокинетическую энергию."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 283: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/311
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 208, 211, 93
#: 0x044bca7
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/283"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/283"
msgstr ""
"Обычно они живут на прудах,\\nно после вечернего ливня могут\\nпоявиться "
"на лужах в городах."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 284: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/312
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 209, 219, 203
#: 0x044bd06
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/284"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/284"
msgstr ""
"На его усиках особые узоры, похожие\\nна глаза. В дождь усики тяжелеют,\\n"
"и летать становится невозможно."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 285: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/306
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 230, 207, 151
#: 0x044bd7d
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/285"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/285"
msgstr ""
"Он любит сырые места. Днём неподвижно\\nсидит в лесной тени. Из головы "
"он\\nвыпускает ядовитый порошок."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 286: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/307
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 218, 209, 150
#: 0x044bdeb
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/286"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/286"
msgstr ""
"Семена на хвосте состоят из ядовитых\\nспор. Он нокаутирует врагов "
"быстрыми,\\nпочти невидимыми ударами кулаков."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 287: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/364
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 212, 230, 109
#: 0x044be58
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/287"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/287"
msgstr ""
"Чтобы наесться, ему хватает всего\\nтрёх листьев в день. Остальное "
"время\\nон спит - по 20 часов в сутки."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 288: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/365
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 216, 189, 102
#: 0x044bec0
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/288"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/288"
msgstr ""
"Если он не может постоянно двигаться,\\nв нём накапливается стресс. От "
"сильного\\nстресса ему становится плохо."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 289: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/366
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 219, 229, 207
#: 0x044bf21
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/289"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/289"
msgstr ""
"Это самый ленивый покемон в мире.\\nОднако, разом высвободив "
"накопленную\\nэнергию, он проявляет ужасающую силу."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 290: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/301
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 208, 216, 82
#: 0x044bf9b
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/290"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/290"
msgstr ""
"Он может прожить под землёй больше\\n10 лет. Питательные вещества\\nон "
"высасывает из корней деревьев."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 291: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/302
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 211, 227, 96
#: 0x044bffa
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/291"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/291"
msgstr ""
"Этот покемон так быстр, что, говорят,\\nможет увернуться от любой "
"атаки.\\nОн любит питаться древесным соком."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 292: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/303
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 205, 210, 45
#: 0x044c05e
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/292"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/292"
msgstr ""
"Очень странный покемон, который\\nпочему-то появляется в покеболе,\\n"
"когда эволюционирует Нинкада."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 293: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/370
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 204, 226, 133
#: 0x044c0b3
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/293"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/293"
msgstr ""
"Обычно он тихо бормочет, но, почуяв\\nопасность, начинает громко "
"кричать.\\nУмолкает, когда закрывает уши-заслонки."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 294: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/371
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 213, 224, 80
#: 0x044c11d
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/294"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/294"
msgstr ""
"Когда он топает ногами и ревёт,\\nон создаёт ультразвуковые волны,\\n"
"способные разнести дом."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 295: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/372
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 206, 217, 215
#: 0x044c17e
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/295"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/295"
msgstr ""
"Из отверстий по всему телу он издаёт\\nсамые разные звуки. Его громкие "
"крики\\nслышны более чем за 10 км."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 296: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/335
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 205, 213, 142
#: 0x044c1f5
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/296"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/296"
msgstr ""
"Он закаляется, раз за разом врезаясь\\nв толстые деревья. Так он "
"обретает\\nкрепкое тело и неустрашимый дух."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 297: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/336
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 221, 200, 112
#: 0x044c25e
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/297"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/297"
msgstr ""
"Он любит мериться силой с крупными\\nпокемонами. Толчками рук он может\\n"
"отшвырнуть грузовик."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 298: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/350
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 210, 189, 194
#: 0x044c2c2
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/298"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/298"
msgstr ""
"В бою он размахивает хвостом,\\nкоторый больше его тела.\\nВ воде хвост "
"служит ему поплавком."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 299: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/320
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 197, 191, 103
#: 0x044c333
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/299"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/299"
msgstr ""
"Его магнитный нос всегда указывает\\nна север. Путешественники\\n"
"ориентируются по Ноузпассу."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 300: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/315
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 205, 216, 177
#: 0x044c390
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/300"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/300"
msgstr ""
"Говорят, что заслужить его доверие\\nтрудно. Однако он невероятно "
"популярен\\nблагодаря милой внешности и повадкам."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 301: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/316
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 212, 207, 131
#: 0x044c401
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/301"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/301"
msgstr ""
"Любимцы девушек-тренеров, следящих\\nза модой. Благодаря стильному виду\\n"
"и шерсти их выставляют на соревнования."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 302: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/322, table:species/894
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 194, 213, 95
#: 0x044c469
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/302"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/302"
msgstr ""
"Он обитает во тьме пещер.\\nОстрыми когтями он выкапывает\\nсамоцветы, "
"которыми питается."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 303: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/355, table:species/895
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 214, 230, 122
#: 0x044c4c8
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/303"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/303"
msgstr ""
"Кроткой на вид мордочкой он усыпляет\\nбдительность врагов, а затем "
"кусает\\nогромными безжалостными челюстями."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 304: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/382
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 192, 198, 137
#: 0x044c533
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/304"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/304"
msgstr ""
"Обычно он живёт в глубине гор. Однако\\nголод может заставить его есть\\n"
"железнодорожные рельсы и машины."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 305: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/383
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 185, 186, 175
#: 0x044c596
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/305"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/305"
msgstr ""
"Он обожает железную руду. Стаи этих\\nпокемонов бьются за территорию,\\n"
"сталкиваясь стальными телами."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 306: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/384, table:species/896
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 217, 220, 183
#: 0x044c5fd
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/306"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/306"
msgstr ""
"Он считает своей целую гору. Чем больше\\nна нём ран, тем больше боёв он "
"прошёл,\\nтак что недооценивать его не стоит."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 307: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/356
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 224, 227, 87
#: 0x044c672
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/307"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/307"
msgstr ""
"Он медитирует, чтобы усилить внутреннюю\\nэнергию и парить в воздухе. В "
"день\\nон съедает всего одну ягоду."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 308: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/357, table:species/897
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 218, 215, 133
#: 0x044c6d7
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/308"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/308"
msgstr ""
"Изящными, словно танцевальными шагами\\nон уходит от атак и тем же "
"движением\\nнаносит сокрушительный удар."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 309: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/337
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 207, 223, 96
#: 0x044c741
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/309"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/309"
msgstr ""
"Он копит в шерсти статическое\\nэлектричество, чтобы выпускать разряды.\\n"
"Перед грозой он искрит."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 310: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/338, table:species/898
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 218, 212, 113
#: 0x044c7a6
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/310"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/310"
msgstr ""
"Он испускает электричество из гривы.\\nНад головой он создаёт грозовую "
"тучу,\\nчтобы метать молнии."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 311: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/353
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 190, 212, 147
#: 0x044c80c
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/311"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/311"
msgstr ""
"Он подбадривает друзей помпонами\\nиз искр. Устраивая в теле короткое\\n"
"замыкание, он издаёт треск."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 312: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/354
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 224, 210, 66
#: 0x044c873
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/312"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/312"
msgstr ""
"Он любит подбадривать друзей. Если они\\nпроигрывают, его тело "
"испускает\\nвсё больше искр."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 313: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/386
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 215, 222, 68
#: 0x044c8d2
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/313"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/313"
msgstr ""
"Ночью он общается с сородичами,\\nзажигая огонёк на кончике брюшка.\\nОн "
"обожает сладкий аромат Иллюмайз."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 314: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/387
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 220, 229, 108
#: 0x044c932
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/314"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/314"
msgstr ""
"Она направляет Волбитов, и те рисуют\\nзнаки в ночном небе. Некоторые "
"учёные\\nизучают узоры, которые она создаёт."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 315: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/363
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 197, 194, 152
#: 0x044c99c
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/315"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/315"
msgstr ""
"Говорят, что Розелии, которые пьют\\nпитательную родниковую воду,\\n"
"расцветая, обретают редкую окраску."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 316: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/367
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 227, 220, 108
#: 0x044ca03
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/316"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/316"
msgstr ""
"Его желудок переварит что угодно.\\nПока он переваривает пищу, из него\\n"
"выходят мерзкие удушливые газы."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 317: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/368
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 224, 215, 123
#: 0x044ca6d
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/317"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/317"
msgstr ""
"Он может разом проглотить целую шину.\\nИз пор на теле он выделяет "
"крайне\\nядовитую жидкость."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 318: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/330
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 208, 203, 84
#: 0x044cad6
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/318"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/318"
msgstr ""
"Они стаей набрасываются на любого\\nврага, вторгшегося на их "
"территорию.\\nОстрые клыки могут пробить корпус лодки."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 319: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/331, table:species/899
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 224, 226, 107
#: 0x044cb33
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/319"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/319"
msgstr ""
"Свирепый и хитрый морской бандит.\\nОсобая структура его кожи сводит\\n"
"сопротивление воды к минимуму."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 320: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/313
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 190, 175, 165
#: 0x044cb9d
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/320"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/320"
msgstr ""
"В солнечные дни он выбирается на пляж,\\nчтобы попрыгать, как мяч, и "
"поиграть.\\nИз носа он пускает фонтаны воды."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 321: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/314
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 152, 182, 176
#: 0x044cc00
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/321"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/321"
msgstr ""
"Самый большой из всех покемонов.\\nНа одном вдохе он может нырнуть\\nна "
"глубину почти 3000 м."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 322: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/339
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 201, 224, 71
#: 0x044cc5e
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/322"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/322"
msgstr ""
"В его горбатой спине хранится\\nраскалённая магма. В дождь магма\\n"
"остывает, и он становится медлительным."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 323: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/340, table:species/900
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 220, 215, 140
#: 0x044ccbb
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/323"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/323"
msgstr ""
"Если его разозлить, горбы на спине\\nизвергают дождь расплавленной "
"лавы.\\nОн живёт в кратерах вулканов."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 324: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/321
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 229, 202, 108
#: 0x044cd26
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/324"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/324"
msgstr ""
"Он сжигает уголь внутри панциря,\\nполучая энергию. При опасности\\nон "
"выпускает чёрную сажу."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 325: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/351
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 206, 204, 145
#: 0x044cd8d
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/325"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/325"
msgstr ""
"Он прыгает на хвосте, чтобы его сердце\\nпродолжало биться. На голове он "
"носит\\nжемчужину Кламперла."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 326: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/352
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 213, 225, 153
#: 0x044cdf5
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/326"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/326"
msgstr ""
"Странными танцевальными па он может\\nподчинять врагов. Чёрные "
"жемчужины\\nна его лбу - драгоценные камни."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 327: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/308
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 224, 190, 96
#: 0x044ce62
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/327"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/327"
msgstr ""
"Говорят, что узор у каждого Спинды\\nнеповторим. Своими шаткими "
"движениями\\nон приводит врагов в замешательство."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 328: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/332
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 217, 210, 107
#: 0x044cec3
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/328"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/328"
msgstr ""
"Он роет воронку, из которой\\nне выбраться, и поджидает на дне,\\nкогда в "
"неё скатится добыча."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 329: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/333
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 201, 199, 98
#: 0x044cf27
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/329"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/329"
msgstr ""
"Ультразвуковые волны, которые он\\nиздаёт, потирая два крыла друг о "
"друга,\\nвызывают сильную головную боль."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 330: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/334
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 224, 229, 55
#: 0x044cf84
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/330"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/330"
msgstr ""
"Он прячется, поднимая крыльями песок\\nпустыни. Красные щитки защищают\\n"
"его глаза от песка."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 331: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/344
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 205, 213, 137
#: 0x044cfe5
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/331"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/331"
msgstr ""
"Он любит суровые места, например\\nпустыни. На воде, запасённой в теле,\\n"
"он может прожить 30 дней."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 332: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/345
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 194, 207, 67
#: 0x044d04d
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/332"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/332"
msgstr ""
"Он оживляется ночью и ищет добычу,\\nобессилевшую от дневного\\nзноя "
"пустыни."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 333: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/358
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 198, 188, 57
#: 0x044d0a5
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/333"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/333"
msgstr ""
"Почему-то он любит мягко садиться\\nлюдям на голову и притворяться\\n"
"шляпой."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 334: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/359, table:species/901
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 200, 192, 125
#: 0x044d0fa
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/334"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/334"
msgstr ""
"Он грациозно летает в небе.\\nОт его мелодичного напева\\nвсё вокруг "
"кажется сном."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 335: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/380
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 204, 217, 201
#: 0x044d15b
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/335"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/335"
msgstr ""
"Встретив Севайпера, он ощетинивается\\nи принимает боевую стойку.\\nЕго "
"острые когти - лучшее оружие."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 336: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/379
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 183, 228, 139
#: 0x044d1d0
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/336"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/336"
msgstr ""
"Он постоянно полирует лезвие на хвосте,\\nпоэтому его кромка очень "
"острая.\\nЭто заклятый соперник Зангуса."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 337: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/348
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 224, 221, 167
#: 0x044d238
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/337"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/337"
msgstr ""
"Его самочувствие меняется\\nвслед за фазами луны. В свете\\nполной луны "
"он переполняется силой."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 338: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/349
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 219, 220, 103
#: 0x044d2a9
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/338"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/338"
msgstr ""
"Днём он поглощает солнечную энергию.\\nВсегда бесстрастный, он "
"чувствует,\\nо чём думает враг."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 339: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/323
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 203, 198, 61
#: 0x044d310
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/339"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/339"
msgstr ""
"Он покрывает всё тело скользкой слизью,\\nчтобы, если его схватят, "
"вывернуться\\nи ускользнуть."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 340: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/324
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 188, 193, 155
#: 0x044d368
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/340"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/340"
msgstr ""
"Он считает своим большое болото.\\nЕсли приближается враг, он мечется,\\n"
"вызывая подземные толчки."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 341: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/326
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 202, 225, 124
#: 0x044d3cd
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/341"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/341"
msgstr ""
"Какой бы грязной ни была вода в реке,\\nон приспособится и будет "
"процветать.\\nУ него сильная воля к жизни."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 342: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/327
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 232, 221, 156
#: 0x044d435
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/342"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/342"
msgstr ""
"Этот покемон обожает сражаться.\\nВсех покемонов, вторгшихся в его "
"угодья,\\nон хватает клешнями и вышвыривает."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 343: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/318
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 202, 215, 186
#: 0x044d4a8
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/343"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/343"
msgstr ""
"Он передвигается, вращаясь\\nна одной ноге. Впрочем, некоторых\\nБалтоев "
"видели крутящимися на голове."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 344: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/319
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 218, 209, 164
#: 0x044d519
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/344"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/344"
msgstr ""
"Похоже, он родился из глиняных кукол,\\nсделанных древними людьми. Он "
"парит\\nи передвигается с помощью телекинеза."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 345: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/388
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 207, 205, 181
#: 0x044d586
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/345"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/345"
msgstr ""
"Он вымер около 100 миллионов лет назад.\\nЕго воссоздали из "
"окаменелости\\nс помощью передовых технологий."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 346: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/389
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 178, 170, 189
#: 0x044d5f4
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/346"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/346"
msgstr ""
"Он живёт в тёплых морях. Благодаря\\nтяжёлому телу его не уносит "
"волнами\\nв непогоду."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 347: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/390
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 188, 199, 123
#: 0x044d658
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/347"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/347"
msgstr ""
"Покемон-предок, живший в океане.\\nСо временем восемь его ног\\n"
"превратились в крылья."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 348: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/391
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 196, 215, 166
#: 0x044d6b9
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/348"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/348"
msgstr ""
"Его огромные выдвижные когти режут\\nпочти что угодно. Всё его тело\\n"
"защищено прочными пластинами."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 349: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/328
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 201, 222, 136
#: 0x044d725
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/349"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/349"
msgstr ""
"Над ним смеются из-за невзрачного вида,\\nа исследователи его не "
"замечают.\\nОн живёт в заросших прудах."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 350: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/329
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 224, 225, 80
#: 0x044d78e
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/350"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/350"
msgstr ""
"Говорят, что стоит лишь взглянуть\\nна прекрасного Майлотика, как любые\\n"
"враждебные чувства утихают."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 351: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/385
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 231, 195, 141
#: 0x044d7f3
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/351"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/351"
msgstr ""
"В зависимости от погоды он может\\nпринимать облик солнца, дождя\\nили "
"снежной тучи."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 352: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/317
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 214, 229, 105
#: 0x044d85e
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/352"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/352"
msgstr ""
"Он меняет цвет тела, чтобы слиться\\nс окружением. Цвет меняется и "
"тогда,\\nкогда ему радостно или грустно."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 353: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/377
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 211, 201, 129
#: 0x044d8c5
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/353"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/353"
msgstr ""
"Он любит питаться такими чувствами,\\nкак зависть и злоба. Торчащий рог\\n"
"улавливает человеческие эмоции."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 354: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/378, table:species/902
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 211, 159, 194
#: 0x044d92a
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/354"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/354"
msgstr ""
"Кукла, которая стала покемоном из обиды\\nза то, что её выбросили. Банетт "
"ищет\\nребёнка, который от него отказался."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 355: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/361
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 194, 199, 145
#: 0x044d992
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/355"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/355"
msgstr ""
"Он обожает детский плач. Проходя\\nсквозь стены, он пугает непослушных\\n"
"детей и доводит их до слёз."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 356: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/362
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 232, 225, 103
#: 0x044d9f7
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/356"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/356"
msgstr ""
"Его тело совершенно полое. Открыв рот,\\nон, словно чёрная дыра, "
"втягивает\\nв себя всё вокруг."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 357: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/369
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 233, 187, 162
#: 0x044da61
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/357"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/357"
msgstr ""
"Он живёт в тропических джунглях.\\nГроздь плодов на его шее очень "
"вкусная.\\nПлоды вырастают дважды в год."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 358: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/411
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 204, 179, 156
#: 0x044dacf
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/358"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/358"
msgstr ""
"Его крики отдаются эхом в полом теле\\nи выходят наружу прекрасными "
"звуками,\\nкоторые пугают и отгоняют врагов."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 359: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/376, table:species/903
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 210, 201, 149
#: 0x044db35
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/359"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/359"
msgstr ""
"Он появляется, когда чует надвигающееся\\nстихийное бедствие. Из-за этого "
"его\\nошибочно считали вестником беды."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 360: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/360
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 217, 208, 71
#: 0x044db9f
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/360"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/360"
msgstr ""
"Обычно он передвигается в стае. Особи\\nтолкаются, прижимаясь друг к "
"другу,\\nчтобы закалить дух."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 361: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/346
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 204, 211, 65
#: 0x044dbfd
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/361"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/361"
msgstr ""
"В снежном краю есть поверье, что дом,\\nв котором живёт Снорант,\\nждёт "
"процветание."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 362: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/347, table:species/904
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 207, 213, 149
#: 0x044dc58
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/362"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/362"
msgstr ""
"Его ледяное тело не тает даже от огня.\\nОн может мгновенно "
"замораживать\\nвлагу в воздухе."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 363: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/341
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 220, 199, 123
#: 0x044dcc3
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/363"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/363"
msgstr ""
"Они ещё плохо плавают и гораздо быстрее\\nпередвигаются, перекатываясь. "
"Когда\\nим весело, они хлопают ластами."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 364: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/342
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 209, 201, 151
#: 0x044dd28
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/364"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/364"
msgstr ""
"Всё новое он трогает носом, чтобы\\nпонюхать и ощупать. Играя, он "
"крутит\\nна носу Сфила."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 365: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/343
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 188, 206, 163
#: 0x044dd92
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/365"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/365"
msgstr ""
"Большими бивнями он разбивает лёд.\\nТолстый слой жира отражает не "
"только\\nхолод, но и вражеские атаки."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 366: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/373
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 186, 207, 79
#: 0x044ddfb
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/366"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/366"
msgstr ""
"За всю жизнь он создаёт\\nлишь одну жемчужину. Говорят,\\nчто она "
"усиливает психическую силу."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 367: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/374
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 218, 223, 161
#: 0x044de55
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/367"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/367"
msgstr ""
"Он живёт в морских глубинах,\\nкуда не проникает свет. Чтобы приманить\\n"
"добычу, он зажигает хвостик-рыбку."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 368: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/375
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 222, 220, 140
#: 0x044dec7
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/368"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/368"
msgstr ""
"Он плавает с изумительным изяществом.\\nТонким ртом он объедает "
"водоросли,\\nрастущие между камнями."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 369: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/381
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 192, 180, 189
#: 0x044df35
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/369"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/369"
msgstr ""
"Редкий покемон, обнаруженный во время\\nглубоководной экспедиции. Он не "
"менялся\\nболее 100 миллионов лет."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 370: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/325
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 203, 191, 129
#: 0x044df9d
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/370"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/370"
msgstr ""
"В период нереста у коралловых рифов\\nсобираются бесчисленные Лавдиски,\\n"
"и вода становится розовой."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 371: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/395
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 200, 210, 116
#: 0x044e000
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/371"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/371"
msgstr ""
"Он страстно мечтает отрастить крылья\\nи летать. Каждый день он "
"тренируется,\\nпрыгая со скал."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 372: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/396
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 233, 209, 212
#: 0x044e063
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/372"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/372"
msgstr ""
"От его бронированного тела отскакивают\\nлюбые атаки. Но броня так "
"прочна,\\nчто он тяжёл и несколько медлителен."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 373: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/397, table:species/905
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 207, 213, 106
#: 0x044e0db
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/373"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/373"
msgstr ""
"Он так долго мечтал о полёте,\\nчто строение его клеток изменилось\\nи у "
"него выросли крылья."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 374: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/398
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 192, 215, 72
#: 0x044e13e
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/374"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/374"
msgstr ""
"Он общается с сородичами с помощью\\nмагнитных волн. Все клетки\\nего "
"тела магнитны."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 375: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/399
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 183, 200, 83
#: 0x044e199
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/375"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/375"
msgstr ""
"Когда два Белдама сливаются воедино,\\nмагнитная нервная система\\n"
"объединяет их мозги."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 376: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/400, table:species/906
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 180, 181, 206
#: 0x044e1f1
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/376"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/376"
msgstr ""
"Благодаря четырём связанным мозгам\\nон умнее суперкомпьютера. Врагов\\n"
"он анализирует с помощью вычислений."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 377: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/401
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 221, 226, 141
#: 0x044e25d
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/377"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/377"
msgstr ""
"Он целиком состоит из камней, и в нём\\nне найти ни мозга, ни сердца. "
"Даже\\nдля современных учёных он загадка."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 378: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/402
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 204, 180, 176
#: 0x044e2cc
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/378"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/378"
msgstr ""
"Говорят, что он тысячи лет спал\\nв леднике. Его тело не растопить\\nдаже "
"магмой."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 379: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/403
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 207, 222, 179
#: 0x044e334
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/379"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/379"
msgstr ""
"Он прочнее любого металла.\\nЗатвердел под давлением недр\\nза десятки "
"тысяч лет."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 380: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/407, table:species/907
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 204, 201, 112
#: 0x044e3a5
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/380"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/380"
msgstr ""
"Её тело покрыто пухом, который\\nпреломляет свет так, что она\\n"
"становится невидимой."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 381: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/408, table:species/908
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 222, 218, 156
#: 0x044e406
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/381"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/381"
msgstr ""
"Он кроткого нрава и не любит сражаться.\\nПоджав передние лапы, он может "
"летать\\nбыстрее реактивного самолёта."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 382: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/404, table:species/910
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 176, 198, 174
#: 0x044e477
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/382"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/382"
msgstr ""
"Мифический покемон, который, говорят,\\nрасширил моря дождями и "
"приливными\\nволнами. Он сражался с Граудоном."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 383: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/405, table:species/909
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 187, 195, 92
#: 0x044e4dd
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/383"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/383"
msgstr ""
"Он спал в подземной магме с тех пор,\\nкак давным-давно яростно "
"сражался\\nс Кайогром."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 384: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/406, table:species/911
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 224, 209, 71
#: 0x044e535
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/384"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/384"
msgstr ""
"Он летает высоко в небе, в озоновом\\nслое. До недавнего времени его "
"никто\\nникогда не видел."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 385: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/409
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 212, 214, 96
#: 0x044e594
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/385"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/385"
msgstr ""
"Говорят, что он исполняет\\nлюбое желание. Из каждой тысячи лет\\nон "
"бодрствует только семь дней."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 386: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/410, table:species/1040, table:species/1041, table:species/1042
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 210, 207, 113
#: 0x165c254
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/386"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/386"
msgstr ""
"Инопланетный вирус, упавший на Землю\\nс метеоритом, мутировал на уровне "
"ДНК\\nи стал этим покемоном."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 387: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/440
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 205, 207, 66
#: 0x165c2b6
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/387"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/387"
msgstr ""
"Панцирь на его спине сделан из почвы\\nи твердеет, когда он пьёт воду.\\n"
"Он живёт по берегам озёр."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 388: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/441
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 196, 150, 64
#: 0x165c310
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/388"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/388"
msgstr "Говорят, что у Гротла, живущего в лесу,\\nесть свой тайный родник."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 389: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/442
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 201, 172, 45
#: 0x165c35e
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/389"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/389"
msgstr ""
"Древние люди представляли,\\nчто под землёй обитает Тортерра\\nгигантских "
"размеров."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 390: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/443
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 195, 184, 107
#: 0x165c3ac
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/390"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/390"
msgstr ""
"Пламя на его заду питается газом,\\nкоторый образуется у него в животе.\\n"
"Его не погасить даже дождём."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 391: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/444
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 199, 188, 79
#: 0x165c408
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/391"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/391"
msgstr ""
"Чтобы запугать нападающих, он\\nвытягивает пламя на хвосте\\nи кажется "
"крупнее."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 392: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/445
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 180, 209, 129
#: 0x165c461
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/392"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/392"
msgstr ""
"Он ловко расшвыривает врагов.\\nВ бою он пускает в ход и руки, и ноги,\\n"
"сражаясь в своём особом стиле."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 393: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/446
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 189, 207, 140
#: 0x165c4c4
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/393"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/393"
msgstr ""
"Он очень гордый, поэтому\\nтерпеть не может брать еду у людей.\\nГустой "
"пух защищает его от холода."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 394: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/447
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 215, 191, 108
#: 0x165c527
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/394"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/394"
msgstr ""
"Каждый Принплап считает себя самым\\nглавным, поэтому они никогда\\nне "
"могут объединиться в группу."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 395: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/448
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 209, 203, 52
#: 0x165c586
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/395"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/395"
msgstr ""
"Он избегает лишних споров,\\nно уничтожит всё, что угрожает\\nего "
"гордости."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 396: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/449
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 198, 214, 34
#: 0x165c5de
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/396"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/396"
msgstr ""
"Они сбиваются в огромные стаи.\\nНесмотря на малый рост, они машут\\n"
"крыльями с большой силой."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 397: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/450
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 166, 198, 81
#: 0x165c631
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/397"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/397"
msgstr ""
"Он живёт в лесах и полях. Когда стаи\\nвстречаются, они ссорятся\\nиз-за "
"территории."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 398: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/451
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 174, 205, 68
#: 0x165c685
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/398"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/398"
msgstr ""
"У него свирепый нрав. Он отважно\\nбросает вызов врагам, которые\\n"
"гораздо крупнее его."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 399: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/452
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 181, 215, 88
#: 0x165c6d7
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/399"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/399"
msgstr ""
"У него стальные нервы: ничто не может\\nвывести его из равновесия. Он "
"проворнее\\nи активнее, чем кажется."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 400: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/453
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 199, 200, 101
#: 0x165c732
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/400"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/400"
msgstr ""
"Он строит гнездо, перегораживая ручьи\\nплотинами из коры и грязи.\\n"
"Славится трудолюбием."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 401: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/454
#. original lines: 2, widths px: 198, 207
#: 0x165c790
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/401"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/401"
msgstr ""
"Когда его усики ударяются друг о друга,\\nони звенят, словно ксилофон."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 402: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/455
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 169, 212, 93
#: 0x165c7db
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/402"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/402"
msgstr ""
"Он выражает свои чувства мелодиями.\\nУчёные изучают мелодический\\n"
"рисунок этих песен."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 403: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/456
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 191, 182, 109
#: 0x165c836
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/403"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/403"
msgstr ""
"Когда он чует опасность,\\nвся его шерсть ослепительно вспыхивает.\\nПока "
"враг на миг ослеплён, он сбегает."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 404: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/457
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 186, 188, 120
#: 0x165c891
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/404"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/404"
msgstr ""
"Он кладёт передние лапы на сородичей\\nи общается с ними ритмичными\\n"
"электрическими импульсами из когтей."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 405: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/458
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 198, 203, 34
#: 0x165c8ee
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/405"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/405"
msgstr ""
"Он отчётливо видит сквозь стены,\\nвыслеживая добычу и разыскивая\\n"
"потерявшихся детёнышей."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 406: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/459
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 188, 188, 137
#: 0x165c93f
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/406"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/406"
msgstr ""
"Он живёт у чистых прудов и рассеивает\\nпыльцу, которая вызывает "
"сильное\\nчихание и насморк."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 407: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/460
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 202, 209, 62
#: 0x165c99f
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/407"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/407"
msgstr ""
"Он приманивает добычу сладким ароматом,\\nа затем сражает её шипастыми "
"плетями,\\nспрятанными в руках."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 408: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/461
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 209, 189, 25
#: 0x165c9f8
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/408"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/408"
msgstr ""
"Он жил в джунглях около\\n100 миллионов лет назад.\\nЕго череп твёрд, как "
"железо."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 409: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/462
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 218, 218, 67
#: 0x165ca48
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/409"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/409"
msgstr ""
"Его мощный удар головой способен\\nразбить вдребезги даже\\nсамые прочные "
"предметы."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 410: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/463
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 182, 197, 131
#: 0x165caa4
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/410"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/410"
msgstr ""
"У него превосходная броня. Поэтому\\nон может есть траву и ягоды,\\nне "
"вступая в бой."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 411: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/464
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 203, 218, 34
#: 0x165cb04
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/411"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/411"
msgstr ""
"При нападении они выстраиваются стеной,\\nвыставляя морды-щиты, чтобы "
"защитить\\nдетёнышей."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 412: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/465, table:species/707, table:species/708
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 193, 221, 39
#: 0x165cb59
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/412"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/412"
msgstr ""
"Если в бою его плащ порвётся, он быстро\\nделает новый из того, что "
"окажется\\nрядом."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 413: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/466, table:species/709, table:species/710
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 220, 187, 33
#: 0x165cbaf
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/413"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/413"
msgstr ""
"Говорят, что у Вормадам, которая\\nэволюционирует в холодный день,\\nплащ "
"будет толще."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 414: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/467
#. original lines: 2, widths px: 209, 155
#: 0x165cc00
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/414"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/414"
msgstr "Ночью он порхает повсюду и крадёт\\nмёд из улья Комби."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 415: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/468
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 205, 199, 55
#: 0x165cc43
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/415"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/415"
msgstr ""
"Покемон, состоящий из трёх других.\\nОн деловито носит Веспиквен\\n"
"сладкий цветочный мёд."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 416: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/469
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 189, 220, 41
#: 0x165cc98
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/416"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/416"
msgstr ""
"Она выращивает личинок в отверстиях\\nсвоего тела. Чтобы управлять "
"Комби,\\nона выделяет феромоны."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 417: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/470
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 203, 186, 119
#: 0x165ccec
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/417"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/417"
msgstr ""
"Это один из видов покемонов\\nс электрическими мешочками на щеках.\\nИз "
"хвоста он выпускает заряды."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 418: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/471
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 209, 200, 78
#: 0x165cd4b
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/418"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/418"
msgstr ""
"Он плавает, вращая двумя хвостами,\\nкак винтом. Когда он ныряет,\\nего "
"плавательный мешок сдувается."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 419: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/472
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 192, 218, 84
#: 0x165cda8
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/419"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/419"
msgstr ""
"Его часто можно увидеть в рыбацких\\nпортах. Известно, что он спасает "
"людей\\nи уносит добычу."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 420: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/473
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 188, 208, 82
#: 0x165ce04
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/420"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/420"
msgstr ""
"Маленький шарик не только полон\\nпитательных веществ, но и вкусен.\\n"
"Старли пытаются его склевать."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 421: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/474, table:species/751
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 176, 181, 174
#: 0x165ce5f
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/421"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/421"
msgstr ""
"Он расцветает при ярком солнце\\nи старается вознаградить себя за всё,\\n"
"что вытерпел, пока был бутоном."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 422: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/475, table:species/711
#. original lines: 2, widths px: 168, 136
#: 0x165cec2
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/422"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/422"
msgstr "Его форма и окраска зависят\\nот места обитания."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 423: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/476, table:species/712
#. original lines: 2, widths px: 186, 175
#: 0x165cefb
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/423"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/423"
msgstr ""
"Когда нападает его естественный враг,\\nон выделяет лиловую жидкость и "
"сбегает."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 424: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/477
#. original lines: 2, widths px: 183, 198
#: 0x165cf3e
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/424"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/424"
msgstr "Увернуться от серии ударов\\nдвух его хвостов очень трудно."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 425: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/478
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 189, 179, 122
#: 0x165cf86
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/425"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/425"
msgstr ""
"Рассказывают, что он хватает\\nмаленьких детей за руки и утаскивает\\nих "
"в загробный мир."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 426: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/479
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 178, 151, 180
#: 0x165cfe1
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/426"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/426"
msgstr ""
"Он хватает людей и покемонов\\nи куда-то их уносит. Куда они\\nпропадают? "
"Никто не знает."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 427: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/480
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 222, 215, 91
#: 0x165d03d
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/427"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/427"
msgstr ""
"Его уши всегда свёрнуты.\\nС силой распрямляясь, они могут\\nразбить даже "
"большой валун."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 428: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/481, table:species/912
#. original lines: 2, widths px: 188, 161
#: 0x165d09d
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/428"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/428"
msgstr "Он линяет дважды в год.\\nЗимний мех у него мягкий и пушистый."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 429: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/482
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 185, 200, 86
#: 0x165d0df
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/429"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/429"
msgstr ""
"Он нараспев читает заклинания. Обычно\\nони мучают тех, на кого "
"направлены,\\nно некоторые приносят счастье."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 430: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/483
#. original lines: 2, widths px: 201, 211
#: 0x165d138
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/430"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/430"
msgstr ""
"Известно, что ночью он оживляется\\nи летает в окружении множества "
"Муркроу."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 431: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/484
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 212, 182, 82
#: 0x165d185
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/431"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/431"
msgstr ""
"Пронзительным взглядом он погружает\\nврагов в лёгкий гипноз.\\nЭто очень "
"переменчивый покемон."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 432: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/485
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 195, 215, 76
#: 0x165d1df
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/432"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/432"
msgstr ""
"Чтобы выглядеть устрашающе крупным,\\nон туго стягивает талию\\nдвумя "
"хвостами."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 433: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/486
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 203, 206, 82
#: 0x165d23d
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/433"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/433"
msgstr ""
"Он издаёт крики, встряхивая\\nшарик в глубине горла.\\nПередвигается "
"вприпрыжку."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 434: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/487
#. original lines: 2, widths px: 206, 181
#: 0x165d299
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/434"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/434"
msgstr ""
"Чтобы отогнать нападающих, он брызгает\\nсзади тошнотворно вонючей "
"жидкостью."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 435: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/488
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 197, 218, 95
#: 0x165d2e2
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/435"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/435"
msgstr ""
"Атакуя, он брызгает из кончика хвоста\\nзловонной жидкостью. Струя бьёт\\n"
"более чем на 50 м."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 436: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/489
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 203, 186, 46
#: 0x165d342
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/436"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/436"
msgstr ""
"Чтобы изучить строение его тела,\\nсделали рентгеновские снимки.\\nОднако "
"на них ничего не проявилось."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 437: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/490
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 157, 201, 132
#: 0x165d392
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/437"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/437"
msgstr ""
"Древние люди верили, что посевы\\nбудут расти, если молить\\nБронзонга о "
"дожде."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 438: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/491
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 207, 182, 108
#: 0x165d3ed
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/438"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/438"
msgstr ""
"Он любит засушливые места. Из глаз\\nу него сочится вода: так он "
"регулирует\\nуровень жидкости в теле."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 439: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/492, table:species/1228
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 171, 210, 93
#: 0x165d44b
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/439"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/439"
msgstr ""
"Он по привычке передразнивает врагов.\\nТот, кого он передразнил, уже не "
"может\\nотвести глаз от этого покемона."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 440: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/493
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 214, 187, 45
#: 0x165d4a4
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/440"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/440"
msgstr ""
"Она обожает круглые белые предметы.\\nПодражая Ченси, носит с собой\\n"
"камень в форме яйца."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 441: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/494
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 214, 193, 40
#: 0x165d4f8
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/441"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/441"
msgstr ""
"Его язык точь-в-точь как у человека.\\nПоэтому он может ловко подражать\\n"
"человеческой речи."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 442: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/495
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 185, 209, 74
#: 0x165d54c
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/442"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/442"
msgstr ""
"Покемон, который образовался\\nиз 108 духов. Он привязан к трещине\\nв "
"Ключе-камне."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 443: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/496
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 211, 207, 91
#: 0x165d5a3
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/443"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/443"
msgstr ""
"Когда-то он жил в тропиках.\\nСпасаясь от холода, он живёт в пещерах,\\n"
"согретых геотермальным теплом."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 444: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/497
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 181, 213, 72
#: 0x165d601
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/444"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/444"
msgstr ""
"Он обожает всё блестящее.\\nИщет сокровища в пещерах и стаскивает\\n"
"находки в своё гнездо."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 445: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/498, table:species/913
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 186, 215, 57
#: 0x165d659
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/445"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/445"
msgstr ""
"Он летает со скоростью реактивного\\nистребителя. Он никогда не даёт\\n"
"добыче уйти."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 446: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/499
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 217, 205, 28
#: 0x165d6ae
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/446"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/446"
msgstr ""
"Он прячет еду под своей длинной\\nшерстью. Однако потом забывает,\\nчто "
"спрятал её."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 447: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/500
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 204, 188, 77
#: 0x165d702
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/447"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/447"
msgstr ""
"Когда ему страшно или грустно, аура,\\nисходящая от его тела, "
"усиливается,\\nпредупреждая сородичей."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 448: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/501, table:species/914
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 206, 193, 40
#: 0x165d75b
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/448"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/448"
msgstr ""
"Он умеет чувствовать ауру\\nвсего сущего. Понимает\\nчеловеческую речь."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 449: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/502, table:species/744
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 192, 217, 49
#: 0x165d7ad
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/449"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/449"
msgstr ""
"Он живёт в засушливых местах.\\nВместо пота он выделяет из тела\\n"
"зернистый песок."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 450: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/503, table:species/745
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 203, 175, 48
#: 0x165d804
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/450"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/450"
msgstr ""
"На удивление вспыльчив.\\nЧтобы показать силу, он держит\\nпасть широко "
"раскрытой."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 451: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/504
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 178, 186, 99
#: 0x165d854
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/451"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/451"
msgstr ""
"Он живёт в засушливых краях.\\nЗарывшись в песок, он подстерегает\\n"
"ничего не подозревающую добычу."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 452: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/505
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 211, 165, 126
#: 0x165d8ad
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/452"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/452"
msgstr ""
"Его тело заключено в прочный панцирь.\\nГолова поворачивается на 180 "
"градусов,\\nпоэтому у него нет слепых зон."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 453: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/506
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 204, 144, 65
#: 0x165d90b
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/453"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/453"
msgstr ""
"Раздувая ядовитые мешки, он издаёт\\nжуткое бульканье для устрашения."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 454: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/507
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 200, 205, 32
#: 0x165d95b
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/454"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/454"
msgstr ""
"Когти на его костяшках выделяют\\nтакой ужасный яд, что даже царапина\\n"
"может оказаться смертельной."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 455: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/508
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 169, 195, 163
#: 0x165d9ac
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/455"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/455"
msgstr ""
"Свисая с веток на щупальцах, он похож\\nна растение. Он поджидает "
"добычу,\\nшироко раскрыв пасть."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 456: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/509
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 185, 194, 31
#: 0x165da0f
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/456"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/456"
msgstr ""
"Полоса вдоль его бока может\\nнакапливать солнечный свет.\\nНочью он ярко "
"сияет."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 457: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/510
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 196, 212, 76
#: 0x165da5e
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/457"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/457"
msgstr ""
"Люминеоны, плавающие во тьме морских\\nглубин, похожи на звёзды,\\n"
"сияющие в ночном небе."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 458: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/511
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 164, 208, 55
#: 0x165daba
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/458"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/458"
msgstr ""
"Учёные выяснили, что характерные\\nузоры у него на спине отличаются\\nот "
"региона к региону."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 459: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/512
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 195, 216, 33
#: 0x165db0c
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/459"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/459"
msgstr ""
"Весной у него вокруг живота вырастают\\nягоды, по текстуре похожие\\nна "
"мороженое."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 460: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/513, table:species/915
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 183, 214, 120
#: 0x165db60
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/460"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/460"
msgstr ""
"Поднимая бураны, он укрывает снегом\\nобширные края. Его также называют\\n"
"“Ледяным чудовищем”."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 461: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/514
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 204, 217, 21
#: 0x165dbc0
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/461"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/461"
msgstr ""
"Он подаёт сигналы сородичам, вырезая\\nстранные узоры на покрытых инеем\\n"
"деревьях и на льду."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 462: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/515
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 211, 198, 54
#: 0x165dc13
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/462"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/462"
msgstr ""
"Он эволюционировал под воздействием\\nособого магнитного поля. Три его "
"блока\\nвырабатывают магнетизм."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 463: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/516
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 203, 210, 117
#: 0x165dc69
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/463"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/463"
msgstr ""
"Длинный язык всегда мокрый от слюны.\\nВ слюне содержится растворитель,\\n"
"вызывающий онемение."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 464: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/517
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 200, 199, 103
#: 0x165dccb
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/464"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/464"
msgstr ""
"Из отверстий в ладонях\\nон выстреливает Геодудами. Его панцирь\\nможет "
"выдержать извержение вулкана."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 465: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/518
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 198, 217, 28
#: 0x165dd29
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/465"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/465"
msgstr ""
"Его лозы разрастаются так буйно,\\nчто в тёплое время года за ними\\nне "
"видно даже глаз."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 466: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/519
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 208, 193, 32
#: 0x165dd7c
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/466"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/466"
msgstr ""
"Когда его электрический заряд растёт,\\nмежду рогами начинают с треском\\n"
"проскакивать синие искры."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 467: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/520
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 171, 206, 145
#: 0x165ddce
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/467"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/467"
msgstr ""
"Когда он мечет огненные шары\\nтемпературой 2000 градусов, его тело\\nот "
"сильного жара становится беловатым."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 468: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/521
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 196, 209, 49
#: 0x165de2f
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/468"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/468"
msgstr ""
"Он никогда не появляется там,\\nгде царит вражда. В последнее время\\nего "
"видят всё реже."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 469: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/522
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 186, 214, 97
#: 0x165de84
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/469"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/469"
msgstr ""
"У него невероятно сильные челюсти.\\nОн ловко перекусывает врагов,\\n"
"пролетая мимо на большой скорости."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 470: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/523
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 141, 183, 167
#: 0x165dee1
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/470"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/470"
msgstr ""
"Как и растения, он способен\\nк фотосинтезу. Поэтому его всегда\\n"
"окутывает чистый воздух."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 471: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/524
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 218, 174, 127
#: 0x165df3e
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/471"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/471"
msgstr ""
"Понижая температуру окружающего\\nвоздуха, он создаёт мелкие\\n"
"кристаллики льда."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 472: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/525
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 217, 220, 96
#: 0x165df9e
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/472"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/472"
msgstr ""
"Вися вниз головой на ветке,\\nон следит за добычей. Как только\\n"
"представится случай, он пикирует!"

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 473: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/526
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 187, 222, 87
#: 0x165e001
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/473"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/473"
msgstr ""
"Одного замёрзшего Мамосвайна выкопали\\nиз слоя почвы возрастом 10000 "
"лет.\\nКо всеобщему изумлению, он проснулся."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 474: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/527
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 212, 193, 89
#: 0x165e05b
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/474"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/474"
msgstr ""
"Его программу изменили, чтобы он мог\\nработать в иных измерениях.\\nНо "
"всё вышло не так, как планировалось."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 475: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/528, table:species/916
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 218, 209, 39
#: 0x165e0b8
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/475"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/475"
msgstr ""
"Мастер учтивости и фехтования,\\nон сражается выдвижными мечами\\nна "
"локтях."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 476: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/529
#. original lines: 2, widths px: 197, 214
#: 0x165e110
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/476"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/476"
msgstr ""
"Магнитной силой он свободно управляет\\nтремя маленькими блоками - "
"мини-носами."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 477: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/530
#. original lines: 2, widths px: 191, 202
#: 0x165e15d
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/477"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/477"
msgstr ""
"Говорят, что он вбирает заблудшие души\\nв податливое тело и провожает их "
"домой."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 478: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/531
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 195, 208, 127
#: 0x165e1a7
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/478"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/478"
msgstr ""
"По легендам снежных краёв, женщина,\\nзаблудившаяся на ледяной горе,\\n"
"переродилась в Фросласс."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 479: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/532, table:species/713, table:species/714, table:species/715, table:species/716, table:species/717
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 193, 175, 137
#: 0x165e209
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/479"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/479"
msgstr ""
"Его тело состоит из плазмы. Известно,\\nчто он проникает в электронные "
"приборы\\nи сеет хаос."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 480: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/533
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 211, 217, 146
#: 0x165e267
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/480"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/480"
msgstr ""
"Его называют “Существом знания”.\\nГоворят, что он может стереть память\\n"
"тем, кто увидит его глаза."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 481: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/534
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 197, 205, 78
#: 0x165e2d0
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/481"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/481"
msgstr ""
"Его называют “Существом эмоций”.\\nОн открыл людям благородство\\nпечали, "
"боли и радости."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 482: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/535
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 208, 216, 117
#: 0x165e329
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/482"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/482"
msgstr ""
"Его называют “Существом силы воли”.\\nОн спит на дне озера, поддерживая\\n"
"равновесие в мире."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 483: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/536, table:species/919
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 169, 217, 67
#: 0x165e38c
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/483"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/483"
msgstr ""
"Легендарный покемон Синно. Говорят,\\nчто, когда бьётся сердце Диалги,\\n"
"течёт время."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 484: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/537, table:species/920
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 198, 159, 133
#: 0x165e3e1
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/484"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/484"
msgstr ""
"Он способен искажать пространство.\\nВ мифологии региона Синно его\\n"
"описывают как божество."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 485: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/538
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 214, 211, 102
#: 0x165e43d
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/485"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/485"
msgstr ""
"Он обитает в вулканических пещерах.\\nВпиваясь крестообразными лапами,\\n"
"ползает по стенам и потолку."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 486: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/539
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 216, 186, 33
#: 0x165e4a0
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/486"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/486"
msgstr ""
"По давней легенде, этот покемон\\nперетаскивал континенты на канатах."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 487: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/540, table:species/718
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 198, 214, 113
#: 0x165e4f2
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/487"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/487"
msgstr ""
"Его изгнали за жестокость.\\nОн молча взирал на старый мир\\nиз Мира "
"деформации."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 488: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/541
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 213, 176, 121
#: 0x165e554
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/488"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/488"
msgstr ""
"В ночи, близкие к лунной четверти,\\nсияние её хвоста вытягивается\\nи "
"красиво колышется."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 489: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/542
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 181, 216, 157
#: 0x165e5b3
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/489"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/489"
msgstr ""
"Он дрейфует в тёплых морях.\\nКак бы далеко его ни унесло, он всегда\\n"
"возвращается туда, где родился."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 490: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/543
#. original lines: 2, widths px: 207, 209
#: 0x165e61a
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/490"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/490"
msgstr ""
"Он рождается с чудесной способностью\\nсближаться с покемонами любого "
"вида."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 491: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/544
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 194, 208, 79
#: 0x165e667
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/491"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/491"
msgstr ""
"Защищаясь, он насылает кошмары\\nна всех вокруг. Однако зла\\nон никому "
"не желает."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 492: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/545, table:species/719
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 196, 214, 92
#: 0x165e6c2
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/492"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/492"
msgstr ""
"Когда его ласково обнимают и он\\nчувствует благодарность, цветы\\nпо "
"всему его телу разом расцветают."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 493: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/546, table:species/720, table:species/721, table:species/722, table:species/723, table:species/724, table:species/725, table:species/726, table:species/727, table:species/728, table:species/729, table:species/730, table:species/731, table:species/732, table:species/733, table:species/734, table:species/735, table:species/834
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 181, 203, 72
#: 0x165e720
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/493"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/493"
msgstr ""
"В мифах говорится, что этот покемон\\nродился ещё до появления Вселенной."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 494: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/547
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 183, 213, 134
#: 0x165e775
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/494"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/494"
msgstr ""
"Он вырабатывает в своём теле\\nнеисчерпаемую энергию и делится ею\\nс "
"теми, кто к нему прикасается."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 495: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/548
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 207, 204, 98
#: 0x165e7d8
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/495"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/495"
msgstr ""
"Он очень умный и спокойный. Когда\\nна него падает много солнечного "
"света,\\nего движения становятся быстрее."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 496: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/549
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 212, 197, 103
#: 0x165e838
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/496"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/496"
msgstr ""
"Грязные листья не годятся\\nдля фотосинтеза, поэтому он всегда\\nследит "
"за чистотой."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 497: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/550
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 198, 198, 116
#: 0x165e899
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/497"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/497"
msgstr ""
"Одним взглядом он может сковать\\nдвижения противников. Он вбирает\\n"
"солнечную энергию и усиливает её."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 498: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/551
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 201, 216, 89
#: 0x165e8f9
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/498"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/498"
msgstr ""
"Он обожает жареные ягоды, но иногда\\nслишком увлекается и сжигает их в "
"уголь."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 499: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/552
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 197, 220, 145
#: 0x165e957
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/499"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/499"
msgstr ""
"Когда внутренний огонь разгорается,\\nего движения становятся резче\\nи "
"быстрее. В беде он выпускает дым."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 500: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/553
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 186, 196, 25
#: 0x165e9c1
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/500"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/500"
msgstr ""
"Он овладел быстрыми и мощными\\nбоевыми приёмами. У него растёт\\n"
"огненная борода."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 501: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/554
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 209, 194, 134
#: 0x165ea0d
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/501"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/501"
msgstr ""
"Гребешок на животе нужен ему\\nне только для боя -\\nим он ещё "
"раскалывает твёрдые ягоды."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 502: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/555
#. original lines: 2, widths px: 189, 191
#: 0x165ea71
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/502"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/502"
msgstr ""
"Плавной технике боя двумя гребешками\\nон учится на суровых тренировках."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 503: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/556, table:species/1241
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 212, 192, 148
#: 0x165eab9
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/503"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/503"
msgstr ""
"Враг не успеет и моргнуть, как он\\nвыхватит клинки на передних лапах\\nи "
"вернёт их в ножны."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 504: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/557
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 190, 220, 140
#: 0x165eb20
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/504"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/504"
msgstr ""
"Эти покемоны крайне осторожны:\\nодин из них всегда на страже, но "
"врага,\\nподошедшего сзади, он не заметит."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 505: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/558
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 204, 214, 55
#: 0x165eb86
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/505"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/505"
msgstr ""
"Благодаря светящемуся веществу\\nего глаза и тело сияют, ошеломляя\\n"
"нападающих противников."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 506: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/559
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 216, 199, 144
#: 0x165ebdf
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/506"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/506"
msgstr ""
"Этот покемон очень храбр, но ещё\\nи достаточно умён, чтобы оценить "
"силу\\nврага и уклониться от боя."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 507: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/560
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 217, 173, 45
#: 0x165ec47
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/507"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/507"
msgstr ""
"Этот очень преданный покемон помогает\\nтренерам, а также заботится\\nо "
"других покемонах."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 508: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/561
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 208, 206, 76
#: 0x165ec98
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/508"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/508"
msgstr ""
"Этот невероятно мудрый покемон\\nмастерски спасает людей, попавших\\nв "
"беду в море или в горах."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 509: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/562
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 201, 207, 115
#: 0x165ecf3
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/509"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/509"
msgstr ""
"Они обманывают людей своим милым\\nвидом и крадут их ценности, просто\\n"
"чтобы увидеть выражение их лиц."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 510: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/563
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 196, 214, 116
#: 0x165ed54
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/510"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/510"
msgstr ""
"Своей красивой фигурой они обязаны\\nразвитым мышцам.\\nНочью они "
"бесшумно бегают."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 511: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/564
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 195, 221, 130
#: 0x165edb5
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/511"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/511"
msgstr ""
"Листом с головы он делится\\nс усталыми на вид покемонами. Известно,\\n"
"что эти листья снимают стресс."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 512: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/565
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 155, 224, 51
#: 0x165ee1a
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/512"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/512"
msgstr ""
"Он хлещет врагов хвостом, покрытым\\nшипами. Лист на его голове горький."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 513: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/566
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 186, 200, 40
#: 0x165ee6c
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/513"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/513"
msgstr ""
"Он очень умён и, прежде чем съесть\\nягоды, поджаривает их.\\nЛюбит "
"помогать людям."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 514: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/567
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 202, 204, 29
#: 0x165eebd
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/514"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/514"
msgstr ""
"Он обожает сладкое, ведь оно\\nпревращается в энергию для огня,\\n"
"горящего у него внутри."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 515: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/568
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 214, 196, 115
#: 0x165ef0e
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/515"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/515"
msgstr ""
"Вода, запасённая в хохолке на его\\nголове, богата питательными "
"веществами.\\nХвостом он поливает растения."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 516: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/569
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 210, 211, 90
#: 0x165ef72
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/516"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/516"
msgstr ""
"Он выпускает из хвоста воду под таким\\nвысоким давлением, что она "
"может\\nразрушить бетонную стену."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 517: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/570
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 217, 209, 101
#: 0x165efd1
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/517"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/517"
msgstr ""
"Этот покемон является людям\\nи покемонам, которым снятся кошмары,\\nи "
"съедает эти сны."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 518: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/571
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 216, 221, 45
#: 0x165f031
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/518"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/518"
msgstr "Туман, исходящий у них изо лба,\\nполон снов людей и покемонов."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 519: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/572
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 211, 193, 150
#: 0x165f08a
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/519"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/519"
msgstr ""
"Эти покемоны живут в городах и привыкли\\nк людям. Их стаи часто "
"собираются\\nв парках и на площадях."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 520: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/573
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 209, 204, 28
#: 0x165f0f0
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/520"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/520"
msgstr ""
"Он может вернуться к своему тренеру,\\nкак бы далеко они ни были\\nдруг "
"от друга."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 521: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/574, table:species/703
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 214, 196, 92
#: 0x165f144
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/521"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/521"
msgstr ""
"Самцы трясут перьями на голове,\\nзапугивая окружающих, но самки\\nлетают "
"лучше."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 522: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/575
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 176, 207, 133
#: 0x165f1a1
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/522"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/522"
msgstr ""
"Когда он испускает электричество,\\nего грива сияет. Вспышками гривы\\nон "
"общается с сородичами."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 523: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/576
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 194, 209, 94
#: 0x165f202
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/523"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/523"
msgstr ""
"Когда этот покемон со скверным нравом\\nбуйствует, он мечет молнии из "
"гривы\\nво все стороны."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 524: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/577
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 167, 212, 78
#: 0x165f261
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/524"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/524"
msgstr ""
"Его ухо шестиугольной формы.\\nСпрессованное под землёй, его тело\\n"
"твёрдое, как сталь."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 525: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/578
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 198, 198, 128
#: 0x165f2b6
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/525"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/525"
msgstr ""
"Энергия в нём была слишком велика,\\nчтобы её сдержать, и, просочившись\\n"
"наружу, образовала оранжевые кристаллы."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 526: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/579
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 219, 210, 48
#: 0x165f316
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/526"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/526"
msgstr ""
"Солнечные лучи, которые он поглощает,\\nперерабатываются в энергетическом "
"ядре\\nи вылетают световым шаром."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 527: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/580
#. original lines: 2, widths px: 213, 174
#: 0x165f36f
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/527"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/527"
msgstr ""
"Он испускает носом ультразвуковые\\nволны, чтобы изучать всё вокруг."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 528: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/581
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 201, 216, 148
#: 0x165f3b8
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/528"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/528"
msgstr ""
"Испуская ультразвуковые волны,\\nспособные превратить бетон в щебень,\\n"
"он энергично трясёт хвостом."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 529: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/582
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 173, 215, 58
#: 0x165f421
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/529"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/529"
msgstr "Вращая тело, он может рыть землю\\nнапрямик со скоростью 50 км/ч."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 530: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/583
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 195, 204, 170
#: 0x165f474
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/530"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/530"
msgstr ""
"Складывая стальные когти и голову\\nв бур, он может пробить\\nстальную "
"плиту любой толщины."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 531: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/584, table:species/917
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 201, 212, 91
#: 0x165f4de
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/531"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/531"
msgstr ""
"Усиками на ушах он может определить,\\nкак чувствуют себя окружающие\\n"
"или когда проклюнется яйцо."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 532: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/585
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 220, 199, 129
#: 0x165f53c
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/532"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/532"
msgstr ""
"Они всегда носят с собой брусья\\nи помогают на стройках. Подрастая,\\n"
"они носят всё более крупные брусья."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 533: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/586
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 166, 197, 81
#: 0x165f5a1
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/533"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/533"
msgstr ""
"Укрепив тела, они ловко орудуют\\nстальными балками и сносят здания."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 534: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/587
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 201, 212, 92
#: 0x165f5f5
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/534"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/534"
msgstr ""
"Считается, что более 2000 лет назад\\nКонкельдурр научил людей\\nделать "
"бетон."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 535: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/588
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 219, 208, 33
#: 0x165f651
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/535"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/535"
msgstr ""
"Они предупреждают сородичей\\nоб опасности, вибрируя щеками\\nи издавая "
"пронзительный звук."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 536: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/589
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 205, 215, 28
#: 0x165f6a6
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/536"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/536"
msgstr ""
"Он живёт и в воде, и на суше.\\nДлинным липким языком он ловит добычу."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 537: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/590
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 191, 197, 117
#: 0x165f6fa
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/537"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/537"
msgstr ""
"Направляя силу в шишки на теле,\\nон создаёт вибрацию и усиливает\\nсвои "
"удары кулаками."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 538: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/591
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 201, 218, 87
#: 0x165f759
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/538"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/538"
msgstr ""
"Затягивая пояс, он становится сильнее.\\nДикие Трохи плетут себе пояса из "
"лоз."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 539: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/592
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 192, 223, 123
#: 0x165f7b8
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/539"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/539"
msgstr ""
"Стремясь отточить сильнейший удар\\nребром ладони, они уединяются в "
"горах\\nи тренируются без сна."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 540: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/593
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 176, 212, 158
#: 0x165f81d
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/540"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/540"
msgstr ""
"Этот покемон сам шьёт себе одежду\\nиз листьев, поэтому модельеры\\nчасто "
"выбирают его талисманом."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 541: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/594
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 215, 194, 103
#: 0x165f883
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/541"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/541"
msgstr ""
"Он любит тёмные сырые места\\nи весь день ест опавшие листья,\\nлежащие "
"вокруг."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 542: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/595
#. original lines: 2, widths px: 207, 98
#: 0x165f8e3
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/542"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/542"
msgstr "Он согревает свои яйца теплом\\nпреющих листьев."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 543: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/596
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 180, 211, 127
#: 0x165f91c
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/543"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/543"
msgstr ""
"Укусом он впрыскивает сильный яд,\\nспособный парализовать крупных\\n"
"покемонов-птиц, охотящихся на него."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 544: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/597
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 214, 219, 89
#: 0x165f97c
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/544"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/544"
msgstr ""
"Под защитой твёрдого панциря он\\nвращается, как колесо, и яростно\\n"
"врезается во врагов."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 545: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/598
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 199, 211, 89
#: 0x165f9de
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/545"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/545"
msgstr ""
"Он очень агрессивен: когтями у шеи\\nон впивается в противников\\nи "
"отравляет их."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 546: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/599
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 207, 227, 137
#: 0x165fa3c
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/546"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/546"
msgstr ""
"При нападении он выстреливает из тела\\nхлопком, чтобы отвлечь "
"нападающего,\\nи сбегает."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 547: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/600
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 209, 198, 153
#: 0x165faa5
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/547"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/547"
msgstr ""
"Словно ветер, он проскальзывает\\nв любую щель, даже самую узкую.\\nЗа "
"ним остаются комочки белого пуха."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 548: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/601
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 219, 211, 117
#: 0x165fb0d
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/548"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/548"
msgstr ""
"Листья на его голове очень горькие.\\nИзвестно, что, съев один такой "
"лист,\\nможно снять усталость."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 549: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/602, table:species/1242
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 196, 212, 156
#: 0x165fb72
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/549"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/549"
msgstr ""
"Аромат венка на её голове успокаивает,\\nно ухаживать за ним очень трудно."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 550: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/603, table:species/736, table:species/1243
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 210, 217, 81
#: 0x165fbdb
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/550"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/550"
msgstr ""
"Свирепые, буйные покемоны: красные\\nи синие Баскулины постоянно "
"дерутся\\nдруг с другом за территорию."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 551: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/604
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 219, 219, 77
#: 0x165fc39
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/551"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/551"
msgstr ""
"Они живут, укрывшись под горячим\\nпеском пустыни, чтобы температура\\nих "
"тела не падала."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 552: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/605
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 210, 192, 127
#: 0x165fc98
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/552"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/552"
msgstr ""
"Часть добычи он закапывает в песок\\nпро запас на случай неудачной охоты."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 553: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/606
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 201, 211, 86
#: 0x165fcfa
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/553"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/553"
msgstr ""
"Он прячется в песчаных бурях, которые\\nподнимают Флайгоны, и терпеливо "
"ждёт\\nпоявления добычи."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 554: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/607, table:species/1229
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 208, 189, 138
#: 0x165fd57
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/554"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/554"
msgstr ""
"Во сне он втягивает руки и ноги в тело,\\nа его внутренний огонь "
"остывает\\nдо 600 градусов."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 555: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/608, table:species/737, table:species/1230, table:species/1231
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 208, 202, 136
#: 0x165fdbc
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/555"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/555"
msgstr ""
"Когда в бою его силы на исходе,\\nон превращается в каменную статую\\nи, "
"обострив разум, бьётся силой мысли."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 556: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/609
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 198, 185, 103
#: 0x165fe23
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/556"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/556"
msgstr ""
"Они обитают в засушливых краях.\\nДвигаясь ритмично, они издают звук,\\n"
"похожий на шорох маракасов."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 557: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/610
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 205, 211, 54
#: 0x165fe7e
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/557"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/557"
msgstr ""
"Этот покемон легко проделывает дыры\\nв твёрдых камнях, растворяя их\\n"
"жидкостью, которую выделяет изо рта."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 558: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/611
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 202, 184, 94
#: 0x165fed6
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/558"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/558"
msgstr ""
"Если в битве за территорию его камень\\nразбивают, он теряет "
"уверенность\\nи начинает слабеть."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 559: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/612
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 202, 213, 86
#: 0x165ff31
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/559"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/559"
msgstr ""
"Он тут же бьёт головой любого,\\nкто встретится с ним взглядом.\\nЕго "
"череп невероятно толстый."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 560: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/613
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 214, 182, 116
#: 0x165ff8f
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/560"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/560"
msgstr ""
"Этот покемон может быть грубым, но он\\nочень заботится о семье, "
"друзьях\\nи своей территории."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 561: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/614
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 211, 219, 105
#: 0x165ffef
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/561"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/561"
msgstr ""
"Стражи древнего города, они всегда\\nлетают по одному и тому же "
"маршруту,\\nвысматривая чужаков."

#. category: script; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 562: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/615, table:species/1232
#. original lines: 2, widths px: 210, 185
#: 0x1660052
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/562"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/562"
msgstr "Каждый носит маску, бывшую его\\nлицом, когда он был человеком."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 563: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/616
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 220, 180, 152
#: 0x166009a
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/563"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/563"
msgstr ""
"Грабителей могил, которые принимают их\\nза настоящие гробы и подходят "
"слишком\\nблизко, они запирают в своих телах."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 564: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/617
#. original lines: 2, widths px: 198, 215
#: 0x1660100
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/564"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/564"
msgstr ""
"Этот воссозданный из окаменелости\\nпокемон может нырять глубже 1000 м."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 565: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/618
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 219, 200, 87
#: 0x166014c
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/565"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/565"
msgstr ""
"Благодаря невероятно сильным челюстям\\nони разгрызают стальные балки и "
"камни\\nвместе с добычей."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 566: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/619
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 195, 199, 21
#: 0x16601a9
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/566"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/566"
msgstr ""
"Этот древний покемон-птица воссоздан\\nиз окаменелости. Крылья у него "
"есть,\\nно летать он пока не умеет."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 567: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/620
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 206, 211, 58
#: 0x16601f8
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/567"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/567"
msgstr ""
"Он лучше бегает, чем летает.\\nЧтобы взлететь, он разбегается\\nдо "
"скорости 40 км/ч."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 568: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/621
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 186, 205, 60
#: 0x1660251
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/568"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/568"
msgstr ""
"В поисках новых отбросов они ходят\\nза теми, кто мусорит. Они "
"постоянно\\nотрыгивают ядовитый газ."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 569: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/622, table:species/1272
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 201, 199, 38
#: 0x16602a4
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/569"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/569"
msgstr ""
"Когда они поглощают мусор, в их телах\\nобразуются новые виды ядовитых "
"газов\\nи жидкостей."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 570: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/623, table:species/1244
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 196, 185, 110
#: 0x16602f7
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/570"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/570"
msgstr ""
"Он превращается в точную копию врага,\\nобманывает его и, пользуясь "
"случаем,\\nсбегает."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 571: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/624, table:species/1245
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 202, 215, 49
#: 0x1660354
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/571"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/571"
msgstr ""
"Рассказывают, что те, кто пытался\\nпоймать Зороарка, попадали\\nв плен "
"иллюзии и несли наказание."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 572: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/625
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 208, 184, 30
#: 0x16603ab
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/572"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/572"
msgstr ""
"Минччино здороваются, тщательно\\nвычищая друг другу шерсть хвостами."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 573: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/626
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 209, 189, 88
#: 0x16603fa
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/573"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/573"
msgstr ""
"Их белая шерсть покрыта особым маслом,\\nблагодаря которому им легко\\n"
"отражать атаки."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 574: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/627
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 210, 214, 71
#: 0x1660455
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/574"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/574"
msgstr ""
"Похожие на ленты усики усиливают\\nих психическую силу. Они всегда\\n"
"пристально на что-то смотрят."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 575: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/628
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 188, 176, 189
#: 0x16604b2
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/575"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/575"
msgstr ""
"По старинным преданиям,\\nзвёздными ночами он управляет спящими\\nдетьми, "
"делая их своими друзьями."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 576: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/629
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 203, 216, 129
#: 0x166051b
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/576"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/576"
msgstr ""
"В пространстве, искажённом их\\nпсихической силой, видно звёздное небо\\n"
"за тысячи световых лет отсюда."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 577: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/630
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 220, 214, 64
#: 0x1660581
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/577"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/577"
msgstr ""
"Особая жидкость, окутывающая их тела,\\nпозволяет им выжить в любой среде."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 578: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/631
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 213, 206, 55
#: 0x16605de
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/578"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/578"
msgstr ""
"Когда две половинки их мозга думают\\nоб одном и том же, их психическая "
"сила\\nдостигает максимума."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 579: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/632
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 207, 205, 111
#: 0x1660637
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/579"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/579"
msgstr ""
"Когда Реюниклюсы пожимают друг другу\\nруки, между их мозгами "
"образуется\\nсеть, усиливающая психическую силу."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 580: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/633
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 209, 208, 56
#: 0x1660699
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/580"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/580"
msgstr ""
"При нападении он разбрызгивает воду\\nперьями и скрывается за завесой "
"брызг."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 581: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/634
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 215, 210, 55
#: 0x16606f1
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/581"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/581"
msgstr ""
"В сумерках Суанны начинают танцевать.\\nТанцующий в центре - вожак стаи."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 582: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/635
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 221, 219, 86
#: 0x166074a
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/582"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/582"
msgstr ""
"Если его обнять, он приятно холодит.\\nВ тёплых краях этим покемоном\\n"
"очень дорожат в семьях."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 583: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/636
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 204, 220, 42
#: 0x16607ab
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/583"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/583"
msgstr ""
"Этот выносливый покемон пережил\\nледниковый период. Он невероятно\\n"
"популярен в очень жарких краях."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 584: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/637
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 219, 217, 103
#: 0x1660802
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/584"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/584"
msgstr ""
"Если обе его головы разозлятся\\nодновременно, этот покемон выдыхает\\n"
"буран, засыпая всё вокруг снегом."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 585: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/638, table:species/738, table:species/739, table:species/740
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 213, 212, 126
#: 0x1660866
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/585"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/585"
msgstr ""
"Со сменой времён года меняются цвет\\nи запах его шерсти. По нему люди\\n"
"определяют время года."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 586: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/639, table:species/741, table:species/742, table:species/743
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 207, 227, 53
#: 0x16608cc
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/586"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/586"
msgstr ""
"Они кочуют в зависимости\\nот времени года, поэтому некоторые\\nназывают "
"Сосбаков вестниками весны."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 587: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/640
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 206, 223, 128
#: 0x1660926
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/587"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/587"
msgstr ""
"Они живут на верхушках деревьев.\\nИспуская электричество, они парят,\\n"
"раскрыв похожую на плащ перепонку."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 588: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/641
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 213, 224, 99
#: 0x166098e
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/588"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/588"
msgstr ""
"Почему-то они эволюционируют, когда\\nполучают электрическую энергию\\nво "
"время нападения на Шелмета."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 589: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/642
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 206, 227, 127
#: 0x16609f0
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/589"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/589"
msgstr ""
"Облачившись в панцирь, отнятый\\nу Шелмета, они защищаются им\\nи атакуют "
"двумя копьями."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 590: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/643
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 209, 178, 126
#: 0x1660a57
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/590"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/590"
msgstr ""
"Он приманивает покемонов узором,\\nточь-в-точь как у покебола, а затем\\n"
"выпускает ядовитые споры."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 591: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/644
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 224, 211, 39
#: 0x1660ab7
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/591"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/591"
msgstr ""
"Чтобы приманить добычу, он двигает\\nшляпками на обеих руках и танцует.\\n"
"Он любит сырые места."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 592: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/645, table:species/704
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 203, 193, 134
#: 0x1660b0d
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/592"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/592"
msgstr ""
"Они парализуют добычу ядом, а затем\\nутаскивают её в свои логова\\nна "
"глубину 8 км."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 593: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/646, table:species/705
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 187, 208, 124
#: 0x1660b6f
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/593"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/593"
msgstr ""
"Джеллисент всегда держится возле\\nроскошных круизных лайнеров и "
"танкеров\\nв надежде утащить добычу."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 594: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/647
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 175, 186, 39
#: 0x1660bd0
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/594"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/594"
msgstr "Особая оболочка, окутывающая\\nАломомолу, способна заживлять раны."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 595: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/648
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 212, 191, 149
#: 0x1660c1a
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/595"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/595"
msgstr ""
"Джолтики, живущие в городах, научились\\nвысасывать электричество из "
"розеток\\nв домах."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 596: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/649
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 214, 153, 162
#: 0x1660c82
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/596"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/596"
msgstr ""
"При нападении они создают\\nэлектрический барьер, выплёвывая\\nмножество "
"заряженных нитей."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 597: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/650
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 213, 198, 50
#: 0x1660ce4
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/597"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/597"
msgstr ""
"Они вонзают шипы в стены пещер\\nи впитывают минералы, которые\\nнаходят "
"в камне."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 598: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/651
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 185, 179, 127
#: 0x1660d3b
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/598"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/598"
msgstr ""
"Размахивая тремя шипастыми усиками\\nи стреляя шипами, он может "
"уничтожить\\nпротивника."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 599: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/652
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 214, 192, 39
#: 0x1660d98
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/599"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/599"
msgstr ""
"Два его тела - неразлучная пара.\\nВращаясь друг вокруг друга, они\\n"
"вырабатывают энергию."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 600: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/653
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 210, 206, 147
#: 0x1660dea
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/600"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/600"
msgstr ""
"Его тело состоит из большой и малой\\nшестерёнок. Если малая, брошенная\\n"
"во врага, не вернётся, он погибнет."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 601: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/654
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 209, 181, 40
#: 0x1660e54
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/601"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/601"
msgstr ""
"Шестерня с красным ядром вращается\\nна большой скорости, быстро\\n"
"накапливая энергию."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 602: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/655
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 186, 224, 119
#: 0x1660ea3
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/602"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/602"
msgstr ""
"Поодиночке они не очень сильны,\\nно цепочка из многих Тинамо\\nможет "
"быть мощной, как молния."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 603: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/656
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 208, 193, 162
#: 0x1660f04
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/603"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/603"
msgstr ""
"У этого покемона большой аппетит.\\nЗаметив добычу, он нападает на неё\\n"
"и парализует электричеством."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 604: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/657
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 183, 204, 142
#: 0x1660f6e
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/604"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/604"
msgstr ""
"Ртом-присоской он засасывает добычу,\\nа затем клыками бьёт жертву током."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 605: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/658
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 196, 207, 23
#: 0x1660fd2
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/605"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/605"
msgstr ""
"Слухи о его происхождении связаны\\nс местом крушения НЛО в пустыне\\n50 "
"лет назад."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 606: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/659
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 197, 195, 49
#: 0x1661022
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/606"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/606"
msgstr ""
"Психической силой он управляет\\nмозгом противника и изменяет\\nего "
"воспоминания."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 607: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/660
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 213, 212, 103
#: 0x1661075
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/607"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/607"
msgstr ""
"Обычно его пламя не горит, но, когда\\nон поглощает жизненную силу "
"людей\\nили покемонов, оно загорается."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 608: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/661
#. original lines: 2, widths px: 220, 153
#: 0x16610d8
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/608"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/608"
msgstr "Он появляется рядом с умирающими\\nи похищает душу из тела."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 609: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/662
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 199, 205, 38
#: 0x166111d
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/609"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/609"
msgstr ""
"Пламя Шанделюра сжигает душу\\nтого, кого охватит, оставляя\\nлишь тело."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 610: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/663
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 192, 205, 183
#: 0x1661170
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/610"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/610"
msgstr ""
"Его большие бивни часто ломаются,\\nно каждый раз отрастают снова,\\nещё "
"твёрже и прочнее."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 611: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/664
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 164, 225, 95
#: 0x16611da
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/611"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/611"
msgstr ""
"Их бивни способны крошить камни.\\nСхватки Фрэкшуров за территорию\\n"
"бывают крайне жестокими."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 612: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/665
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 215, 204, 124
#: 0x1661235
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/612"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/612"
msgstr ""
"Их прочные бивни остаются острыми,\\nдаже если рубить ими стальные "
"балки.\\nОни покрыты твёрдой бронёй."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 613: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/666
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 206, 180, 144
#: 0x1661299
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/613"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/613"
msgstr ""
"Когда ему нездоровится, слизь\\nу него в носу становится водянистой,\\nа "
"приёмы типа Лёд слабеют."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 614: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/667
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 206, 207, 86
#: 0x16612fb
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/614"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/614"
msgstr ""
"Замораживая своё дыхание, он создаёт\\nледяные клыки и когти. Обитает\\nв "
"холодных северных краях."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 615: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/668
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 216, 213, 28
#: 0x1661358
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/615"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/615"
msgstr ""
"Они рождаются в снежных тучах.\\nДобычу они ловят цепями\\nиз ледяных "
"кристаллов."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 616: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/669
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 201, 219, 98
#: 0x16613ac
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/616"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/616"
msgstr ""
"Если он и Каррабласт оказываются\\nвместе и получают электрический\\n"
"импульс, они оба эволюционируют."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 617: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/670
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 189, 207, 114
#: 0x166140c
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/617"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/617"
msgstr ""
"Сбросив тяжёлый панцирь, он становится\\nочень лёгким и сражается, "
"двигаясь,\\nкак ниндзя."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 618: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/671, table:species/1233
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 206, 220, 85
#: 0x166146b
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/618"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/618"
msgstr ""
"Когда противника не удаётся\\nпарализовать, он неожиданно быстро\\n"
"изворачивается и, шлёпая, удирает."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 619: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/672
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 216, 209, 137
#: 0x16614ca
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/619"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/619"
msgstr ""
"Он гордится тем, как быстро\\nприменяет приёмы. Недостаток силы\\nон "
"восполняет количеством."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 620: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/673
#. original lines: 2, widths px: 214, 180
#: 0x1661533
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/620"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/620"
msgstr "Длинной шерстью на руках они, словно\\nхлыстом, бьют противников."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 621: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/674
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 189, 207, 168
#: 0x166157c
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/621"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/621"
msgstr ""
"Он бегает по узким туннелям, прорытым\\nЭкскадриллами и Ониксами.\\n"
"Острыми когтями он ловит добычу."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 622: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/675
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 208, 171, 106
#: 0x16615e4
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/622"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/622"
msgstr ""
"Этого покемона вылепили из глины\\nс помощью древней науки.\\nОн "
"действует уже тысячи лет."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 623: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/676
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 211, 209, 39
#: 0x166163f
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/623"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/623"
msgstr ""
"Голарков создали, чтобы защищать людей\\nи покемонов. Они работают\\nна "
"таинственной энергии."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 624: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/677
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 206, 210, 125
#: 0x1661693
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/624"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/624"
msgstr ""
"Не обращая внимания на раны, они\\nнападают стаей, вонзая в добычу\\n"
"лезвия, покрывающие их тела."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 625: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/678
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 214, 220, 119
#: 0x16616f9
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/625"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/625"
msgstr ""
"Бишарп преследует добычу вместе\\nс большой стаей Поуниардов, а затем\\n"
"сам добивает жертву."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 626: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/679
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 208, 179, 51
#: 0x166175f
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/626"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/626"
msgstr ""
"Их пушистая шерсть гасит удар, даже\\nкогда они яростно бьют врагов "
"головой."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 627: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/680
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 203, 217, 147
#: 0x16617b1
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/627"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/627"
msgstr ""
"Они давят ягоды когтями.\\nСмело выступают против любого\\nпротивника, "
"каким бы сильным он ни был."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 628: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/681, table:species/1246
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 196, 218, 116
#: 0x166181a
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/628"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/628"
msgstr ""
"Чем больше у этих отважных небесных\\nвоинов шрамов, тем больше "
"уважения\\nони получают от сородичей."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 629: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/682
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 195, 202, 144
#: 0x166187b
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/629"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/629"
msgstr ""
"Обычно они прикрывают зад\\nподходящими костями, которые находят.\\nОни "
"преследуют слабых покемонов."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 630: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/683
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 212, 215, 97
#: 0x16618de
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/630"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/630"
msgstr ""
"Он искусно складывает гнездо из костей\\nсвоей добычи. Большинство "
"костей\\nпринадлежит Кьюбонам."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 631: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/684
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 210, 197, 102
#: 0x1661940
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/631"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/631"
msgstr ""
"Он дышит через отверстие в хвосте,\\nпока внутри у него горит огонь.\\n"
"Его добыча - Дюранты."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 632: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/685
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 191, 214, 92
#: 0x16619a1
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/632"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/632"
msgstr ""
"Дюранты роют гнёзда в горах.\\nОни прокладывают запутанные туннели,\\n"
"соединённые в лабиринты."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 633: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/686
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 207, 183, 132
#: 0x16619ff
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/633"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/633"
msgstr ""
"Он кусает всё подряд\\nи неразборчив в еде. Неосторожно\\nприближаться к "
"нему опасно."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 634: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/687
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 178, 223, 125
#: 0x1661a61
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/634"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/634"
msgstr ""
"Две его головы не ладят.\\nТа, что съест больше другой,\\nстановится "
"главной."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 635: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/688
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 207, 228, 125
#: 0x1661ac0
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/635"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/635"
msgstr ""
"Он нападает на всё, что движется.\\nЭтот страшный трёхголовый покемон\\n"
"пожирает всё на своём пути!"

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 636: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/689
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 192, 224, 100
#: 0x1661b27
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/636"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/636"
msgstr ""
"Он защищается пламенем. Давным-давно\\nлюди верили, что гнездо Ларвесты\\n"
"находится на солнце."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 637: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/690
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 170, 216, 134
#: 0x1661b86
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/637"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/637"
msgstr ""
"Когда вулканический пепел затмил\\nнебо, огонь Волкароны заменил солнце."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 638: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/691
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 210, 192, 129
#: 0x1661be6
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/638"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/638"
msgstr ""
"У него стальные тело и сердце.\\nОдного его взгляда хватит, чтобы\\nдаже "
"непокорный покемон подчинился."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 639: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/692
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 199, 213, 97
#: 0x1661c48
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/639"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/639"
msgstr ""
"Этот покемон встал на защиту\\nпокемонов, лишившихся крова\\nв войне "
"между людьми."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 640: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/693
#. original lines: 2, widths px: 198, 190
#: 0x1661ca5
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/640"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/640"
msgstr ""
"По легендам, этот покемон быстрыми\\nдвижениями сбивал противников с "
"толку."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 641: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/694, table:species/754
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 199, 218, 29
#: 0x1661ced
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/641"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/641"
msgstr ""
"Куда бы он ни полетел, он поднимает\\nтакие сильные ветры, что они "
"сдувают\\nвсё вокруг."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 642: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/695, table:species/755
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 184, 188, 119
#: 0x1661d41
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/642"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/642"
msgstr ""
"Там, где пролетел Тандурус, местность\\nусеяна бесчисленными "
"обугленными\\nостанками."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 643: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/696
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 202, 224, 110
#: 0x1661d9b
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/643"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/643"
msgstr ""
"Когда хвост Реширама вспыхивает,\\nтепловая энергия приводит в движение\\n"
"воздух и меняет погоду во всём мире."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 644: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/697
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 215, 191, 108
#: 0x1661dfe
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/644"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/644"
msgstr ""
"Этот покемон упоминается в легендах.\\nВ его хвосте есть огромный "
"генератор,\\nвырабатывающий электричество."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 645: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/698, table:species/756
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 172, 212, 163
#: 0x1661e5f
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/645"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/645"
msgstr ""
"Там, где побывал Ландорус, земля\\nдарит богатый урожай. Его величают\\n"
"“Хранителем полей”."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 646: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/699, table:species/752, table:species/753
#. original lines: 2, widths px: 215, 53
#: 0x1661ec4
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/646"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/646"
msgstr "Он может создавать сверххолодный\\nвоздух. Его тело заморожено."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 647: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/700, table:species/757
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 211, 183, 165
#: 0x1661ef6
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/647"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/647"
msgstr ""
"Он путешествует по миру, бегая\\nпо поверхности океанов и рек.\\n"
"Появляется на живописных берегах."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 648: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/701, table:species/746
#. original lines: 2, widths px: 220, 185
#: 0x1661f5e
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/648"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/648"
msgstr ""
"Многие известные песни навеяны\\nмелодиями, которые играет Мелоэтта."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 649: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/702, table:species/747, table:species/748, table:species/749, table:species/750
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 220, 214, 65
#: 0x1661fa8
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/649"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/649"
msgstr ""
"Команда Плазма переделала этого\\nдревнего покемона-насекомого\\nи "
"усовершенствовала пушку на спине."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 650: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/758
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 208, 204, 164
#: 0x1662003
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/650"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/650"
msgstr ""
"Его голову и спину покрывает такой\\nтолстый деревянный панцирь, что "
"его\\nне проймёт даже прямой удар грузовика."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 651: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/759
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 174, 164, 200
#: 0x166206d
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/651"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/651"
msgstr ""
"Полагаясь на прочный панцирь,\\nон отражает атаки хищников\\nи "
"контратакует острыми иглами."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 652: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/760
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 210, 198, 128
#: 0x16620d3
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/652"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/652"
msgstr ""
"Приняв защитную стойку и прикрыв\\nлицо кулаками, он может выдержать\\n"
"взрыв бомбы."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 653: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/761
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 211, 202, 20
#: 0x1662138
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/653"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/653"
msgstr ""
"Съев веточку, он наполняется\\nэнергией, а его широкие уши\\nвыпускают "
"очень горячий воздух."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 654: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/762
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 183, 200, 115
#: 0x166218a
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/654"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/654"
msgstr ""
"Трением шерсти на хвосте он\\nподжигает воткнутую в него веточку\\nи "
"бросается в бой."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 655: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/763
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 206, 217, 101
#: 0x16621ea
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/655"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/655"
msgstr ""
"Вглядываясь в пламя на своей ветке,\\nон сосредотачивается настолько,\\n"
"что может видеть будущее."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 656: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/764
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 212, 219, 142
#: 0x166224b
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/656"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/656"
msgstr ""
"Он выделяет пузыри из груди и спины.\\nПри нападении пузыри уменьшают\\n"
"урон, который он получает."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 657: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/765
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 201, 226, 84
#: 0x16622b3
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/657"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/657"
msgstr ""
"Его проворство не знает равных.\\nОн может взобраться на башню высотой\\n"
"более 600 м за минуту."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 658: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/766, table:species/839
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 177, 212, 37
#: 0x1662313
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/658"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/658"
msgstr ""
"Он создаёт из сжатой воды\\nметательные звёзды, способные\\nразрубить "
"металл надвое."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 659: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/767
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 180, 212, 45
#: 0x1662363
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/659"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/659"
msgstr "Они роют норы своими большими\\nушами и копают всю ночь напролёт."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 660: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/768
#. original lines: 2, widths px: 207, 200
#: 0x16623b4
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/660"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/660"
msgstr ""
"Его уши мощны, как экскаватор,\\nи могут раскрошить скальную породу."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 661: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/769
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 207, 203, 49
#: 0x16623fe
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/661"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/661"
msgstr ""
"Когда он взволнован, температура\\nего тела может удвоиться, и "
"выработка\\nгормонов резко возрастает."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 662: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/770
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 206, 205, 72
#: 0x1662455
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/662"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/662"
msgstr ""
"Уже сразу после взлёта он входит\\nпо скорости в число самых быстрых\\n"
"покемонов-птиц."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 663: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/771
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 184, 222, 165
#: 0x16624af
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/663"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/663"
msgstr ""
"Атакуя добычу, он может разогнаться\\nдо 500 км/ч. Жертву он добивает\\n"
"сокрушительным ударом лапы."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 664: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/772
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 177, 198, 163
#: 0x1662519
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/664"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/664"
msgstr ""
"Пыльца на его теле регулирует\\nтемпературу, поэтому он может жить\\nв "
"любой местности и любом климате."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 665: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/773
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 182, 201, 130
#: 0x166257d
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/665"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/665"
msgstr ""
"Птичьи клювы не могут даже\\nпоцарапать его прочное тело.\\nЗащищаясь, он "
"выбрасывает пыльцу."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 666: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/774, table:species/868, table:species/921, table:species/922, table:species/923, table:species/924, table:species/925, table:species/926, table:species/927, table:species/928, table:species/929, table:species/930, table:species/931, table:species/932, table:species/933, table:species/934, table:species/935, table:species/936, table:species/937, table:species/938
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 214, 174, 144
#: 0x16625dd
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/666"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/666"
msgstr ""
"Пёстрые узоры на крыльях этого\\nпокемона зависят от климата\\nи рельефа "
"места обитания."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 667: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/775
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 218, 204, 29
#: 0x1662640
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/667"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/667"
msgstr ""
"Чем сильнее противник, с которым\\nон сражается, тем больше жара и силы\\n"
"течёт по его телу."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 668: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/776, table:species/831
#. original lines: 2, widths px: 213, 150
#: 0x1662693
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/668"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/668"
msgstr "Самец с самой большой огненной\\nгривой - вожак прайда."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 669: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/777, table:species/840, table:species/841, table:species/842, table:species/843
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 214, 215, 131
#: 0x16626d6
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/669"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/669"
msgstr ""
"Она черпает потаённую силу цветов\\nи управляет ею. Цветок, который она\\n"
"держит, скорее всего, часть её тела."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 670: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/778, table:species/844, table:species/845, table:species/846, table:species/847, table:species/848
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 187, 181, 185
#: 0x166273e
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/670"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/670"
msgstr ""
"Когда на ухоженной клумбе\\nраспускаются цветы, она появляется\\nи "
"празднует это изящным танцем."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 671: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/779, table:species/849, table:species/850, table:species/851, table:species/852
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 184, 200, 147
#: 0x16627a3
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/671"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/671"
msgstr ""
"Её жизнь может длиться\\nнесколько сотен лет. Говорят, что она\\n"
"посвящает всю жизнь защите садов."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 672: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/780
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 215, 209, 112
#: 0x1662807
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/672"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/672"
msgstr ""
"Считается, что это один из первых\\nпокемонов, живших в согласии с "
"людьми.\\nУ него спокойный нрав."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 673: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/781
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 204, 194, 137
#: 0x166286b
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/673"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/673"
msgstr ""
"Они обитают в горных краях. Вожака\\nстада определяет поединок, в "
"котором\\nсоперники сшибаются рогами."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 674: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/782
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 205, 191, 39
#: 0x16628ce
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/674"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/674"
msgstr ""
"Он растёт, подражая поведению\\nПангоро, которого почитает\\nкак вожака."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 675: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/783
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 190, 218, 132
#: 0x166291f
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/675"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/675"
msgstr ""
"Этот покемон обладает большой\\nфизической силой. Многих тренеров\\n"
"покоряет и его живой нрав."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 676: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/784, table:species/859, table:species/860, table:species/861, table:species/862, table:species/863, table:species/864, table:species/865, table:species/866, table:species/867
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 183, 187, 120
#: 0x1662984
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/676"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/676"
msgstr ""
"В прошлом в регионе Калос\\nэтих покемонов назначали\\nстражами короля."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 677: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/785
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 174, 211, 174
#: 0x16629e0
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/677"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/677"
msgstr ""
"Орган, испускающий его мощную\\nпсихическую силу, прикрыт ушами,\\nчтобы "
"сила не просачивалась наружу."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 678: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/786, table:species/832
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 206, 214, 129
#: 0x1662a48
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/678"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/678"
msgstr ""
"При опасности он поднимает уши,\\nвыпуская психическую силу, способную\\n"
"стереть в пыль 10-тонный грузовик."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 679: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/787
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 182, 218, 150
#: 0x1662aae
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/679"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/679"
msgstr ""
"Он рождается, когда в меч вселяется\\nдух умершего. Вцепляется в людей\\n"
"и пьёт их жизненную силу."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 680: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/788
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 213, 197, 124
#: 0x1662b15
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/680"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/680"
msgstr ""
"Сложные комбинации ударов\\nдвух его мечей не остановить\\nдаже опытному "
"противнику."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 681: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/789, table:species/833
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 204, 198, 133
#: 0x1662b77
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/681"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/681"
msgstr ""
"Он способен распознать врождённые\\nзадатки лидера. Тому, кого он "
"признает,\\nсуждено стать королём."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 682: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/790
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 199, 197, 173
#: 0x1662bdb
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/682"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/682"
msgstr ""
"Его запах приводит в восторг всех,\\nкто его вдохнёт. Аромат меняется\\nв "
"зависимости от съеденной пищи."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 683: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/791
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 192, 214, 144
#: 0x1662c44
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/683"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/683"
msgstr ""
"Он придумывает разные запахи и, чтобы\\nполучить преимущество в бою,\\n"
"испускает те, что не нравятся врагам."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 684: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/792
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 214, 175, 34
#: 0x1662cac
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/684"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/684"
msgstr ""
"Он ест только сладости, поэтому\\nего шерсть липкая и сладкая,\\nкак "
"сахарная вата."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 685: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/793
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 183, 202, 157
#: 0x1662cfc
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/685"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/685"
msgstr ""
"Он способен различить тончайшие\\nзапахи. Своё обоняние он\\nпускает в "
"ход, помогая кондитерам."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 686: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/794
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 195, 198, 82
#: 0x1662d62
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/686"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/686"
msgstr ""
"Мигающими огоньками он приманивает\\nдобычу, а затем обвивает её\\n"
"длинными щупальцами."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 687: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/795
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 211, 202, 122
#: 0x1662dbc
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/687"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/687"
msgstr ""
"Его гипнотическая сила - самая мощная\\nсреди покемонов, и он "
"заставляет\\nокружающих делать что угодно."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 688: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/796
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 213, 214, 109
#: 0x1662e1f
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/688"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/688"
msgstr ""
"Два Байнакла живут на одной скале.\\nПоссорившись, один из них\\n"
"перебирается на другую скалу."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 689: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/797
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 214, 206, 94
#: 0x1662e82
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/689"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/689"
msgstr ""
"Эволюционируя, два Байнакла\\nпревращаются в семерых и сражаются\\nсилой "
"семи Байнаклов."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 690: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/798
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 186, 211, 96
#: 0x1662ee1
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/690"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/690"
msgstr ""
"Он точь-в-точь похож на гнилые\\nводоросли. Прячась от врагов,\\nон копит "
"силы для эволюции."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 691: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/799
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 196, 218, 37
#: 0x1662f3e
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/691"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/691"
msgstr ""
"Рассказывают о кораблях, которые\\nзаходили в моря, где обитают\\n"
"Драгалджи, и больше не возвращались."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 692: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/800
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 205, 195, 157
#: 0x1662f92
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/692"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/692"
msgstr ""
"Они сбивают летящую добычу,\\nстреляя из огромных клешней сжатой\\nводой, "
"словно из пистолета."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 693: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/801
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 218, 193, 70
#: 0x1662ffa
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/693"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/693"
msgstr ""
"Их огромные клешни выстреливают\\nводяными ядрами, которые могут\\n"
"пробить корпус танкера."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 694: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/802
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 202, 200, 140
#: 0x1663053
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/694"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/694"
msgstr ""
"В выростах по бокам его головы\\nесть клетки, которые вырабатывают\\n"
"электричество на солнечном свету."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 695: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/803
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 178, 187, 188
#: 0x16630b8
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/695"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/695"
msgstr ""
"Раскрыв воротник, он вырабатывает\\nэнергию. Её хватит, чтобы снабдить\\n"
"электричеством целый небоскрёб."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 696: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/804
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 226, 227, 122
#: 0x1663120
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/696"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/696"
msgstr ""
"Его огромные челюсти так разрушительны,\\nчто могут разжевать "
"автомобиль.\\nОн жил 100 миллионов лет назад."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 697: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/805
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 197, 216, 25
#: 0x1663189
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/697"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/697"
msgstr ""
"Ничто не могло остановить этого\\nпокемона 100 миллионов лет назад,\\n"
"поэтому он вёл себя как король."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 698: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/806
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 213, 208, 81
#: 0x16631db
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/698"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/698"
msgstr ""
"Этот спокойный покемон жил в холодном\\nкраю, где не водилось свирепых\\n"
"хищников, таких как Тайрантрам."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 699: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/807
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 205, 229, 106
#: 0x1663238
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/699"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/699"
msgstr ""
"У этого обычно тихого и доброго\\nпокемона температура поверхности тела\\n"
"около -150 градусов."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 700: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/808
#. original lines: 2, widths px: 182, 184
#: 0x166329b
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/700"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/700"
msgstr ""
"Чтобы унимать драки, он испускает\\nиз щупалец-лент успокаивающую ауру."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 701: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/809
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 169, 206, 143
#: 0x16632e0
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/701"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/701"
msgstr ""
"Хотя он невелик, благодаря\\nотточенным боевым навыкам он\\nне уступает "
"крупным громилам."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 702: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/810
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 193, 185, 145
#: 0x1663343
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/702"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/702"
msgstr ""
"Верхние усы служат ему датчиками,\\nследящими за всем вокруг.\\nНижние "
"усы стреляют электричеством."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 703: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/811
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 201, 206, 120
#: 0x16633a6
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/703"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/703"
msgstr ""
"Рождённый жаром и давлением в недрах\\nземли, он выпускает лучи из "
"камня\\nна голове."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 704: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/812
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 205, 214, 60
#: 0x1663408
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/704"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/704"
msgstr ""
"Он покрыт скользкой оболочкой,\\nс которой любые удары рук и ног\\n"
"соскальзывают, не причиняя вреда."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 705: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/813, table:species/1247
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 210, 198, 147
#: 0x1663462
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/705"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/705"
msgstr ""
"Он медленно ползает. В завитом\\nвыросте на его спине находятся\\nмозг и "
"другие органы."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 706: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/814, table:species/1248
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 204, 215, 141
#: 0x16634cb
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/706"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/706"
msgstr ""
"Удивительно дружелюбный покемон,\\nно, оставшись один, он тоскует\\nи "
"льёт липкие слёзы."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 707: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/815
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 186, 195, 73
#: 0x1663534
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/707"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/707"
msgstr ""
"Эти собиратели ключей грозят\\nнападающим, яростно звеня\\nперед ними "
"ключами."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 708: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/816
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 203, 209, 115
#: 0x1663589
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/708"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/708"
msgstr ""
"Он появляется, когда в гнилой пень\\nвселяется дух. Предпочитает жить\\nв "
"заброшенных лесах."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 709: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/817
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 202, 228, 91
#: 0x16635ec
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/709"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/709"
msgstr ""
"Он может свободно управлять\\nдеревьями. Тех, кто вредит лесу,\\nон "
"запирает так, что им не выбраться."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 710: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/818, table:species/853, table:species/854, table:species/855
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 199, 219, 69
#: 0x166364c
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/710"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/710"
msgstr ""
"Говорят, что он переносит\\nскитающихся духов туда, где им\\nместо, чтобы "
"они обрели покой."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 711: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/819, table:species/856, table:species/857, table:species/858
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 187, 209, 141
#: 0x16636a6
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/711"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/711"
msgstr ""
"Он обвивает добычу руками, похожими\\nна волосы, и радостно поёт,\\n"
"наблюдая за страданиями жертвы."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 712: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/820
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 203, 216, 132
#: 0x166370c
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/712"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/712"
msgstr ""
"Он отражает атаки противников\\nльдом, покрывающим его тело. Трещины\\nон "
"заделывает холодным воздухом."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 713: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/821, table:species/1249
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 215, 186, 111
#: 0x1663773
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/713"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/713"
msgstr ""
"Несколько Бергмайтов, теснящихся\\nу него на спине, делают его похожим\\n"
"на ледяной авианосец."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 714: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/822
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 206, 217, 97
#: 0x16637d2
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/714"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/714"
msgstr ""
"Они живут в кромешной тьме пещер.\\nИх огромные уши могут испускать\\n"
"ультразвук частотой 200000 герц."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 715: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/823
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 181, 207, 135
#: 0x1663832
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/715"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/715"
msgstr ""
"Этот вспыльчивый покемон атакует\\nвсё, что видит, ультразвуковыми\\n"
"волнами, способными крушить валуны."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 716: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/824, table:species/1101
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 193, 217, 133
#: 0x1663893
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/716"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/716"
msgstr ""
"Говорят, что, когда рога на его\\nголове сияют семью разными цветами,\\n"
"он делится вечной жизнью."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 717: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/825
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 181, 216, 165
#: 0x16638fa
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/717"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/717"
msgstr ""
"Когда его жизнь подходит к концу,\\nон поглощает жизненную энергию\\n"
"всего живого и превращается в кокон."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 718: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/826, table:species/835, table:species/836, table:species/837, table:species/838
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 215, 203, 93
#: 0x1663963
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/718"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/718"
msgstr ""
"Когда в экосистеме региона Калос\\nнарушается равновесие, он появляется\\n"
"и раскрывает свою тайную силу."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 719: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/827, table:species/918
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 205, 200, 99
#: 0x16639c3
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/719"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/719"
msgstr ""
"Сжимая между ладонями углерод\\nиз воздуха, он может мгновенно\\nсоздать "
"множество алмазов."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 720: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/828, table:species/829
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 201, 214, 102
#: 0x1663a21
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/720"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/720"
msgstr ""
"Он собирает понравившиеся вещи\\nи через своё кольцо телепортирует\\nих в "
"тайное место."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 721: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/830
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 203, 226, 119
#: 0x1663a81
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/721"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/721"
msgstr ""
"Он выпускает пар изнутри через\\nруки на спине. Его силы хватит,\\nчтобы "
"снести гору."

#. category: script; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 722: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/939
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 210, 213, 136
#: 0x1663ae6
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/722"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/722"
msgstr ""
"Ему спокойно в тесных тёмных\\nместах. Бывает, вьёт гнездо\\nв кармане "
"или сумке своего тренера."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 723: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/940
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 209, 200, 36
#: 0x1663b4e
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/723"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/723"
msgstr ""
"Во врагов или добычу он метает острые\\nперья-лезвия. Промахивается он "
"редко."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 724: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/941, table:species/1250
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 208, 181, 89
#: 0x1663ba1
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/724"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/724"
msgstr ""
"Обычно он хладнокровен и осторожен,\\nно, если застать его врасплох,\\n"
"его охватывает паника."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 725: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/942
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 191, 193, 141
#: 0x1663bfb
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/725"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/725"
msgstr ""
"Он не спешит показывать свои чувства.\\nЧтобы заслужить его доверие, "
"нужно\\nвремя. Он предпочитает одиночество."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 726: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/943
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 205, 204, 60
#: 0x1663c5f
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/726"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/726"
msgstr ""
"У него мощные передние лапы.\\nОдним ударом он может согнуть\\nжелезный "
"прут пополам."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 727: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/944
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 205, 190, 102
#: 0x1663cb7
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/727"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/727"
msgstr ""
"Когда в нём разгорается боевой дух,\\nпламя вокруг его пояса становится\\n"
"особенно жарким."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 728: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/945
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 205, 211, 65
#: 0x1663d16
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/728"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/728"
msgstr ""
"Шары, которые он надувает носом,\\nс каждым днём тренировок становятся\\n"
"всё больше."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 729: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/946
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 213, 200, 44
#: 0x1663d70
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/729"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/729"
msgstr ""
"Он атакует, обрушивая на врагов\\nвзрывающиеся водяные шары,\\nкоторые "
"сам же создаёт."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 730: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/947
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 210, 204, 107
#: 0x1663dc6
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/730"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/730"
msgstr ""
"Для Примарины каждый бой - сцена.\\nДобычу этот покемон одолевает\\n"
"прекрасными песнями и танцами."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 731: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/948
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 182, 230, 141
#: 0x1663e28
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/731"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/731"
msgstr ""
"С виду он хилый, но мышцы шеи\\nу него очень мощные. Он может\\nдолбить "
"дерево 16 раз в секунду!"

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 732: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/949
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 190, 213, 42
#: 0x1663e8d
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/732"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/732"
msgstr ""
"Сгибая кончик клюва, он может\\nиздавать по желанию\\nболее сотни "
"различных криков."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 733: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/950
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 205, 222, 92
#: 0x1663ee0
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/733"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/733"
msgstr ""
"Он известен тем, что образует\\nдружные пары, поэтому его приносят\\nна "
"свадьбы как талисман на удачу."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 734: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/951
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 201, 216, 28
#: 0x1663f40
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/734"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/734"
msgstr ""
"Он предпочитает есть свежую живую\\nпищу, поэтому расхаживает по улицам\\n"
"в поисках добычи."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 735: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/952
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 208, 196, 123
#: 0x1663f94
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/735"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/735"
msgstr ""
"Он терпелив по натуре, но теряет\\nсамообладание и бросается, завидев\\n"
"любимое лакомство - Раттату!"

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 736: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/953
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 195, 224, 99
#: 0x1663ff7
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/736"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/736"
msgstr ""
"Сильными челюстями он скоблит\\nдеревья и высасывает сок.\\nОбычно живёт "
"под землёй."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 737: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/954
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 209, 205, 106
#: 0x1664057
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/737"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/737"
msgstr ""
"Из переваренной пищи он вырабатывает\\nэлектричество и запасает эту "
"энергию\\nв электрическом мешке."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 738: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/955
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 198, 182, 136
#: 0x16640ba
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/738"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/738"
msgstr ""
"Он сбивает противников с толку\\nакробатическими манёврами в полёте.\\n"
"Так у него появляется шанс атаковать."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 739: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/956
#. original lines: 2, widths px: 194, 140
#: 0x166411b
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/739"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/739"
msgstr ""
"Его твёрдые клешни отлично подходят\\nи для нападения, и для защиты."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 740: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/957
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 200, 196, 147
#: 0x1664159
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/740"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/740"
msgstr ""
"Накопив холод в клешнях, он колотит\\nими врагов. Может разнести "
"вдребезги\\nдаже толстые ледяные стены!"

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 741: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/958, table:species/1043, table:species/1044, table:species/1045
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 220, 223, 186
#: 0x16641bf
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/741"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/741"
msgstr ""
"Этот Орикорио отведал красного\\nнектара. От его страстного танца враги\\n"
"воспламеняются и телом, и душой."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 742: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/959
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 206, 175, 154
#: 0x1664233
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/742"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/742"
msgstr ""
"Мириады Кьютифлаев порхают\\nнад головами людей, чья аура\\nпохожа на "
"ауру цветов."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 743: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/960
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 196, 203, 111
#: 0x1664295
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/743"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/743"
msgstr ""
"Некоторые пыльцевые шарики Рибомби\\nочень питательны. Иногда их "
"продают\\nкак пищевые добавки."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 744: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/961
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 187, 202, 45
#: 0x16642f4
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/744"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/744"
msgstr ""
"Когда он трётся о кого-то камнями\\nна шее, это доказательство его любви."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 745: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/962, table:species/1046, table:species/1082
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 211, 193, 45
#: 0x1664346
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/745"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/745"
msgstr ""
"Он прекрасно вооружён когтями\\nи клыками, а оружием ему служат\\nещё и "
"острые камни в гриве."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 746: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/963, table:species/1047
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 213, 227, 213
#: 0x166439a
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/746"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/746"
msgstr ""
"Они слабы, поэтому держатся косяками.\\nОднако их часто можно встретить\\n"
"и поодиночке, отбившимися от косяка."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 747: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/964
#. original lines: 2, widths px: 193, 208
#: 0x1664411
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/747"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/747"
msgstr ""
"Если отрезать любую часть его тела,\\nкроме головы, она быстро отрастёт."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 748: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/965
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 212, 207, 145
#: 0x166445c
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/748"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/748"
msgstr ""
"Он ползает по дну океана на 12 ногах,\\nоставляя за собой след из "
"кусочков\\nКорсол."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 749: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/966
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 188, 186, 68
#: 0x16644c5
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/749"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/749"
msgstr ""
"Грязь на копытах Мадбрея улучшает\\nсцепление с землёй и делает его бег\\n"
"ещё мощнее."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 750: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/967
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 201, 189, 130
#: 0x1664518
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/750"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/750"
msgstr ""
"Он может три дня без отдыха брести\\nпо горным дорогам, всё это время\\n"
"таща 10-тонный груз."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 751: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/968
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 201, 196, 168
#: 0x1664578
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/751"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/751"
msgstr ""
"В поисках еды он выползает на сушу.\\nПузырь с водой позволяет ему "
"дышать\\nи защищает его голову."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 752: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/969
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 208, 209, 143
#: 0x16645e0
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/752"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/752"
msgstr ""
"Он наносит удары головой в пузыре.\\nМелких покемонов затягивает "
"внутрь,\\nи они тонут."

#. category: script; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 753: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/970
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 213, 193, 118
#: 0x1664647
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/753"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/753"
msgstr ""
"Он обожает солнце.\\nЕсли регулярно греется в его лучах,\\nто вырастает с "
"яркой окраской."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 754: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/971
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 209, 204, 102
#: 0x16646aa
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/754"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/754"
msgstr ""
"Ради самозащиты он притворяется\\nпокемоном-насекомым. На обеих руках\\nу "
"него лепестки с острыми краями."

#. category: script; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 755: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/972
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 192, 209, 112
#: 0x1664709
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/755"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/755"
msgstr ""
"Он рассеивает мерцающие светящиеся\\nспоры. Всякий, кто увидит эти "
"огни,\\nпогружается в глубокий сон."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 756: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/973
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 197, 194, 158
#: 0x1664769
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/756"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/756"
msgstr ""
"Когда он начинает драться с Парасектом\\nза территорию, всё вокруг "
"целиком\\nпокрывается спорами!"

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 757: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/974
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 209, 206, 146
#: 0x16647d0
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/757"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/757"
msgstr ""
"Он сжигает жидкости своего тела,\\nсоздавая ядовитый газ, который\\n"
"изматывает врагов и сбивает их с ног."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 758: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/975
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 185, 212, 106
#: 0x1664839
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/758"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/758"
msgstr ""
"Саландитов, не сумевших принести\\nему еды, он наказывает яростным\\n"
"шлепком ладони, извергающей пламя."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 759: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/976
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 213, 214, 142
#: 0x1664898
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/759"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/759"
msgstr ""
"Стаффул не выносит объятий и любых\\nприкосновений. Он извивается, "
"бьётся\\nи вырывается с поразительной силой."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 760: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/977
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 216, 215, 132
#: 0x1664901
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/760"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/760"
msgstr ""
"Он обладает огромной физической силой.\\nМногие называют его самым "
"опасным\\nпокемоном региона Алола."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 761: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/978
#. original lines: 2, widths px: 211, 183
#: 0x1664969
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/761"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/761"
msgstr ""
"Из-за сладкого аппетитного аромата\\nна неё вечно охотятся покемоны-птицы."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 762: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/979
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 211, 197, 150
#: 0x16649b2
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/762"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/762"
msgstr ""
"Она скачет, вовсю размахивая\\nчашелистиками на голове. Когда она\\nими "
"хлещет, это довольно больно!"

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 763: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/980
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 210, 176, 160
#: 0x1664a1a
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/763"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/763"
msgstr ""
"Мастер великолепных и красивых ударов\\nногами, она одним ударом "
"нокаутирует\\nдаже чемпионов по кикбоксингу."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 764: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/981
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 202, 218, 119
#: 0x1664a80
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/764"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/764"
msgstr ""
"Ванны с цветами из его лозы\\nрасслабляют, поэтому он популярен\\nу "
"многих людей."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 765: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/982
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 205, 171, 47
#: 0x1664ae4
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/765"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/765"
msgstr ""
"Он славится выдающимся умом\\nи свысока смотрит на неопытных\\nтренеров."

#. category: code; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 766: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/983
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 195, 202, 169
#: 0x1664b35
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/766"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/766"
msgstr ""
"Они образуют группы по 20 особей.\\nИх связь удивительно крепка: они\\n"
"никогда не подведут товарища."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 767: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/984
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 203, 223, 141
#: 0x1664b9d
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/767"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/767"
msgstr ""
"Поразительно трусливый покемон.\\nЕсли что-то приближается, он удирает,\\n"
"стремительно перебирая ногами."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 768: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/985
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 183, 225, 90
#: 0x1664c07
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/768"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/768"
msgstr ""
"Молниеносным взмахом огромных острых\\nкогтей он рассекает надвое "
"морскую\\nводу - и даже воздух."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 769: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/986
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 213, 208, 137
#: 0x1664c65
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/769"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/769"
msgstr ""
"Этот покемон родился из песчаной\\nгорки, которую в игре построил "
"ребёнок,\\nи воплощает злобу умерших."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 770: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/987
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 220, 176, 128
#: 0x1664ccb
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/770"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/770"
msgstr ""
"Под замком погребены груды\\nвысохших костей тех, из кого он\\nвысосал "
"жизненные силы."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 771: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/988
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 213, 199, 152
#: 0x1664d2c
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/771"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/771"
msgstr ""
"Его тело покрыто слизью. Если\\nслучайно на него наступить, можно\\n"
"поскользнуться, а он ещё и рассердится!"

#. category: code; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 772: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/989
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 176, 201, 167
#: 0x1664d95
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/772"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/772"
msgstr ""
"Есть опасность, что он начнёт\\nбуйствовать, поэтому его истинная сила\\n"
"запечатана под сдерживающей маской."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 773: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/990, table:species/1048, table:species/1049, table:species/1050, table:species/1051, table:species/1052, table:species/1053, table:species/1054, table:species/1055, table:species/1056, table:species/1057, table:species/1058, table:species/1059, table:species/1060, table:species/1061, table:species/1062, table:species/1063, table:species/1064
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 205, 220, 148
#: 0x1664dfa
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/773"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/773"
msgstr ""
"Он сам уничтожил сдерживающую маску.\\nТеперь он может менять тип,\\n"
"вставляя особые диски памяти."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 774: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/991, table:species/1065, table:species/1066, table:species/1067, table:species/1068, table:species/1069, table:species/1070, table:species/1071
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 197, 210, 99
#: 0x1664e63
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/774"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/774"
msgstr ""
"Он питается пылью в атмосфере.\\nОт состава пыли зависит цвет\\nего ядра."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 775: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/992
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 198, 210, 148
#: 0x1664ec1
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/775"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/775"
msgstr ""
"Он спит с момента рождения.\\nПогрузившись в глубокий сон,\\nон совсем "
"перестаёт двигаться."

#. category: code; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 776: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/993
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 217, 204, 55
#: 0x1664f29
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/776"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/776"
msgstr ""
"Из ноздрей он извергает огонь\\nи ядовитые газы. Его помёт -\\nвзрывчатое "
"вещество."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 777: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/994
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 213, 196, 73
#: 0x1664f83
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/777"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/777"
msgstr ""
"Когда он удивлён или встревожен,\\n14 игл из шерсти на его спине\\n"
"непроизвольно встают дыбом."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 778: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/995, table:species/1072
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 203, 220, 126
#: 0x1664fdf
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/778"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/778"
msgstr ""
"Он скрывает свой жуткий облик\\nпод старой тряпкой, чтобы\\nсблизиться с "
"людьми и покемонами."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 779: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/996
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 196, 176, 179
#: 0x1665044
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/779"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/779"
msgstr ""
"Его кожа так толста, что шипы\\nей не страшны. Крепкими зубами он\\n"
"разгрызает шипы и съедает их."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 780: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/997
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 212, 215, 97
#: 0x16650ac
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/780"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/780"
msgstr ""
"Он появляется в городах и играет\\nс детьми. Если детям грозит "
"опасность,\\nДрампа их защищает."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 781: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/998
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 213, 186, 149
#: 0x166510e
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/781"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/781"
msgstr ""
"Опутав добычу зелёными водорослями,\\nон высасывает её жизненные силы.\\n"
"Мелкая добыча его не интересует."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 782: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/999
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 206, 217, 97
#: 0x1665174
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/782"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/782"
msgstr ""
"Они живут в горах, где не найти\\nи следа человека. Каждый из них\\n"
"растёт, сражаясь с другими."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 783: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1000
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 214, 183, 111
#: 0x16651d4
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/783"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/783"
msgstr ""
"С отважным криком он бросается\\nна добычу. Удары его чешуйчатых\\n"
"кулаков рвут противников в клочья."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 784: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1001
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 191, 189, 184
#: 0x1665232
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/784"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/784"
msgstr ""
"Он доблестно сражается кулаками,\\nзакованными в стальную чешую.\\n"
"Коронный удар Коммо-о - апперкот."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 785: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1002
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 218, 166, 137
#: 0x166529c
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/785"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/785"
msgstr ""
"Божество-хранитель острова Мелемеле\\nпризывает грозовые тучи и копит\\n"
"их молнии в своём теле."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 786: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1003
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 170, 216, 166
#: 0x16652fe
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/786"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/786"
msgstr ""
"Божество-хранитель острова Акала\\nпростодушно жестоко. Источник его\\n"
"энергии - благоухание цветов."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 787: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1004
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 217, 169, 106
#: 0x1665366
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/787"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/787"
msgstr ""
"Божество-хранитель острова Улаула -\\nленивый покемон. Он приказывает\\n"
"растениям обездвиживать врагов."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 788: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1005
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 212, 204, 155
#: 0x16653c2
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/788"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/788"
msgstr ""
"Божество-хранитель острова Пони\\nумеет управлять водой и создавать\\n"
"чистую воду, смывающую любую скверну."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 789: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1006
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 183, 205, 85
#: 0x166542b
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/789"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/789"
msgstr ""
"Его тело газообразно и хрупко.\\nОн медленно растёт, собирая пыль\\nиз "
"атмосферы."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 790: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1007
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 209, 155, 99
#: 0x1665483
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/790"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/790"
msgstr ""
"Поглощая свет, Космоем продолжает\\nрасти. Его золотая оболочка\\nна "
"удивление прочна."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 791: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1008
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 206, 195, 96
#: 0x16654db
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/791"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/791"
msgstr ""
"В письменах далёкого прошлого\\nего называют “зверем, пожирающим\\n"
"солнце”."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 792: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1009
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 218, 192, 146
#: 0x1665538
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/792"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/792"
msgstr ""
"Иногда он призывает в этот мир\\nнеизвестные силы и формы жизни\\nиз дыр, "
"ведущих в другие миры."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 793: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1010
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 210, 226, 97
#: 0x166559f
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/793"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/793"
msgstr ""
"Эту форму жизни из другого мира\\nназвали УЧ. Считается, что Нигилего\\n"
"вырабатывает сильный нейротоксин."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 794: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1011
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 202, 205, 109
#: 0x1665601
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/794"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/794"
msgstr ""
"Баззвол всюду хвастается своими\\nаномально раздутыми мышцами.\\nЭто один "
"из видов Ультрачудовищ."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 795: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1012
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 206, 223, 102
#: 0x1665661
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/795"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/795"
msgstr ""
"Одно из опасных Ультрачудовищ.\\nЕго видели бегущим по земле\\nс "
"потрясающей скоростью."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 796: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1013
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 222, 205, 126
#: 0x16656c4
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/796"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/796"
msgstr ""
"Он появился из Ультрачервоточины.\\nНапал на электростанцию, а значит,\\n"
"подзаряжается электричеством."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 797: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1014
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 205, 213, 101
#: 0x166572b
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/797"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/797"
msgstr ""
"Он появился из Ультрачервоточины.\\nПо словам очевидцев, он на большой\\n"
"скорости пронёсся по небу."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 798: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1015
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 197, 187, 33
#: 0x166578b
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/798"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/798"
msgstr ""
"Тело этого Ультрачудовища,\\nтонкое, как бумага, подобно\\nотточенному "
"мечу."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 799: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1016
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 201, 220, 150
#: 0x16657da
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/799"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/799"
msgstr ""
"Неизвестная форма жизни под названием\\nУЧ. Возможно, Газзлорд вечно "
"голоден:\\nон точно всегда что-то пожирает."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 800: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1017, table:species/1079, table:species/1080, table:species/1081
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 204, 187, 80
#: 0x1665844
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/800"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/800"
msgstr ""
"Источник его энергии - свет.\\nЕсли он не поглощает свет, в нём\\n"
"скапливаются примеси."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 801: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1018, table:species/1073
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 220, 191, 83
#: 0x166589f
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/801"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/801"
msgstr ""
"Его механическое тело - лишь сосуд.\\nЕго истинная сущность -\\nДушевное "
"сердце, искусственная душа."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 802: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1019
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 188, 196, 144
#: 0x16658fc
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/802"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/802"
msgstr ""
"Он прячется в чужих тенях, копируя\\nдвижения и силы их владельцев.\\n"
"Этот покемон малодушен и пуглив."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 803: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1074
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 204, 207, 56
#: 0x166595e
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/803"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/803"
msgstr ""
"Это Ультрачудовище настолько\\nпопулярно, что в родном мире\\nего "
"выбирают стартовым покемоном."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 804: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1075
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 170, 211, 166
#: 0x16659b6
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/804"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/804"
msgstr ""
"Он хранит в теле сотни литров ядовитой\\nжидкости. Это один из "
"организмов,\\nизвестных как УЧ."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 805: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1076
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 195, 216, 139
#: 0x1665a1d
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/805"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/805"
msgstr ""
"Когда каменные стены начали двигаться\\nи нападать, громилой оказалась\\n"
"эта загадочная форма жизни."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 806: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1077
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 177, 216, 124
#: 0x1665a85
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/806"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/806"
msgstr ""
"Он устраивает взрывы и, пока\\nпротивники не опомнились,\\nотнимает у них "
"жизненные силы."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 807: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1078
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 214, 213, 141
#: 0x1665ae6
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/807"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/807"
msgstr ""
"Он приближается к врагам со скоростью\\nмолнии, а затем острыми когтями\\n"
"разрывает их на части."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 808: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1083
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 198, 208, 216
#: 0x1665b50
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/808"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/808"
msgstr ""
"Он плавит частицы железа и других\\nметаллов из подпочвы, чтобы вобрать\\n"
"их в своё тело из расплавленной стали."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 809: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1084, table:species/1273
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 186, 191, 198
#: 0x1665bc4
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/809"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/809"
msgstr ""
"Когда-то его почитали за умение\\nсоздавать железо из ничего. Спустя\\n"
"3000 лет он вернулся к жизни."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 810: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1102
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 186, 215, 165
#: 0x1665c2e
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/810"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/810"
msgstr ""
"Он атакует частыми ударами палочки.\\nНанося удары с поразительной\\n"
"скоростью, он всё больше распаляется."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 811: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1103
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 208, 197, 167
#: 0x1665c98
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/811"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/811"
msgstr ""
"Чем быстрее Тваки отбивает ритм\\nдвумя палочками, тем больше\\nуважения "
"он завоёвывает у сородичей."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 812: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1104, table:species/1274
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 211, 222, 199
#: 0x1665d02
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/812"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/812"
msgstr ""
"Барабаня, он черпает силу своего\\nособого пня. В бою корни пня\\n"
"подчиняются его командам."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 813: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1105
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 198, 185, 163
#: 0x1665d78
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/813"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/813"
msgstr ""
"На его ступнях есть особые подушечки,\\nи ещё одна - на носу. Подушечки\\n"
"излучают огромный жар."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 814: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1106
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 196, 174, 122
#: 0x1665ddd
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/814"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/814"
msgstr ""
"Густой пушистый мех защищает его\\nот холода и позволяет применять\\n"
"более жаркие огненные приёмы."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 815: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1107, table:species/1275
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 197, 229, 125
#: 0x1665e39
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/815"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/815"
msgstr ""
"Он воодушевляется, когда его\\nподбадривают. Но, начав красоваться,\\nон "
"может угодить в переплёт."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 816: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1108
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 185, 175, 196
#: 0x1665e9f
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/816"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/816"
msgstr ""
"Когда он намокает, его кожа меняет\\nцвет, и этот покемон становится\\n"
"невидимым, словно замаскированный."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 817: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1109
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 209, 200, 152
#: 0x1665f07
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/817"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/817"
msgstr ""
"Он очень умён, но и очень ленив.\\nЧтобы не пускать врагов на свою\\n"
"территорию, повсюду ставит ловушки."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 818: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1110, table:species/1276
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 195, 195, 171
#: 0x1665f70
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/818"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/818"
msgstr ""
"Он выискивает слабые места врагов,\\nчтобы точно поражать их водой,\\n"
"бьющей из кончиков пальцев."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 819: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1111
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 189, 184, 59
#: 0x1665fda
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/819"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/819"
msgstr ""
"Этот покемон начинает тревожиться,\\nесли в его щеках совсем не "
"остаётся\\nягод."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 820: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1112
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 185, 184, 71
#: 0x166602a
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/820"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/820"
msgstr ""
"У этого покемона крепкие зубы:\\nон может прогрызть даже самую\\nтвёрдую "
"скорлупу ягод."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 821: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1113
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 208, 195, 207
#: 0x166607b
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/821"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/821"
msgstr ""
"Он отважно бросает вызов любому врагу,\\nкаким бы сильным тот ни был. "
"Даже\\nпоражение делает его немного сильнее."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 822: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1114
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 185, 219, 124
#: 0x16660ec
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/822"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/822"
msgstr ""
"Уроки многих тяжёлых боёв научили\\nего точно оценивать силу\\nпротивника."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 823: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1115, table:species/1277
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 190, 200, 45
#: 0x166614d
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/823"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/823"
msgstr ""
"Чёрный блеск его стального тела\\nможет вселить страх в сердце\\nлюбого "
"врага."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 824: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1116
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 196, 177, 124
#: 0x166619e
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/824"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/824"
msgstr ""
"Этот покемон без устали собирает\\nсведения и очень умён. А вот силой\\n"
"он не блещет."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 825: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1117
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 197, 190, 196
#: 0x16661fd
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/825"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/825"
msgstr ""
"Подрастая в панцире, он с помощью\\nпсихических способностей следит\\nза "
"всем вокруг и ждёт эволюции."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 826: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1118, table:species/1278
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 203, 219, 189
#: 0x166626d
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/826"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/826"
msgstr ""
"Он знаменит высоким интеллектом.\\nЕго крупный мозг - доказательство\\n"
"огромной психической силы."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 827: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1119
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 210, 224, 198
#: 0x16662e0
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/827"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/827"
msgstr ""
"Мягкие подушечки лап позволяют ему\\nбесшумно разорять чужие кладовые.\\n"
"Он живёт за счёт краденого."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 828: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1120
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 206, 197, 202
#: 0x1666357
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/828"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/828"
msgstr ""
"Гибкое тело и острые когти помогают\\nему повсюду воровать еду и яйца.\\n"
"Будущих жертв он тайком метит."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 829: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1121
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 193, 180, 191
#: 0x16663c7
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/829"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/829"
msgstr ""
"Он укореняется в земле и греется\\nна солнце. Вобрав достаточно света,\\n"
"он ярко расцветает."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 830: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1122
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 212, 226, 199
#: 0x1666431
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/830"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/830"
msgstr ""
"Семена в его хлопковом пухе полны\\nпитательных веществ. Он пускает их\\n"
"по ветру на пользу окружающим."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 831: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1123
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 207, 184, 177
#: 0x16664a7
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/831"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/831"
msgstr ""
"Если его руно слишком отрастёт,\\nон не сможет двигаться. Ткань из его\\n"
"шерсти на удивление прочна."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 832: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1124
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 201, 185, 133
#: 0x1666511
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/832"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/832"
msgstr ""
"Величественными рогами он\\nлишь привлекает противоположный пол,\\nа в "
"бою их никогда не использует."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 833: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1125
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 192, 207, 78
#: 0x1666571
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/833"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/833"
msgstr ""
"Похоже, зуд от режущихся зубов\\nзаставляет его щёлкать челюстями\\nна "
"всё, что оказывается перед ним."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 834: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1126, table:species/1279
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 214, 199, 201
#: 0x16665cc
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/834"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/834"
msgstr ""
"Челюстями, способными перекусить\\nстальной прут, этот крайне "
"агрессивный\\nпокемон впивается в несчастную добычу."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 835: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1127
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 211, 219, 219
#: 0x166663d
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/835"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/835"
msgstr ""
"Этот жадный покемон помогает людям\\nв работе только ради угощений.\\nНа "
"бегу он потрескивает электричеством."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 836: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1128
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 202, 191, 196
#: 0x16666b6
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/836"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/836"
msgstr ""
"Он пропускает через лапы электричество,\\nусиливая их. На полной скорости "
"легко\\nпревышает 90 км/ч."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 837: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1129
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 196, 204, 90
#: 0x1666724
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/837"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/837"
msgstr ""
"Он может носиться, как моноцикл,\\nдаже по неровной каменистой\\n"
"местности. Его питает горящий уголь."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 838: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1130
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 189, 181, 147
#: 0x1666780
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/838"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/838"
msgstr ""
"Быстро крутя ногами, он легко\\nразвивает скорость более 30 км/ч.\\n"
"Внутри него образуется уголь."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 839: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1131, table:species/1280
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 202, 215, 181
#: 0x16667e1
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/839"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/839"
msgstr ""
"Во время боя его угольная гора\\nраскаляется докрасна, опаляя\\nвсё "
"вокруг искрами."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 840: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1132
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 198, 203, 163
#: 0x1666851
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/840"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/840"
msgstr ""
"Сразу после рождения он забирается\\nв яблоко. От вкуса яблока зависит\\n"
"его эволюция."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 841: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1133, table:species/1281
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 213, 218, 202
#: 0x16668bb
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/841"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/841"
msgstr ""
"Он эволюционировал, съев кислое\\nяблоко. В щеках он хранит кислоту,\\n"
"способную вызвать химические ожоги."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 842: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1134, table:species/1282
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 199, 219, 152
#: 0x1666930
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/842"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/842"
msgstr ""
"Он эволюционировал, съев сладкое\\nяблоко. В старину дети ели его\\nна "
"перекус."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 843: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1135
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 205, 202, 107
#: 0x1666999
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/843"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/843"
msgstr ""
"Он выбрасывает песок из ноздрей\\nи, пока враг ослеплён, зарывается\\nв "
"землю и прячется."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 844: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1136, table:species/1283
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 201, 199, 215
#: 0x16669fa
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/844"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/844"
msgstr ""
"Сжимая тело, он выбрасывает из носа\\nболее 100 кг песка. Если песок\\n"
"заканчивается, он падает духом."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 845: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1137, table:species/1191, table:species/1192
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 208, 215, 195
#: 0x1666a6c
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/845"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/845"
msgstr ""
"Этот голодный покемон глотает\\nАррокуд целиком. Иногда он ошибается\\nи "
"пытается проглотить других покемонов."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 846: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1138
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 197, 204, 82
#: 0x1666ade
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/846"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/846"
msgstr ""
"Наевшись досыта, он становится\\nочень вялым. Тогда-то его\\nи "
"проглатывает Краморант."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 847: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1139
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 213, 223, 197
#: 0x1666b39
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/847"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/847"
msgstr ""
"Его челюсть остра, как копьё, и прочна,\\nкак сталь. Вращая хвостовые "
"плавники,\\nон мчится со скоростью более 100 узлов."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 848: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1140
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 209, 229, 218
#: 0x1666baf
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/848"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/848"
msgstr ""
"Он меняет химический состав яда,\\nвырабатывая электричество. "
"Напряжение\\nслабое, но он может вызвать паралич."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 849: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1141, table:species/1193, table:species/1284, table:species/1285
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 190, 175, 190
#: 0x1666c28
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/849"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/849"
msgstr ""
"Этот вспыльчивый и агрессивный\\nпокемон жадно пьёт стоячую воду,\\nчтобы "
"поглотить все токсины в ней."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 850: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1142
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 194, 207, 192
#: 0x1666c8f
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/850"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/850"
msgstr ""
"Он хранит в теле горючий газ\\nи вырабатывает из него жар, а затем\\n"
"обвивает добычу и поджаривает её."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 851: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1143, table:species/1286
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 200, 210, 166
#: 0x1666cfd
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/851"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/851"
msgstr ""
"У этого крайне враждебного\\nпокемона, помимо опасного пылающего\\nтела, "
"большие и очень острые клыки."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 852: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1144
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 191, 210, 130
#: 0x1666d69
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/852"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/852"
msgstr ""
"Он очень любопытен, но изучает\\nпредметы, пытаясь ударить\\nих "
"щупальцами."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 853: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1145
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 204, 228, 231
#: 0x1666dce
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/853"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/853"
msgstr ""
"В поисках противника, с которым можно\\nпомериться мастерством, он "
"выходит\\nна сушу. После боя возвращается в море."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 854: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1146, table:species/1194
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 185, 193, 159
#: 0x1666e4a
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/854"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/854"
msgstr ""
"Говорят, что этот покемон родился,\\nкогда одинокий дух вселился\\nв "
"остывшую недопитую чашку чая."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 855: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1147, table:species/1195
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 206, 200, 208
#: 0x1666ead
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/855"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/855"
msgstr ""
"Этот вид живёт в старинных чайниках.\\nБольшинство чайников - подделки,\\n"
"но изредка встречаются подлинники."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 856: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1148
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 185, 179, 179
#: 0x1666f20
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/856"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/856"
msgstr ""
"Выростом на голове она чувствует\\nэмоции других существ. Любит места,\\n"
"где нет людей."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 857: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1149
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 198, 186, 161
#: 0x1666f86
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/857"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/857"
msgstr ""
"Кто бы ни приблизился к этому покемону,\\nиспытывая сильные эмоции, "
"Хаттрем\\nжестоко заставит его умолкнуть."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 858: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1150, table:species/1287
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 207, 215, 195
#: 0x1666fec
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/858"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/858"
msgstr ""
"Её называют Лесной ведьмой. Того,\\nкто слишком шумит рядом, могут\\n"
"разорвать когти на её щупальце."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 859: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1151
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 201, 195, 156
#: 0x166705e
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/859"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/859"
msgstr ""
"Он пробирается в дома людей,\\nотбирая и поглощая негативную\\nэнергию "
"раздражённых жильцов."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 860: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1152
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 206, 194, 166
#: 0x16670c5
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/860"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/860"
msgstr ""
"Он хитростью заманивает людей\\nв лес. Некоторые верят, что он\\nобладает "
"силой взращивать урожай."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 861: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1153, table:species/1288
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 184, 215, 195
#: 0x166712d
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/861"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/861"
msgstr ""
"Его волосы работают как мышечные\\nволокна. Распускаясь, они хватают\\n"
"врагов и опутывают их, словно щупальца."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 862: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1154
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 213, 212, 211
#: 0x166719d
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/862"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/862"
msgstr ""
"Он эволюционировал после множества\\nдрак. Скрестив руки, он издаёт "
"крик,\\nот которого вздрогнет любой."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 863: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1155
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 202, 202, 168
#: 0x1667214
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/863"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/863"
msgstr ""
"То, что кажется железным шлемом, -\\nна самом деле затвердевшая шерсть.\\n"
"Этот покемон живёт ради азарта битвы."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 864: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1156
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 199, 221, 138
#: 0x166727e
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/864"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/864"
msgstr ""
"С эктоплазменным телом вокруг его\\nдуши нужно быть начеку: если его\\n"
"коснуться, можно окаменеть."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 865: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1157
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 207, 231, 59
#: 0x16672e6
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/865"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/865"
msgstr ""
"Отразив атаки твёрдым щитом из листа,\\nон наносит ответный удар острым\\n"
"стеблем лука-порея."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 866: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1158
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 190, 212, 165
#: 0x1667346
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/866"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/866"
msgstr ""
"Благодаря забавным движениям\\nон очень популярен. Психическую силу\\nон "
"выпускает через узор на животе."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 867: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1159
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 197, 203, 187
#: 0x16673af
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/867"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/867"
msgstr ""
"Его теневого тела касаться нельзя:\\nможно увидеть жуткие воспоминания,\\n"
"стоящие за вырезанным на нём рисунком."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 868: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1160
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 198, 202, 73
#: 0x166741c
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/868"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/868"
msgstr ""
"Говорят, что любую кондитерскую,\\nкоторую посетит Милсери, ждут\\nуспех "
"и удача."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 869: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1161, table:species/1196, table:species/1197, table:species/1198, table:species/1199, table:species/1200, table:species/1201, table:species/1289
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 199, 197, 158
#: 0x1667474
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/869"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/869"
msgstr ""
"Она эволюционировала из Милсери,\\nдержавшей Конфету-ягодку.\\nВкус "
"зависит от того, как её смешали."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 870: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1162
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 209, 215, 206
#: 0x16674d9
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/870"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/870"
msgstr ""
"Все шестеро действуют как одно целое.\\nКомандная работа - и их тактика в "
"бою:\\nони постоянно меняют построение."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 871: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1163
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 200, 219, 183
#: 0x166754d
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/871"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/871"
msgstr ""
"Он питается водорослями, соскребая\\nих зубами с камней. С кончиков\\nего "
"игл течёт электрический ток."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 872: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1164
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 185, 191, 124
#: 0x16675be
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/872"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/872"
msgstr ""
"Он ест снег, скопившийся на земле.\\nЧем больше снега он съест,\\nтем "
"крупнее вырастают его шипы."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 873: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1165
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 164, 177, 76
#: 0x166761b
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/873"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/873"
msgstr ""
"Когда он летит над полями и горами,\\nс его крыльев, словно снег, "
"сыплется\\nледяная чешуя."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 874: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1166
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 198, 212, 179
#: 0x166766b
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/874"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/874"
msgstr ""
"Раз в год в определённый день и час\\nэти покемоны будто из ниоткуда\\n"
"собираются и выстраиваются в круг."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 875: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1167, table:species/1202
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 189, 220, 191
#: 0x16676d7
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/875"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/875"
msgstr ""
"Его принесло океанским течением\\nиз ледяных краёв. Голову он всегда\\n"
"держит во льду, чтобы не согреться."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 876: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1168, table:species/1203
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 222, 210, 223
#: 0x1667746
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/876"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/876"
msgstr ""
"Рогами он улавливает эмоции\\nокружающих существ. Самцы служат\\n"
"камердинерами у своих хозяев."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 877: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1169, table:species/1204
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 203, 214, 165
#: 0x16677bf
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/877"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/877"
msgstr ""
"Поедая семена, запасённые в мешочках,\\nон утоляет вечный голод и "
"заодно\\nвырабатывает электричество."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 878: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1170
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 193, 224, 197
#: 0x166782d
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/878"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/878"
msgstr ""
"Работу, требующую немалой силы,\\nКуфант выполняет отлично. В дождь его\\n"
"медное тело тускнеет и зеленеет."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 879: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1171, table:species/1290
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 189, 201, 194
#: 0x16678a0
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/879"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/879"
msgstr ""
"Эти покемоны живут стадами.\\nХватка их хоботов невероятно сильна -\\nона "
"способна раздавить огромные камни."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 880: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1172
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 175, 219, 118
#: 0x166790d
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/880"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/880"
msgstr ""
"Электричество вырабатывают мощные\\nмышцы его хвоста. Верхняя половина\\n"
"его тела явно слишком мала."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 881: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1173
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 210, 223, 150
#: 0x166796f
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/881"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/881"
msgstr ""
"Электричество он вырабатывает,\\nдрожа промёрзшей верхней половиной\\n"
"тела. Ходить ему трудно."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 882: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1174
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 212, 224, 168
#: 0x16679dc
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/882"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/882"
msgstr ""
"Мощные ноги позволяют ему бегать\\nсо скоростью более 60 км/ч,\\nно "
"дышать он может только под водой."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 883: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1175
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 184, 200, 146
#: 0x1667a4c
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/883"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/883"
msgstr ""
"Кожа на его морде неуязвима\\nдля атак, но он всё равно вымер\\nиз-за "
"проблем с дыханием."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 884: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1176, table:species/1291
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 191, 200, 171
#: 0x1667ab0
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/884"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/884"
msgstr ""
"Его тело похоже на полированный\\nметалл - лёгкое и прочное. Однако\\nоно "
"легко ржавеет."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 885: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1177
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 208, 228, 206
#: 0x1667b19
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/885"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/885"
msgstr ""
"Возродившись призраком, Дрипи\\nскитается там, где обитал при жизни\\nв "
"доисторических морях."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 886: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1178
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 210, 203, 180
#: 0x1667b90
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/886"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/886"
msgstr ""
"Он может летать со скоростью более\\n200 км/ч. Сражается бок о бок\\nс "
"Дрипи и нянчится с ними до эволюции."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 887: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1179
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 209, 215, 109
#: 0x1667bfd
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/887"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/887"
msgstr ""
"Похоже, Дрипи, сидящие в его рогах,\\nс нетерпением ждут, когда их\\n"
"выпустят со сверхзвуковой скоростью."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 888: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1180, table:species/1205
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 211, 188, 167
#: 0x1667c5f
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/888"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/888"
msgstr ""
"Он много лет спал. Одни говорят,\\nчто это старшая сестра Земазенты,\\n"
"другие - что они соперники."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 889: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1181, table:species/1206
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 199, 219, 195
#: 0x1667cc8
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/889"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/889"
msgstr ""
"Он спал целые эпохи в облике статуи\\nи проспал так долго, что люди "
"забыли\\nо самом его существовании."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 890: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1182, table:species/1207
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 192, 190, 191
#: 0x1667d39
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/890"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/890"
msgstr ""
"Он находился внутри метеорита,\\nупавшего 20000 лет назад. Жить ему\\n"
"позволяет энергия, поглощаемая ядром."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 891: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1183
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 207, 209, 212
#: 0x1667da3
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/891"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/891"
msgstr ""
"Стоит ему потянуть длинную белую прядь\\nна голове, как его боевой дух "
"крепнет,\\nа из глубины живота поднимается сила."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 892: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1184, table:species/1208, table:species/1292, table:species/1293
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 201, 200, 217
#: 0x1667e19
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/892"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/892"
msgstr ""
"Он живёт в горах далёкого региона\\nи носится по отвесным скалам,\\n"
"тренируя ноги и оттачивая приёмы."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 893: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1185, table:species/1209
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 200, 213, 201
#: 0x1667e8f
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/893"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/893"
msgstr ""
"Оторвавшись от его тела, лианы\\nстановятся питательными веществами\\nв "
"почве и помогают расти лесу."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 894: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1186
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 224, 215, 232
#: 0x1667f01
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/894"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/894"
msgstr ""
"Всё его тело - это орган, который\\nвырабатывает электричество. Он "
"может\\nснабдить электричеством целый регион."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 895: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1187
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 202, 221, 172
#: 0x1667f7e
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/895"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/895"
msgstr ""
"Его тело состоит из кристаллизованной\\nдраконьей энергии. Говорят, что в "
"нём\\nсила всех покемонов типа Дракон."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 896: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1188
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 182, 214, 177
#: 0x1667feb
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/896"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/896"
msgstr ""
"Гластрир обладает огромной\\nфизической силой. Маска на его морде\\nв 100 "
"раз прочнее алмаза."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 897: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1189
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 187, 194, 222
#: 0x1668056
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/897"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/897"
msgstr ""
"Мчась сквозь ночь, он поглощает\\nжизненную энергию спящих покемонов.\\n"
"Он жаждет тишины и одиночества."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 898: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1190, table:species/1210, table:species/1211
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 218, 222, 222
#: 0x16680c6
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/898"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/898"
msgstr ""
"Каждое его движение полно достоинства\\nи грации. Он очень умён и, "
"говорят,\\nвидит прошлое, настоящее и будущее."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 899: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1251
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 223, 221, 85
#: 0x1668142
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/899"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/899"
msgstr ""
"Шерсть, выпавшая из его бороды, хорошо\\nдержит тепло и служит очень "
"полезным\\nматериалом для зимней одежды."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 900: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1252
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 209, 204, 124
#: 0x16681a5
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/900"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/900"
msgstr ""
"Буйное существо, которое рубит\\nвысоченные деревья грубыми топорами\\nи "
"защищается твёрдым камнем."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 901: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1253
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 212, 187, 132
#: 0x166820a
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/901"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/901"
msgstr ""
"Болотистая местность дала Урсалуне\\nмощное телосложение и новую\\n"
"способность свободно управлять торфом."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 902: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1254, table:species/1255
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 221, 200, 162
#: 0x166826c
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/902"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/902"
msgstr ""
"Он облачается в души сородичей,\\nпогибших, так и не достигнув цели -\\n"
"подняться вверх по реке."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 903: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1256
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 192, 207, 182
#: 0x16682d9
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/903"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/903"
msgstr ""
"У него сильнейший яд и устрашающая\\nфизическая мощь. Этот вид "
"предпочитает\\nодиночество и не сбивается в стаи."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 904: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1257
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 171, 170, 115
#: 0x1668346
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/904"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/904"
msgstr ""
"За похожие на копья шипы и свирепый\\nнрав его прозвали “морским демоном”."

#. category: data-table; mode: field
#. pointer table pokedex_entries, record 905: Pokedex entry text: record i is the entry of national dex i; every species the [pokedex.dex.map] maps onto that dex number shows this text, the forms included
#. species: table:species/1258, table:species/1259
#. original lines: 3, widths px: 221, 214, 89
#: 0x166839b
msgctxt "table:pokedex_entries/905"
msgid "table:pokedex_entries/905"
msgstr ""
"По легенде, от любви этого покемона\\nпо всей земле пробуждается\\nновая "
"жизнь."
